or such items.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; Perishable goods: We do not transport perishable goods such as food and plants so you have to make arrangements for this.<br />\r\n&bull; Pets: We do not transport pets and other arrangements are to be made for their travel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8. Privacy and Confidentiality Policy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; Confidentiality: We honor your privacy and ensure confidentiality with respect to personal or financial information and only with your permission do we release information pertaining to you to any third party.<br />\r\n&bull; Security of Belongings: With the utmost care and security your belongings are handled and we ensure the safety of your goods throughout the entire moving procedure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9. Special Items Handling Policy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&bull; High-Value or Fragile Items: For fragile, valuable, or delicate items such as antiques, artwork, or electronics we offer special handling and packing methods and custom packaging materials are used to ensure safe transportation of these items.<br />\r\n&bull;Furniture Disassembly and Reassembly: We provide disassembly and reassembly of larger furniture and our team will dismantle items such as beds, tables, and cabinets and reassemble them in your new place.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Jind, our primary policy is designed towards making convenience first and always keeping your belongings secure and delivered in time. Our focus area will be to provide the moving service professionally, reliably, and most importantly customer-oriented. You can always reach out to our team in case of further queries or concerning your specific moving requirements.</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Jind | Affordable Relocation Services', 'Packers and Movers Jind, Movers in Jind, Relocation Services Jind, Household Shifting Jind, Office Shifting Jind, Vehicle Transport Jind, Local Packers Jind, Jind Moving Company', 'Looking for trusted Packers and Movers in Jind? Get professional and affordable home, office and vehicle shifting services with safe packing, fast delivery and complete relocation support.', '2025-03-03 23:30:37', '2025-06-30 20:49:34'),
