rates or multi-layer packaging may be used for packing them.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Vehicle entry time/ society gate rules</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Loading/unloading in some societies of DLF Phase 1 is done only on time-bound permission.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Weekend or Night Moving Option</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>If you want to move at night or on Sunday, it may bring some additional charges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Why is our pricing considered the most reliable?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔎 No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>📄 Free Survey before Quotation</li>\r\n	<li>💬 All information in advance, no surprises in final bill</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Transparent Price Breakdown on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>📋 On-site Payment and GST Invoice available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 Example: Local Shifting of 2 BHK House &ndash; DLF Phase 1 to Sushant Lok</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Service Estimated Price</li>\r\n	<li>Packing Material ₹1,000 &ndash; ₹1,500</li>\r\n	<li>Labour Charges ₹2,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</li>\r\n	<li>Truck ₹1,500 &ndash; ₹2,000</li>\r\n	<li>Total (Including GST) ₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>💬 Note: These charges are approximate and we always conduct a small free survey to know the exact price. This gives you clarity and accurate rates.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🛡️ Why Choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 1?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to safe, timely and reliable shifting in DLF Phase 1 Gurgaon, ShiftingPort is a name trusted by thousands of families and businesses. Whether you live in Hamilton Court Apartments, or Beverly Park, Silver Oaks, E-Block Villas or Qutub Enclave &ndash; we have earned trust with our professional and emotive packing services everywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Find out below why more than 90% of DLF Phase 1 clients chose ShiftingPort for their re-shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 1. Local Expertise of DLF Phase 1</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know every street, society and traffic route of DLF Phase 1 inside out &ndash;<br />\r\n🏢 Such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>E Block, F Block, A Block, B Block,</li>\r\n	<li>Beverly Park 1 &amp; 2, Hamilton Court, Richmond Park,</li>\r\n	<li>DLF Qutub Enclave,</li>\r\n	<li>DLF City Club,</li>\r\n	<li>DLF Phase 1 Market Area,&nbsp;and nearby metro stations like MG Road, Sikanderpur, Arjun Marg.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This local knowledge enables us to complete your shifting on time, without any delays, without any tension and without any interruptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 2. Transparent &amp; Affordable Pricing</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Fix Quotation after Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>💸 Local &amp; Intercity Best Price Guarantee for DLF Phase 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We know that in a high-profile area like DLF, customers need not just luxury but also reliability and transparency.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 3. Trained, Verified &amp; Courteous Staff</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ Our team is fully trained.</li>\r\n	<li>🔐 All staff are verified, in uniform and come with company ID.</li>\r\n	<li>🤝 Every item in your home is handled with love and understanding as if it were their own.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 4. High-Quality Packing for Valuable Homes</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 1 houses often have &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📺 LED TVs, 🖼️ Artworks, 🛏️ Imported Beds, 🪞Glass Furniture, 🎹 Piano, and Expensive Kitchen Crockery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We use:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🛡️ 5 Layer Protection</li>\r\n	<li>📄 Anti-Scratch Foam Sheets</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Thermocol Corners, Bubble Wraps, Furniture Blankets</li>\r\n	<li>🪵 Wooden Crates for Glass/Marble Items</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 5. Fast &amp; Time-Bound Delivery</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know that the time window for shifting in DLF gated societies is very limited. That&#39;s why we always:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚛 Deliver trucks on time</li>\r\n	<li>⏱️ Loader team arrives in advance</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Confirm Lift Access, Parking Permission in advance<