(65, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 4, 1, 1, 1, 4, 'Packers and Movers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon', 'Packers and Movers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon', 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-dlf-phase-3', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort offers professional home, office, and car/bike shifting in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon. Trusted by residents of Belvedere Towers & Heritage City. Call now for safe, fast, and affordable relocation.', '<h2>🏡 Shifting Needed in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon and Why ShiftingPort is Your First Choice?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 3, Gurgaon &mdash; This area is not only a prestigious and well-maintained residential area, but also has a high standard of living and infrastructure. Well-known colonies and societies like U Block, V Block, Nathupur Village, Moulsari Avenue and Ambience Island are present here which give it a premium and cosmopolitan touch. The proximity to Ambience Mall, Cyber ​​City and NH-48 makes it ideal for both business and family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When you want to shift your home, office or vehicle in such a premium area, you need a reliable, professional and experienced Packers and Movers &mdash; and this is the reason why people make ShiftingPort their first choice in DLF Phase 3.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ ShiftingPort &ndash; Because here shifting is an experience, not just a service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort doesn&rsquo;t just transport your belongings from A to B, we transport your emotions, memories and valuables from one place to another with safety and respect. Our motto is &mdash; &ldquo;Premium Shifting Experience for Premium Location&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Our Specialties that make us different in DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💼 Experience in High-Profile and Society-Based Shifting</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Safety and Precautions with Multi-Layer Packing</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 On-time Pickup and On-Dot Delivery (98% Success Rate)</li>\r\n	<li>💬 24x7 Customer Support and Live Tracking Facility</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Pre-Managed Society NOC, Lift Booking and Entry Pass</li>\r\n	<li>💰 Neat and Transparent Charges &ndash; No Hidden Fees</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 We are present in every corner of DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ U Block, V Block, W Block</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Nathupur Village (under DLF Enclave)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Moulsari Avenue</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Ambience Island Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>✅ DLF Belvedere Park &amp; ​​DLF Belvedere Tower</li>\r\n	<li>✅ DLF Oakwood Estate</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Heritage City Phase 1 (DLF 3)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Railway Road and all lanes up to NH-48</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are where you are &mdash; on time, safely, and professionally.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Main shifting services we offer:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏠 Domestic Shifting (1BHK to 5BHK)</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Office &amp; Startup Moving</li>\r\n	<li>🛻 Local Shifting &ndash; within DLF 3 or to Cyber ​​City, MG Road, etc.</li>\r\n	<li>🚗 Car &amp; Bike Transportation</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Packing, Unpacking &amp; Storage Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧍&zwj;♂️ Why DLF Phase 3 customers choose us?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;From Ambience Island to Nathupur, ShiftingPort trucks are on time, staff is in uniform, and every detail is handled with care. It&rsquo;s not just shifting here &mdash; it&rsquo;s a new beginning with respect.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📍 What areas, blocks and societies do we cover in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The biggest advantage of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is that we know every corner, every lane and every block of DLF Phase 3 in detail. Our local experience and in-depth understanding of the area makes shifting not only easy but also quick and organized.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Here is a look at the areas we serve in DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 U Block and V Block</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This area of ​​DLF Phase 3 is a preferred location for mid-segment flats, independent houses and families. Despite the limited parking, narrow lanes and lack of lift facilities in the homes here, our team packs and shifts the goods without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff has done 50+ shiftings in U Block &ndash; moving goods from ground floor to top floor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Moulsari Avenue and Heritage City</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This premium zone of DLF Phase 3 is known for high-end apartments and gated societies. Societies like Heritage City have very strict NOC, lift timings and society protocols &mdash; but we have a ready SOP in place, which ensures that the move is completed without any delay.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Nathupur Village (under DLF 3)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This area is a mix of traditional and new homes in DLF Phase 3. There are also small houses, joint family houses and PGs. Our team uses small vehicles to carry out swift shifting in the narrow lanes of Nathupur. Our team has full experience of small vehicles and manual loading.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 DLF Belvedere Park and Belvedere Tower</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>High-profile customers living in these luxury societies of DLF Phase 3 are extremely satisfied with us. We have full experience of lift timings, move-in slots and security rules here. Our staff coordinates with the society management in advance to ensure a smooth shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Ambience Island Apartments &ndash; One of the most popular locations in DLF Phase 3.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most of the customers here live in 3BHK and 4BHK flats. At Ambience Island, our truck reaches the basement where prior permission is required for loading/unloading. The ShiftingPort Logistic Manager takes care of all this in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Areas up to Railway Road, Sikanderpur and Cyber ​​Hub Extension</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>These areas on the outer boundaries of DLF Phase 3 are new and transitioning housing zones. Shifting requests come in on short notice &ndash; and we can be at your doorstep with a team within 3 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚛 We know all the DLF Phase 3 moving challenges:</li>\r\n	<li>🔐 Entry &amp; Exit Gate Rules</li>\r\n	<li>🕐 Lift Booking Timings</li>\r\n	<li>🚚 Truck Parking Limitations</li>\r\n	<li>👮&zwj;♂️ Coordination with Society Guards and Management</li>\r\n	<li>📄 Society Gatepass &amp; ID Requirements</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team works on an advance checklist for all these.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📌 If you are living in any Society, Block or Independent Villa in DLF Phase 3 &ndash; ShiftingPort team is 100% ready for you.</strong></p>', '<h2>🌟 ShiftingPort &ndash; Why is ShiftingPort the most trusted Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 3, Gurgaon is a locality full of diversity &ndash; from high-end apartments like Heritage City to traditional homes like Nathupur Village. Shifting here is not just a &ldquo;goods transfer&rdquo; but a complex process &ndash; requiring professional understanding, local experience and emotional connection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is the first choice of 100+ customers in DLF Phase 3 because we are:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Trusted Brand &ndash; Where Promises Are Kept</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not an unknown truck operator, we are a professional team that has done many successful shiftings in DLF Phase 3 like:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ 4BHK shifting in Heritage City</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Luggage transfer from U-Block to Ardee City</li>\r\n	<li>✅ weekend corporate relocation from Belvedere Park to Sushant Lok</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>There is no fear, no delay in our service &ndash; only trust and the best experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👨&zwj;🔧 2. Trained and Uniformed Staff</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff for gated societies and professional areas of DLF Phase 3:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ Comes with full uniform and ID</li>\r\n	<li>🎓 Equipped with special training &ndash; Expert in packing electronics, furniture, crockery</li>\r\n	<li>🤝 Treats every customer politely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We take responsibility, not goods</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. 5-layer packing and special packing material</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Be it your expensive LED TV in Belvedere Tower, your imported glass dining table in Heritage City, or your antique idols in Nathupur &mdash; every item gets:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Bubble Wrap + Foam Sheets</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Stretch Film + Corrugated Sheets</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Wooden Crate (as required)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We do every packing with a &ldquo;Damage-Free&rdquo; promise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🕒 4. Time-bound Delivery &ndash; On Time Every Time</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our company has:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚛 GPS Enabled Trucks</li>\r\n	<li>🧭 Route Optimization Tools</li>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;💼 Dedicated Move Coordinator</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Which lets you track every stage of shifting in real-time &mdash; from pickup to final placement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Time is our promise &ndash; and we keep it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📞 5. Complete Transparency &ndash; No Hidden Charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We send a full rate breakdown to our DLF Phase 3 clients on WhatsApp in advance:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💰 No hidden costs</li>\r\n	<li>📄 Real prices from Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST Bills &amp; On-Site Payment Options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>What you see is what you pay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔧 6. End-to-End Solution &ndash; Not just trucks, complete transition</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not just packers and movers, we make your entire relocation hassle-free:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Packing &rarr; Loading &rarr; Transport &rarr; Unloading &rarr; Unpacking</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Furniture dismantling and re-setup</li>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Bed/Sofa assembly</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Garbage removal</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Transit Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You don&rsquo;t have to do anything extra</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🗺️ 7. Deep experience of DLF Phase 3</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Which lanes are too narrow for trucks in Nathupur Village</li>\r\n	<li>Which society entry rules apply in Heritage City</li>\r\n	<li>When and how to get NOC for weekend shifting in Belvedere Park</li>\r\n	<li>This local experience is what sets us apart.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📌 ShiftingPort does what it says &ndash; and that&rsquo;s why more than 90% of clients in DLF Phase 3 choose us again.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🛠️ Our Services &ndash; All types of Packers and Movers services available in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Here is our detailed services in DLF Phase 3:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 1. Home Relocation in DLF Phase 3</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have successfully completed dozens of 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK and Villa shifting in Heritage City Apartments, Belvedere Towers, Shivaji Nagar, U-Block, Nathupur Village and other colonies in DLF Phase 3.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our domestic shifting packages include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Safe packing of kitchen, bedroom, living area and temple</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Dismantling of expensive furniture and re-installation in the new home</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Labelling and special packing of electronics (TV, AC, washing machine)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Unpacking and arranging of belongings after cleaning</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Assistance in society gate pass and lift permission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office &amp; Corporate Relocation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 3 has many small and big offices and startups located around Belvedere Park, Shivaji Nagar and MG Road. For them, we provide off-hours or weekend shifting so that there is no loss of work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our office shifting services include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💼 Secure packing of computers, printers, file cabinets</li>\r\n	<li>🔐 Labelling and private packing of confidential documents</li>\r\n	<li>🕘 Overnight or weekend moving facility</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Department-wise box labelling and staff assignment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚙 3. Car/Bike Transport Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Need to move your vehicle from DLF Phase 3 to Delhi, Jaipur, Mumbai or Bengaluru? We transport your car or bike with GPS tracking and guaranteed safety.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Covered and Uncovered Container Options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Zero Dent and Lashing System</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Documentation and Tracking Number Details</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Same-day Pickup and Door-to-Door Delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 4. Local Shifting &ndash; Within or Nearby Areas of DLF Phase 3</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are moving from DLF Phase 3 to DLF Phase 2, MG Road, Nathupur, or around Cyber ​​City, our local shifting package is perfect for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ 1BHK to 3BHK move in 4 to 6 hours</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling and re-setup in same day</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Short notice service available</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Budget-friendly plans</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Storage &amp; Warehousing</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If your new home isn&rsquo;t ready, your rent is over, or you&rsquo;re moving abroad &ndash; we offer secure and monitored warehousing:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Box-wise inventory and labelling</li>\r\n	<li>🎥 24x7 CCTV surveillance and pest-controlled environment</li>\r\n	<li>🧊 Moisture-proof, theft-proof storage</li>\r\n	<li>📅 Options from weeks to months</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎁 6. Expert Packing &amp; Unpacking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Some customers just need packing and unpacking. For this we offer:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ 5-layer packing of fragile and decorative items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Wooden Crates for LEDs, Crockery, Glass and Artefacts</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Unboxing and Waste Material Disposal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Areas we serve in DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Heritage City Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Belvedere Park &amp; ​​Towers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Nathupur Village</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Shivaji Nagar</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Phase 3 Metro Area</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Near Sikanderpur Metro Station</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h3>💰 Packers and Movers Charges in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon &ndash; Our Prices and Full Price Table</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever a customer thinks of shifting home or office in DLF Phase 3, the first question that comes to mind is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo;<br />\r\nShiftingPort has designed the answer to this question in a very simple, transparent and practical way. The prices of our packers and movers services depend only on the quantity of your goods, distance and some special services &ndash; no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 Estimated Rate Chart for DLF Phase 3 (Local to National)</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🏠 Type of Shifting</th>\r\n			<th>📍 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🚛 Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌏 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Main Factors Affecting Price in DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Goods Volume and Weight</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing and loading cost varies according to the quantity of furniture, electronics, cupboards, beds, washing machines etc. Floor and Lift Facility</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Lift is available in societies like Belvedere Towers, Heritage City, but Nathupur Village requires manual unloading. Packing quality and material</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Crockery, Showpiece, LED require 5-layer or Wooden Crate packing. Shifting time (Weekend/Night)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ If you want to move at night or on Sunday, there may be additional charges &ndash; especially as per society permission. Society gate pass and entry slot</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Societies like Shivaji Nagar, Belvedere Park have fixed time for truck entry &ndash; for which we have to book the slot.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📄 DLF Phase 3 &ndash; Price Breakdown with Real Example</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>2 BHK Flat Shifting: Heritage City &rarr; Nathupur Village</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🔧 Services 💰 Estimated Price</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service Item</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹1,800</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Labour Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,000 &ndash; ₹2,800</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck (Local Transport)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹1,800</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Total (Including GST)</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,192&nbsp;&ndash; ₹7,552</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ We conduct a Free Pre-Move Survey before every shifting to give you an accurate, no-surprise, fixed price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 Why is ShiftingPort Pricing considered the most reliable?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔓 No Hidden Charges &ndash; The quote given will be final</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Written Estimate &ndash; Price breakdown on WhatsApp and Email</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST Invoice and On-Site Payment options available</li>\r\n	<li>🧑&zwj;💼 Clear explanation of every expense from Dedicated Move Manager</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) about Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 1. Does ShiftingPort serve all societies and colonies in DLF Phase 3?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort services are available in every location of DLF Phase 3 &ndash; whether you live in Belvedere Towers, Heritage City, DLF City Court, Global Business Park or Nathupur Village. Our team has successfully shifted thousands of homes and offices in all these areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is fully aware of DLF Phase 3 gate numbers, entry timings, parking points and society SOPs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 2. Can local shifting from DLF Phase 3 be done in a single day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. If you are shifting from DLF Phase 3 to nearby areas like Sector 24, MG Road, Sikanderpur or Sushant Lok, 1BHK, 2BHK and even 3BHK can be shifted in a single day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Note: We only need society shifting permission and lift/parking access in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 3. Does ShiftingPort conduct site survey in advance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we conduct a free pre-move survey for every client. This gives us an idea of ​​your goods, path, floor and truck parking - which helps us give an accurate quotation and ensures a hassle-free shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 4. Does ShiftingPort only shift homes or offices too?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> ShiftingPort not only does home shifting but also shifts Startups, MNC Offices, Co-working spaces and Shops in DLF Phase 3. We also do weekend or night moving so that there is no loss of business.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 5. Does ShiftingPort provide Society NOC or Gate Pass?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Customer has to get Society Gate Pass or NOC from RWA, but ShiftingPort provides you full support &ndash; like staff list, truck number, driver details and time slot details are sent in advance so that there is no problem at the gate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 6. Do we have Wooden Crate and Insurance for expensive items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we have:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Wooden Crate Packing (for Glass Tables, Crockery, Electronics, Idols etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Transit Insurance (from IRDA-Approved Partners)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Handle with Care label and separate Fragile Box Handling</li>\r\n	<li>✅ All this is standard process for premium locations like DLF Phase 3.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 7. Is car and bike transport available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, cars and bikes can be shipped from DLF Phase 3 to any city in India. We offer:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Covered &amp; Open Carriers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Door-to-Door Pickup &amp; Delivery</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Insurance options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 8. Is there any unpacking and setup assistance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, our team reassembles your beds, dressing tables, wardrobes etc. after shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We also do unpacking + waste removal so that you can settle into your new home comfortably.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 9. Is it possible if you have to move at night or on a Sunday?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, many DLF Phase 3 customers shift at night or on weekends. We can schedule truck delivery and loading till 10 pm &ndash; you just need to take permission from the society in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Booking ShiftingPort is very easy:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 <strong>Call/WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are available for 24x7 service.</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon, Movers in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon, Home Shifting DLF Phase 3, Office Relocation DLF Phase 3, Car Movers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon, Bike Transport DLF Phase 3, Belvedere Park Packers Movers, Belvedere Towers Shifting Services, Heritage City Gurgaon Movers, Nathupur Packers and Movers, Local Shifting DLF Phase 3, Affordable Packers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon, Professional Movers DLF 3, Society Shifting Belvedere Gurgaon, Shifting Services Near Cyber City, Movers Near MG Road Gurgaon, Best Packers and Movers DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon, Packers and Movers', 'Top-rated Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 3 Gurgaon for home, office and vehicle shifting. Safe packing, on-time delivery & no hidden charges. Call now!', '2025-07-07 20:26:31', '2025-07-07 22:22:19');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(66, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 5, 1, 1, 1, 5, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon DLF Phase 4', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-dlf-phase-4', '1999', NULL, 'Looking for reliable Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon? ShiftingPort offers expert home, office & car relocation with premium packing, timely delivery and 24x7 support. Trusted by hundreds in Beverly Park, Richmond Park & more.', '<h2>🏠 Shifting house in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon is not just a task, it is a new beginning &ndash; Start on the right note with ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon is today counted amongst the most prestigious and well-maintained residential areas of Gurgaon. The lush green colonies, gated societies, high-end lifestyle and proximity to the metro make it an ideal place to live in and when it comes to shifting to this premium location, it is not just a matter of carrying and packing but also an emotional and responsible transition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers makes this transition easy, safe and memorable. We believe that &ldquo;Shifting is not just a matter of changing the address but the beginning of a new life.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤔 Why is Shifting required in DLF Phase 4?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The need to shift to DLF Phase 4 arises due to many reasons:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Promotion or transfer in job &ndash; People with offices in Cyber ​​City, Golf Course Road or Sohna Road prefer to live in Phase 4.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Search for a bigger house &ndash; When the family grows, people want to shift from 2 BHK to 3/4 BHK.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Daughter&#39;s marriage or griha pravesh in a new house &ndash; Many people shift to societies like Beverly Park 1, Galleria Residency or Supermart Apartments.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Better facilities and location &ndash; Due to proximity to Metro Station (IFFCO Chowk/Sikanderpur) and schools and colleges, families want to settle here.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Major societies and blocks in DLF Phase 4 where shifting is done:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s network is spread across DLF Phase 4, including major blocks and societies:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Beverly Park 1 &amp; 2</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Supermart 1 &amp; 2 Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹DLF Galleria Residency</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Hamilton Court (Part)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹E-Block, F-Block, G-Block colonies</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Societies near Vyapar Kendra</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sikanderpur Village and surrounding areas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We not only shift houses, but also transport your emotions to the new home with respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ How does ShiftingPort make shifting in Phase 4 easy?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Pre-move survey &ndash; Our team first visits your old house and inspects the belongings.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Customized packing plan &ndash; Crockery, furniture, wardrobe, TV, computer &ndash; different packing for each item.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Moving in time-slot &ndash; Many societies in Phase 4 have no-entry time, we plan the time accordingly.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Take care of Lift &amp; Parking permission &ndash; Parking or lift booking is necessary at many places, we help you with that.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Crew &ndash; Our staff in uniform are recognizable and carefully shift all your luggage.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Real-time Tracking &ndash; You can check your truck location and status live on your mobile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Specialties of ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Quiet and disturbance-free shifting in societies</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Vehicle arrival and completion of work on time</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dismantling of furniture and setup in new house</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Collection and disposal of waste material after packing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Transparent rates and no hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>📍 Every society and colony in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon where ShiftingPort provides reliable Packers and Movers&nbsp; service</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon is a large and organized area, which is made up of premium apartments, independent floors, villas, high-rise societies and market-commercial hubs. Shifting in the streets and blocks here is not a simple task &ndash; every society has its own entry timings, gate permissions, parking rules and lift booking rules.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has proven with 100+ successful shiftings in DLF Phase 4 that we not only know the local area well, but also customize our services as per the needs of every society here.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Let&rsquo;s find out the major colonies and societies in DLF Phase 4 where we are available:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Beverly Park 1 and Beverly Park 2</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>These high-end apartments consist of 3BHK, 4BHK and penthouse flats. Our team helps you with every process of shifting here, from lift booking, society permission and car-truck parking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Supermart Apartments &ndash; 1 and 2</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Located near Galleria Market, this is a cluster of low-rise apartments. The streets here are a bit narrow, so we make shifting simple with small packing vehicles and trained staff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Galleria Residency</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Located above and near DLF Galleria Market, this society is very popular among the youth and office professionals. ShiftingPort has a special rapid team for fast 1BHK&ndash;2BHK shifting here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 E Block, F Block, G Block &ndash; DLF Colonies</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>These are blocks with independent houses and villa type residences. Here our team comes with big trucks and provides complete service from furniture dismantling to reassembly. We have long experience of shifting in the lanes of E Block and F Block.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Societies near Vyapar Kendra</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Vyapar Kendra has many small and big societies which also come under the border colonies of Sushant Lok. ShiftingPort also does fast shifting in these areas, especially for commercial office moving.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Streets and neighborhoods near Sikanderpur Village and Metro</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In the local residential areas around Sikanderpur Village and DLF Phase 4, our local team provides service from 6 am to 10 pm. Keeping in mind the narrow lanes and no-entry times, our team helps with advance permission.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Other major locations where ShiftingPort is active:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Near DLF City Club Phase 4</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Galleria Towers</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sushant Lok Phase 1 (Colony adjacent to Phase 4)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sahyog Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Colonies near DLF Mega Mall</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Urban area of ​​Kanhai Village</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Parts of DLF Phase 4 adjoining Shivaji Nagar Road</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚛 What does our availability mean?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 We are on time everywhere &ndash; be it a morning society time slot or a discreet entry at night.</li>\r\n	<li>👷 We have experience of every block and every lane &ndash; how far the truck can go, where manual lifting is required &ndash; our team knows it all.</li>\r\n	<li>📄 We know all the society rules in advance &ndash; including NOC, gate pass, lift booking, and parking slots.</li>\r\n	<li>🛻 Our vehicles come in both full size and mini - to suit every society&#39;s entry point.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>⭐ Why ShiftingPort is the Best Packers and Movers for DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to a posh and organized area like DLF Phase 4, every step of shifting should be equally professional and classy. Every apartment, villa and colony has different rules, deadlines and peace rules. Ordinary packers and movers can make your job difficult.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort understands every need of DLF Phase 4 in detail &ndash; and this is what makes us a professional, reliable and top-class service provider, unlike ordinary movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Trusted Brand, Known for Reliability and Professional Attitude</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have been operating in DLF Phase 4 for many years and have done more than 200+ successful shiftings in societies like Beverly Park, Galleria Residency, Vyapar Kendra Apartments. Our clients include senior professionals, IT experts, retired army officers, and business owners &mdash; and all have praised our honest service and punctuality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👨&zwj;🔧 2. Trained staff &ndash; who handles your emotions, not just your belongings</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort, every employee is trained on:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Use of branded packing material</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Safe handling of wooden and glass furniture</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Label-based boxing for electronics</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Courteous behaviour and adherence to society rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff always come in uniform and with company ID. In societies like Beverly Park, we take utmost care to maintain the peace of the residents.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. High-quality packing &ndash; where safety is paramount</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Most homes in DLF Phase 4 have expensive furniture, LED TVs, artwork, crockery, and electronic items. To protect them, we use:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 5-layer packing: Bubble wrap + foam sheets + stretch film</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🪵 Crate packing: Wooden boxes for expensive tables, statues and pianos</li>\r\n	<li>📺 LEDs and TVs are packed in special thermocol casing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏰ 4. Punctuality &ndash; 100% on-time delivery</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many societies in DLF Phase 4 have fixed shifting times. ShiftingPort plans for this in advance:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🗓️ Society permissions are obtained in advance</li>\r\n	<li>🧭 GPS-tracked trucks</li>\r\n	<li>👷&zwj;♂️ Arrive in advance and prepare loading</li>\r\n	<li>🕐 The entire process is completed in 4-6 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our on-time delivery record is 98.6%.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 5. Real-time tracking and 24x7 customer support</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers offers its DLF Phase 4 clients:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📱 Live tracking links</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Packing and loading photos on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>☎️ Dedicated move manager to assist at every stage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 6. No hidden charges &ndash; complete transparency</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In areas like DLF Phase 4, many companies quote a basic rate and then charge extra later &mdash; but ShiftingPort offers:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📝 Complete rate breakup at once</li>\r\n	<li>💸 On-site payment and GST bill</li>\r\n	<li>🗣️ Everything confirmed before shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏆 ShiftingPort &ndash; A complete relocation experience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not just a shifting company, but a team that gives you a smooth, premium and full-fledged experience:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Furniture dismantling and re-assembly</li>\r\n	<li>🧼 Post-move Cleaning (On Demand)</li>\r\n	<li>🚙 Vehicle Transportation</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Storage &amp; Warehouse Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ What is our specialty in DLF Phase 4?</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Specialty</th>\r\n			<th>ShiftingPort</th>\r\n			<th>Other</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Local Knowledge</td>\r\n			<td>✅</td>\r\n			<td>❌</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Trained Staff</td>\r\n			<td>✅</td>\r\n			<td>⚠️</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Timely Service</td>\r\n			<td>✅</td>\r\n			<td>❌</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Real Tracking</td>\r\n			<td>✅</td>\r\n			<td>❌</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Transparent Charges</td>\r\n			<td>✅</td>\r\n			<td>❌</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚚 Our Services &ndash; Professional Shifting Services by ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon is a high-class residential and commercial zone with different permissions, SOPs and safety norms for shifting every home, society, villa and office. Keeping all these in mind, ShiftingPort brings you customized moving solutions, specifically designed as per the needs of the area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our services are not just limited to packing and transporting goods &mdash; we provide a complete relocation experience. Let&rsquo;s take a closer look:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Relocation Services in DLF Phase 4</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have shifted hundreds of homes in DLF Phase 4 societies like Beverly Park 1 &amp; 2, Galleria Residency, Hamilton Court Extension, Vyapar Kendra Apartments, etc. &mdash; without any damage and time delays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our home shifting services include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Custom packing for kitchen, bedroom, dining room, store room</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Safe disassembling and reassembling of furniture</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Item-wise inventory list (tagging on every box)</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 Transport by GPS-enabled truck</li>\r\n	<li>🧽 Unpacking and arrangement at new location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide time-slot based services in all sectors and blocks of DLF Phase 4 &mdash; like C Block, E Block, Galleria Road, colonies and apartments around Vyapar Kendra.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office &amp; Corporate Shifting (Office Shifting &amp; Startup Relocation)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4 has many SMEs and private offices that transition to Golf Course Road, Cyber ​​City or MG Road. We shift these companies with business-friendly timings and data-safety.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Office Moving we do:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🖥️ Packing and Labeling of Servers, CPU, Workstations and Printers</li>\r\n	<li>🔐 Handling of Documents with Confidentiality</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Department wise segmentation and loading</li>\r\n	<li>🌃 Late Night or Weekend Moving, so that there is no loss of work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ 3. Local Shifting &ndash; Within or Near DLF Phase 4</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are shifting within or near DLF Phase 4 to any area like Sushant Lok Phase 1, DLF Phase 1, or Sector 28 &mdash; ShiftingPort plans the fastest and budget-friendly local moving plan for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In local moving you get:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚛 One Day 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK Moving Plan</li>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Furniture Disassembling and Assembly Same Day</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Quick Response Even on Short Notice Shifting</li>\r\n	<li>💸 Pocket Friendly Packages &mdash; No Compromise on Quality</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 4. Vehicle Transportation &ndash; Safe Delivery of Car and Bike</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Car and bike transport is also in great demand in DLF Phase 4, especially when you are moving to another city or state.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We offer:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚙 Both covered and uncovered containers</li>\r\n	<li>📍 GPS tracking facility</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Tight lashing with dent-free guarantee</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Single day pickup and timebound delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Storage and Warehousing &ndash; When you need to store your belongings</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sometimes the new home is not ready, or there are delays in overseas transitions &mdash; ShiftingPort&rsquo;s warehouse is your trusted solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏢 CCTV-monitored warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Inventory by barcode system</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Moisture-free, pest-controlled spaces</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Box-wise listing and quick access</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧰 6. Packing and Unpacking &ndash; Expert touch</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4 homes usually house fragile and premium belongings. The ShiftingPort team follows specific packing methods:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Double wrapping, thermocol and bubble wrap</li>\r\n	<li>🖼️ Custom crates for artworks and idols</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Different packing strategies for living room, bedroom and kitchen</li>\r\n	<li>🧽 Unpacking and waste management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 Shifting Charges in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon &ndash; Complete Price Transparency and Trust</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever a customer thinks of shifting home, office or vehicle in a premium area like DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon, the first question that comes to mind is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo; ShiftingPort takes away this worry with transparent and predictable charges, so that you can plan your shifting in advance &ndash; without any hidden costs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our packages are based on:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 The amount of your belongings</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Property floor and lift access</li>\r\n	<li>🚚 Distance and vehicle requirement</li>\r\n	<li>📍 DLF Phase 4 society rules and shifting time slots</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon Packers and Movers Charges &ndash; Estimated Rate Chart</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🏠 Type of Shifting</th>\r\n			<th>🚛 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🚄 Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌐 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Main factors affecting shifting cost in DLF Phase 4:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. 🏢 Society block and floor access</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Lift, ramp and gate pass facilities vary in C Block, Beverly Park, Vyapar Kendra Apartments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. 📦 Luggage quantity and special items</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Items like sofa set, beds, AC, crockery, art pieces, piano require separate packing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. 🚪 Society time slot and permission</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>In some societies, shifting is done only from 10 am to 2 pm. No-entry time may also apply.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. 🌃 Weekend or night shifting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>If you want to move on Sunday or late night, then the cost may vary depending on staff alert and pre-planning.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 Example: A 2 BHK Shifting &ndash; Beverly Park to Vyapar Kendra (Local Move)</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>👷&zwj;♂️ Service</th>\r\n			<th>💰 Estimated Price</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹1,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Labor Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong>Total&nbsp;</strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>₹4,500&ndash; ₹6000</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why is ShiftingPort&rsquo;s pricing considered the most transparent?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💬 Complete pricing on Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>🔍 No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Rate Breakdown sent on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST Bill and On-Site Payment Facility</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Whatever is mentioned in the Quotation is Final</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>⭐ Why ShiftingPort is the Best Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting to DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon is not just about relocating &ndash; it is about a new life, a new environment and a new beginning. Your Packers and Movers should be as professional, reliable and premium as your new address. This is why thousands of customers choose ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort not only shifts your belongings, but also makes your experience smooth, safe and classy &ndash; just like DLF Phase 4 is known for.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Trusted Brand &ndash; Experience and Credibility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has completed 100+ successful shiftings in DLF Phase 4 over the years. Our reviews and feedback in premium areas like Beverly Park, Vyapar Kendra Apartments, E-Block Villas, Supermart Apartments and Galleria Residency tell why people trust us.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Verified Client Testimonials</li>\r\n	<li>✅ 5-Star Google Ratings</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Repeat Clients from DLF Societies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>👨&zwj;🔧 2. Trained and Verified Staff</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Each of our staff members:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Is in uniform</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Comes with proper ID and verified background</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Trained in every step of shifting (packing, loading, unpacking)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Handles your home like it&rsquo;s their own</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>When shifting to societies like Beverly Park, calm demeanor, gate-pass discipline, and neat professionals are the key &ndash; and ShiftingPort is the best at that.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. Premium Quality Packing &ndash; Zero Damage Guarantee</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4 homes have expensive electronics, glass dining, artwork, and imported furniture &mdash; so our packing is premium:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 5 layer safety packing</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Thermocol, Bubble Wrap, Furniture Blankets</li>\r\n	<li>🪵 Wooden Crate Packing (Glass Tables, Murti, Crockery)</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Sofa Sets and Wardrobes dismantled and damage-proof wrapping</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Every box is always carefully labeled with &ldquo;Handle With Care&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏰ 4. On-Time Arrival and Time-Slot Based Delivery</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4 societies like Vyapar Kendra Apartments, Richmond Park, Sushant Estate have limited shifting time. We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Pre-plan your Society&#39;s Gate Entry and Lift Access</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Send Loader and Packers team on scheduled time</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Also provide live tracking with GPS-enabled truck</li>\r\n	<li>⏱️ Our time delivery score &ndash; 98.7% Accuracy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 5. No Hidden Charges &ndash; Complete Transparency</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has only one principle &ndash; pay what you say, and no shocking bill later.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📄 Final rate is told to you after survey</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Full breakdown details are sent on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>💸 Bill inclusive of GST, Cash/Card/UPI payment options available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📱 6. Real-time Support and Dedicated Move Manager</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>DLF Phase 4 customers are often busy &ndash; we understand that. That&#39;s why ShiftingPort offers:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📲 Live Location Sharing of Truck</li>\r\n	<li>📞 Dedicated Relationship Manager for Your Move</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Photo Proof Packing &amp; Loading Updates</li>\r\n	<li>🕐 Late Evening Support &amp; Queries Handling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧼 7. Value-Added Services &ndash; Not Just Moving, An Experience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not just Packers and Movers, but a Complete Relocation Partner:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔧 Furniture Dismantle &amp; Re-setup</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Post-Move Cleaning (Optional)</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Temporary Storage Facility</li>\r\n	<li>🐶 Pet Relocation (On Request)</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Transit Insurance &amp; Claim Assistance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Our Specialty &ndash; Why is ShiftingPort the Best?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Practical Experience of all the Societies of DLF Phase 4</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Team with Premium Behavior</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Zero Damage Record in 150+ Moves</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Weekend, Night &amp; Same-Day Move Options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ 24x7 Dedicated Support System</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>❓Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) about Shifting in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When people shift their home, office or vehicle in a premium area like DLF Phase 4, they have many questions in their mind. Below we have answered all the common questions that are frequently asked by our customers:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 1. Does ShiftingPort provide services in all Societies and Blocks in DLF Phase 4?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort services are available in almost all big and small societies of DLF Phase 4, such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Beverly Park 1 &amp; 2</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Vyapar Kendra Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sushant Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹E &amp; F Block Villas</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Richmond Park</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Supermart Residency</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have experience of shifting in these societies and we follow all rules like NOC, time slots, lift usage etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 2. Is shifting possible in one day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, if you have a 1 BHK, 2 BHK or 3 BHK home and you have received NOC and Entry Permission from the Society, we can complete the packing and unpacking work in a single day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 3. Can we do shifting at night or on weekends?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We have dedicated teams and slots for weekend or late-night shifting. You just need a Gate Pass and Entry Approval from your Society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 4. Does ShiftingPort offer Transit Insurance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we offer IRDA-Approved Transit Insurance for your valuables. It is optional but we always recommend insurance for long distance shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 5. Is car and bike transport available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, Car and Bike transport facility is available from DLF Phase 4 to cities like Delhi, Noida, Mumbai, Pune, Jaipur, Bengaluru with GPS Tracking and Covered Container.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 6. Are your employees verified and come in uniform?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. All our employees are police-verified, wear proper ID card and come in company uniform. Keeping in mind the security of your society, we send staff details in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 7. Do you arrange for Society NOC?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Society NOC has to be taken by the customer himself, but we provide you full support &ndash; like providing vehicle number, driver details and staff list on time so that you can easily get NOC.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 8. Do you dismantle and re-install furniture?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we professionally dismantle Sofa, Bed, Dining Table, Almirah etc. and then install them properly at the new place.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 9. How is the shifting cost decided?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> The cost depends on:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Amount of goods</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Floor and lift facility</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Time slot for truck entry</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Distance</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Special items (TV, Crockery, Piano etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹You are given a very transparent quotation upfront.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book ShiftingPort through these methods:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call / WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is available 24x7 to assist you.</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon, Best Packers and Movers DLF Phase 4, Movers and Packers DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon, House Shifting in DLF Phase 4, Office Relocation DLF Phase 4, Car Transport DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon, Bike Shifting DLF Phase 4, Local Shifting Services DLF Phase 4, Affordable Packers in DLF Phase 4 Gurgaon, Verified Packers and Movers DLF 4, Home Relocation Services DLF Phase 4, Shifting Services near Galleria Market, Beverly Park Movers Gurgaon, Professional Packers DLF Phase 4, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Gurgaon', 'ShiftingPort offers expert home, office & vehicle shifting in DLF Phase 4, Gurgaon. Safe packing, on-time delivery & zero damage guarantee. Book today!', '2025-07-07 22:18:10', '2025-07-09 12:20:51');
