r\n	<li>🟢 Fragile items like imported sofa, glass dining table, crockery units require high-level packing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. Shifting Time:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🟢 Some societies charge permit fee on weekend or holiday shifting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Special packing requirement:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🟢 Use of wooden crates for paintings, sculptures, pianos etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Storage or Wait time:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🟢 If you need to store the goods for a few days, then warehousing charges are extra.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>6. 📲 Understand with an example:</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Example: 2 BHK Shifting &ndash; DLF Trinity Towers to DLF Park Place (Local)</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th colspan=\"2\">📋 Service Estimated Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Labor (4 Staff)</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Total (Including GST)</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,020/-</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Why is our pricing considered the most reliable?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Price Breakdown on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Free Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST Bill and Online Payment Options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Same Price Guarantee &ndash; Final Bill same as mentioned earlier</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓Section 6: DLF Phase 5 Gurgaon Packers and Movers &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q1. Does ShiftingPort serve all societies in DLF Phase 5?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort serves every major society and tower in DLF Phase 5 like &ndash; Trinity Towers, The Aralias, The Crest, DLF Icon, Park Place, Belaire, Princeton Estate, Summit, Wellington Estate etc. We do the shifting keeping in mind the society rules, no-entry time, and gate pass procedure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q2. Can shifting be done in a single day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, if you are shifting within or near DLF Phase 5 (like Golf Course Road, DLF Phase 4) then shifting from 1BHK to 3BHK can be completed in a single day. Just take permission for vehicle entry and lift in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q3. Does ShiftingPort provide Society NOC or Gate Pass assistance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, customer has to get NOC or Gate Pass from Society RWA, but we provide full support:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Driver and staff details</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck number</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Copy of staff ID card</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Vehicle timings etc. are provided in advance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q4. Is there special packing for valuable items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, for LED TV, Crockery, Imported Furniture, Paintings, Artworks etc. we provide:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>5-layer packing</li>\r\n	<li>Bubble wrap + Foam + Thermocol</li>\r\n	<li>Wooden crates (for glass/marble items)</li>\r\n	<li>Fragile label and separate handling.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q5. Is there car or bike transport facility?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we send your car or bike to any corner of the country in a safe manner.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS-enabled containers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Door-to-door pickup</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Both Covered &amp; uncovered options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Zero dent guarantee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q6. Is storage facility also available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, if you have not received the keys of your new home or you are going abroad for a few days, we provide short/long term storage facility in CCTV-monitored warehouse.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Barcode-based tagging</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Moisture-proof and pest-controlled space</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q7. Can shifting be done at night or on weekends?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, most societies in DLF Phase 5 allow shifting during weekends and evenings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We schedule the team and truck as per your convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q8. Does the team reassemble the furniture?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! Sofa, Bed, Dining Table, Almirah etc. are reassembled by our technicians on the spot.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Unpacking</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture re-arrangement</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Garbage disposal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q9. Is tracking available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;Yes, our trucks are GPS-enabled and send you live location, photos and status updates on WhatsApp and there is also a dedicated Move Manager who stays in touch at every stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;You can book ShiftingPort in three ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 <strong>Call / WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are available 24x7 at your service.</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 5 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort® Trusted Shifting', 'Packers and Movers DLF Phase 5 Gurgaon,packers and movers gurgaon dlf phase 5, packers and povers in gurgaon dlf phase 5, DLF Phase 5 Relocation Services, Best Movers in DLF 5, Home Shifting DLF Phase 5, Office Shifting DLF Phase 5, Car relocation DLF Phase 5, Movers and Packers near Aralias, packers and movers near Trinity Towers, Bike transport Gurgaon DLF Phase 5, Premium Movers Gurgaon, packers and movers near me', 'Looking for professional Packers and Movers in DLF Phase 5 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort offers home, office, car/bike shifting with premium packing, fast delivery & transparent rates.', '2025-07-08 08:15:07', '2025-07-12 10:26:22'),
