dingly:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Furniture Re-assembly</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Post-Move House Cleaning</li>\r\n	<li>🐶 Pet Relocation</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Short-Term Storage</li>\r\n	<li>📜 Transit Insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Every move at ShiftingPort is not just a transport of goods, but a &ldquo;Premium Relocation Journey&rdquo; that matches the standards of every esteemed Sushant Lok customer.</p>', '<h2>📍 Our Reach in Sushant Lok Gurgaon &ndash; Service in Every Block, Colony &amp; Society</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sushant Lok Gurgaon is a huge and developed residential area divided into Phase 1, Phase 2 and Phase 3. Every street, colony and society has different requirements &ndash; and ShiftingPort understands them well. We reach every corner of Sushant Lok on time and provide professional shifting services as per the decorum of the society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Sushant Lok Phase 1 &ndash; Prestigious and Active Residential Belt</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Phase 1 has everything from spacious Independent Villas to Premium Flats. Here are some of the major areas where we actively provide shifting services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 A Block</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 B Block</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 C Block</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 D Block</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Vyapar Kendra (Commercial Belt)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Ridgewood Estate</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Sushant Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Pragati Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Connected points with Rosewood City</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 These areas usually have issues like narrow lanes, guard gate entries and lift permissions &ndash; ShiftingPort takes all clearances in advance so that the client does not face any hassles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Sushant Lok Phase 2 &ndash; Apartments &amp; Flat Based Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Phase 2 is a relatively new and more apartment-centric area. We provide regular shifting services here, especially in:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Near Sector 55&ndash;56 Rapid Metro Station</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Blossom Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Sushant Lok Zone behind Ireo Grand Arch</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 School Belt and Plot Areas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>🚛 For Phase 2, our team does special track assessment so that smaller trucks can be sent on narrow roads and deliver on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Sushant Lok Phase 3 &ndash; Quiet, Private and Premium Clientele</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our special teams are sent to the societies and bungalows here who do the shifting in a professional manner without any disturbance in a quiet environment. Areas Covered:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Private Kothis &amp; Villas</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 HUDA Cooperative Housing Area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Near Nirvana Courtyard Road</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Section adjoining Emerald Hills</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📦 Customers here often require weekend or night shifting - for which ShiftingPort offers 24x7 flexible planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🚦 Entry Points We Access:<br />\r\nDifferent parts of Sushant Lok have vehicle entry points and gate restrictions. ShiftingPort team ensures before every shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Gate Timings (10 AM to 2 PM or 4 PM to 6 PM)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Guard Permission and ID Verification</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Entry Slot for Truck and Loader</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📍 Our Regular Pick-up and Drop Locations:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✔️ Sushant Lok to DLF Phase 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 Moving</li>\r\n	<li>✔️ Sushant Lok to Sohna Road, Golf Course Road, Sector 49, 50, 57</li>\r\n	<li>✔️ Sushant Lok to Delhi, Noida, Faridabad</li>\r\n	<li>✔️ Outside Sushant Lok (Mumbai, Pune, Chandigarh, Jaipur) Intercity Shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort provides &quot;Customized Moving Solution&quot; for every Society and every Customer in Sushant Lok Gurgaon - so that your shifting is not just a moving of goods but a smooth and safe journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚚 Key Services of ShiftingPort &ndash; All types of Shifting Facility in Sushant Lok Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In a premium area like Sushant Lok Gurgaon, every customer has different needs &ndash; some families want to move from their 2BHK home to 3BHK, some want to move office to Sector 44 or Cyber ​​City, some want to shift their car or bike to Delhi, Mumbai or Jaipur. In such a situation, ShiftingPort becomes a one-stop relocation partner and solves every need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here we tell you in detail what services we provide in Sushant Lok:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort considers home shifting not just a matter of lifting things &ndash; we also take your emotions along.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Services for 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK and Villas</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 De-mount and re-assembly of wardrobe, bed, sofa and dining table</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Safe packing of kitchen, electronics, decorative items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Sequential box packing from Poha Ghar to study room</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Identification of fragile items in the house and labeling &lsquo;Handle With Care&rsquo;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📍Our regular service is available in A Block, B Block, Ridgewood Estate, Rosewood City, Sushant Apartments and Pragati Apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office &amp; Commercial Moving</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many of Sushant Lok&rsquo;s clients shift their office to Cyber ​​Hub, Golf Course Road, or MG Road. In such a situation, they need timely and planned moving &ndash; which ShiftingPort does very well:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💻 Packing of computers, printers, servers and network equipment</li>\r\n	<li>📁 Special confidential tagging to keep data safe</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 Weekend/Night Moving facility</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Systematic boxing as per staff-department</li>\r\n	<li>🔒 Special team available for IT Relocation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚘 3. Car and Bike Transport (Vehicle Transportation)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to send your car or bike out of Delhi from Sushant Lok &ndash; then ShiftingPort gives you:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚗 Covered/Uncovered Car Carrier Options</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Door-to-Door Pickup and Drop</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Foam-Based Vehicle Lashing</li>\r\n	<li>🛰️ Real-Time GPS Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Transit Insurance facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>🚚 We ship cars to cities like Mumbai, Pune, Bangalore, Jaipur, Lucknow, Patna, Chandigarh etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Packing &amp; Unpacking Only</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times people rent a truck themselves but they need professional packing. ShiftingPort&rsquo;s packing package is ideal for such clients:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Bubble Wrap, Foam Sheet, Stretch Film</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Wooden Crates for Fragile &amp; Expensive Items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Labeling &amp; Inventory Checklist</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Final Unpacking &amp; Waste Disposal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Storage &amp; Warehouse</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are getting the keys to your new property late or are moving abroad and need to keep some belongings safe &ndash; we offer:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏢 CCTV &amp; Secured Warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Box-wise Tagging &amp; Digital Inventory</li>\r\n	<li>🧴 Moisture-Proof &amp; Pest-Controlled Space</li>\r\n	<li>📆 Both Short &amp; Long Term Options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔧 6. Furniture Setup &amp; Disassembly Facility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In some societies like Ridgewood, Rosewood, Sushant Apartments etc., clients often ask:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;Will your people re-set the bed or TV unit?&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort we do:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🪛 Sofa, Almirah, Dining Table, Modular Kitchen Setup</li>\r\n	<li>📺 Wall Mount TV Reinstallation (Optional)</li>\r\n	<li>🔌 AC/RO Uninstallation (By Partner Technician)</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Final Cleaning + Garbage Removal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our services are already tested &amp; trusted in every Phase and Block of Sushant Lok Gurgaon. Whether you are a Student, Family, or Business Owner &ndash; we make your every shifting &quot;Smooth, Safe, and Successful!&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Estimated Packers and Movers Charges in Sushant Lok Gurgaon &ndash; Know what your expenses will be?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort believes that the most important question before shifting is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo; That&rsquo;s why we provide you with a clean, transparent and customer experience-based price chart &ndash; specially prepared for Sushant Lok Gurgaon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The chart given below will tell you how much 1BHK to 4BHK and car-bike shifting can cost:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 Estimated Packers and Movers Charges &ndash; Sushant Lok Gurgaon (Local &amp; Intercity)</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🏠 Type of Shifting</th>\r\n			<th>📍 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌍 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹8,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹21,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,499 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,499 &ndash; ₹13,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹17,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹44,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹19,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,999 &ndash; ₹7,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,499 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹19,999 &ndash; ₹24,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,499 &ndash; ₹3,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,499 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Main factors affecting the shifting cost in Sushant Lok:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Block &amp; Floor Access</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>⏫ If there is no lift or the distance from the parking is more, then the effort increases.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Quantity of goods</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 More fragile or heavy goods like TV, fridge, AC can increase the cost.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Special items</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🎹 Piano, 🚪Glass table, 🖼️ artwork require wooden crate packing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Society Entry Rules</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚧 Some societies have restrictions on time slots, gate passes or entry of trucks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Weekend / Night Shifting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🌃 If you want to shift at night or Sunday, then a little extra charge may be levied.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why is ShiftingPort Pricing the most reliable?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔍 No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>📄 Free Pre-Move Survey &amp; Final Quotation</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Complete breakup shared on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST Invoice &amp; On-site Payment Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 Example: Cost of shifting 2BHK from Sushant Lok A Block to Sector 43</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹1,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Labor Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck Rental</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,800 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td><strong>Total Estimated Amount</strong></td>\r\n			<td><strong>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</strong></td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📢 Note: All prices are based on estimates. Book our free pre-move survey to know the final rates. This will give you an accurate and clear quote.</strong></p>', '<h2>❓Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) &ndash; Sushant Lok Gurgaon Packers and Movers</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Customers have many questions before shifting &ndash; and ShiftingPort aims to provide simple, clear and reliable answers to each question. Below, we have listed the most common and important questions related to shifting in Sushant Lok Gurgaon.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q1. Does ShiftingPort serve every Block of Sushant Lok?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. ShiftingPort serves Sushant Lok A, B, C, D Blocks, C1-C2 Apartments, Vyapar Kendra area, and all areas near HUDA Market. We do full shifting as per society rules, entry timings and parking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q2. Can shifting be done in a single day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, if you are shifting from Sushant Lok to within Gurgaon, like Sector 43, DLF Phase 2 or South City, 1 BHK, 2 BHK and 3 BHK houses can be shifted in a single day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q3. Is Society NOC and Gate Pass required?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. Most RWAs ask for Gate Pass or NOC for gate entry. Customer needs to get this document from the society office. ShiftingPort helps you to provide driver name, vehicle number and team details so that you can get NOC without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q4. Can shifting be done at night or Sunday?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we do shifting on Sundays and nights as well. Many families and offices prefer to move on weekends or at night. We book time slots in advance and do all the preparations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q5. Are TVs, Furniture and Crockery packed safely?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We use 5-layer packing:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Bubble Wrap + Foam Sheet + Thermocol + Stretch Film + Carton Box.</li>\r\n	<li>For expensive furniture and glass items, Wooden Crates and &quot;Handle With Care&quot; tags are used.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q6. Do you also provide car and bike transport service?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. ShiftingPort transports your car or bike from Sushant Lok to any city in India &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Covered Containers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Door Pickup &amp; Delivery</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Dent-Free Guarantee</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q7. Is there unpacking and furniture set-up after packing?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. After shifting, we re-setup your bed, sofa, dining table etc. and also remove garbage after unpacking. This service is provided as per client requirement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q8. Is advance booking necessary?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Some societies in Sushant Lok have limited shifting time slots. Hence, we suggest booking at least 2&ndash;3 days in advance so that entry permission, truck slot and team planning can be done on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q9. Is it necessary to take Transit Insurance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Not necessary, but we recommend it. Transit Insurance protects your belongings from any untoward incident on the road. We insure from IRDA-approved companies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book with ShiftingPort in 3 easy ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>WhatsApp / Call:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are with you 24x7.</strong></p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Sushant Lok Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'Best Packers Sushant Lok, Movers near me Gurgaon, Sushant Lok Packers Movers Charges, Shifting Services Gurgaon, ShiftingPort Packers Movers, Packers and movers Sushant Lok', 'Trusted Packers and Movers in Sushant Lok Gurgaon for home, office & car shifting. Safe packing, fast delivery & affordable pricing. Book with ShiftingPort now.', '2025-07-08 10:47:17', '2025-07-08 16:59:22');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(69, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 8, 1, 1, 1, 8, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon South City 1', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-south-city-1', NULL, NULL, 'Get hassle-free home, office & car shifting in South City 1 and 2, Gurgaon with ShiftingPort. Safe packaging, expert handling, and on-time delivery. Trusted by 1000+ families. Call now for affordable and professional relocation service.', '<h2>🏡 Shifting house in South City 1 Gurgaon is not just a change, it is a new beginning &ndash; and ShiftingPort is the trusted partner for that beginning</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>South City 1, Gurgaon is an area known not only for its central location but also for its planned colonies, wide roads, green parks and convenient lifestyle. Located right next to HUDA City Centre Metro Station, this area remains the first choice of families, professionals and retirees. When you think of shifting here, you need a partner who understands both your property value and your emotional value &ndash; and ShiftingPort does just that.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers reaches every home, flat, society and street in South City 1 with its local expertise, trained staff and safe packing. We understand that shifting in this beautiful area of ​​Sector 41 is not a simple service but a responsibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ We are present in every area of ​​South City 1:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort offers shifting services in every block and society of South City 1, such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Block A, B, C, D, E and F</li>\r\n	<li>👉 South End Floors</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Pockets adjacent to Mayfield Garden</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Sections near Unitech Heritage City</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Residential lanes adjacent to HUDA Park, Sector 41 Road</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Vyapar Kendra and its surrounding lanes</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Areas adjacent to Lotus Valley International School, DPS, Blue Bells</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are living on the ground floor or 4th floor, whether you own a villa or a rented flat &ndash; ShiftingPort guarantees you timely, safe and hassle-free shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Why is Shifting in South City 1 special?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>South City 1 is a densely populated but planned location. Most of the houses here are 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and Duplex Independent Floors. The biggest feature of this area is that the colonies have smooth vehicle movement, but each society has its own entry guidelines. Some societies allow truck entry only within a time-slot, while some allow vehicles to enter only through a specific route. The local team at ShiftingPort keeps abreast of all this so that your home shifting is completed without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Why do South City 1 customers trust ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Local Knowledge: Information about every lane, every block of South City 1</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Moving as per time-slot: Moving as per RWA guidelines</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Premium Packing Material: Safe packing of your valuables</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Team: Trained staff in uniform, with ID cards</li>\r\n	<li>✅ 24x7 Support: One call response, live tracking and WhatsApp updates</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort believes that we are not just moving goods, we are moving your &quot;part of life&quot; from one place to another - with complete safety, respect and responsibility. ShiftingPort is the perfect choice for a prestigious and organised area like South City 1.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚚 What are the various Packers and Movers services we provide in South City 1?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort offers not just one or two types of shifting services in South City 1 Gurgaon, but customized shifting services for every need at your doorstep. Whether you are shifting from Block A to Block E or office shifting near Vyapar Kendra &ndash; our services are professional and hassle-free in every case.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are our top services that are specially designed for South City 1 and nearby areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Relocation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Mostly 2BHK, 3BHK, Duplex flats and I