er:</strong> We do 5-layer packing which includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Bubble wrap, Foam sheet, Corrugated box, Stretch film, and Wooden Crate (if required).</li>\r\n	<li>All fragile items are kept separately with a &#39;Handle with Care&#39; label.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 6. Is there a facility for car/bike transport?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we send cars/bikes from South City 1 to any city in the country through Covered Containers. GPS tracking and safe loading-lashing are available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 7. Is insurance necessary for the goods?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> It is not necessary, but we recommend taking Transit Insurance. This will help in getting a claim if there is any accidental damage to the goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 8. Can shifting be done at night or on weekends?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, many customers of South City 1 move on weekends or evenings. We schedule our staff as per your convenience - just need to clear the time slot with RWA.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 9. Is office/shop shifting available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! We do shifting of Vyapar Kendra, SCO market and small and big offices in South City 1 with complete planning and safe packing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book instantly through these 3 ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call/Whatsapp:</strong> +91-8586828846</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are available 24x7 and provide priority service for South City 1.</strong></p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Gurgaon South City 1 | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers South City 1 Gurgaon, South City 1 office relocation, car transport South City Gurgaon, affordable movers South City 1, packers and movers gurgaon south city, packers and movers gurgaon south city 1, packers movers south city 1', 'Trusted packers and movers in South City 1 Gurgaon for safe house shifting, office relocation & car relocation. ShiftingPort offers expert team, timely delivery & transparent pricing.', '2025-07-08 18:19:50', '2025-07-08 20:40:42'),
(70, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 9, 1, 1, 1, 11, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon South City 2', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-south-city-2', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort brings safe, fast, and affordable packing and moving services in South City 2 Gurgaon. Whether you live in Tulip Ivory, Malibu Towne or Bestech Park View, we offer hassle-free home, office, and vehicle shifting with expert staff, premium packing, and timely delivery.', '<h2>✅ Shifting Needs in South City 2 Gurgaon and Why ShiftingPort is Your First Choice?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>🏡 South City 2 &ndash; A Well Organized and Developed Residential Area Where Shifting Should Be Smart and Easy South City 2 in Gurugram is a planned residential zone located near Sector 49 and Sector 50 and it&#39;s gated societies, wide roads, green parks, and well-connected locations make it a favorite for families and professionals. If you are planning to shift to South City 2, you need just one thing &ndash; a moving partner who understands the area and can make your shifting stress-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 ShiftingPort &ndash; Your Trusted and Experienced Packers and Movers in South City 2</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort makes every shift easy, safe and on time. We have successfully done hundreds of shiftings in various apartments, flats and independent houses in South City 2, so we have full experience of the society policies, security rules and gate entry timings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🔍 These are the major areas we cover in South City 2:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>➡️ Orchid Petals Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Mayfield Garden (Blocks A, B, C, D, E, F)</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Uniworld Gardens</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Uppal&#39;s Southend</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Malibu Towne</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Eros Rosewood City</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Vatika City</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Blocks near Nirvana Country</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Spaze Privy, Today Blossoms 2</li>\r\n	<li>➡️ Internal roads connecting Sector 49 and Sector 50</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ Why is ShiftingPort your first choice in South City 2?</h3>