atsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 Support GST invoice and on-site payment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📞 6. 24x7 support and live tracking</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📱 Live location of truck</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Photo and video proof of packing</li>\r\n	<li>☎️ Instant connectivity on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;💼 Dedicated Customer Relationship Executive</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 7. Not a &ldquo;Relocation&rdquo;, it&#39;s a new beginning of your life</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We treat every shifting as the beginning of a new life chapter - with emotional connection, respect and safety.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&ldquo;ShiftingPort is not just packers and movers, it&#39;s an experience.&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>✅ ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Services in South City 2 Gurgaon &ndash; Full Range of Home, Office, Local and Vehicle Shifting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>South City 2, Gurgaon is a mixed residential area, with high-rise towers to villas, floor systems, studio apartments and corporate offices. Residents expect safe, timely and high-quality shifting services &ndash; and ShiftingPort fully understands this need.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our services are not limited to just shifting goods but provide a complete relocation solution as per the need of every customer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Relocation &ndash; From Flat to Villa</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Major societies in South City 2 include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏢 Tulip White, Tulip Orange, Uniworld Gardens 2, Malibu Towne, Mayfield Garden, Bestech Park View Spa Next.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have prior shifting experience and understand every layout, lift size, gate timing. Our home shifting services include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing of kitchen, bedroom, dining, pooja ghar</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Furniture dismantling and re-assembly</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Box packing and inventory list with labels</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Packing proof and live sharing with customer</li>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Help in shifting to new home</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office and Startup Shifting (Office Relocation)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There is a lot of office movement from South City 2 to Cyber ​​Park, Udyog Vihar, Sohna Road or Golf Course Road. We offer you no work disturbance, off-hours and weekend moves:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💻 Computer, printer, UPS and server packing</li>\r\n	<li>🗂️ Department wise backup and labeling</li>\r\n	<li>🔒 Safety of confidential documents</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Safe loading of office chairs, desks and cabinets</li>\r\n	<li>🕐 Shifting time slots are planned as per the office schedule</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛻 3. Local Shifting &ndash; South City 2 to nearby areas</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are shifting from South City 2 to South City 1, Sector 50, Sector 57, Nirvana Country or Sushant Lok, ShiftingPort can get the entire shifting done in just 4 to 6 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ Same-Day Move</li>\r\n	<li>🚪 Gate-to-Gate Service</li>\r\n	<li>💰 Budget-Friendly Packages</li>\r\n	<li>🔧 Furniture Repair &amp; Re-Arrangement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚙 4. Vehicle Shifting (Car/Bike Transport) &ndash; Safe</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many customers in South City 2 move their car or bike to another city &ndash; we make the process easy and safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚗 Car Transport via Covered Container</li>\r\n	<li>🏍️ Bike Shifting with Foam &amp; Lashing</li>\r\n	<li>📍 GPS Tracking &amp; Live Updates</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ No-Dent Guarantee &amp; Insurance Support</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 Same Day Pickup Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Storage &amp; Warehousing &ndash; Safe Option When Needed</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If your new home or office is not ready, ShiftingPort provides you with a guaranteed safe and modern warehouse.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Box-wise inventory and tagging</li>\r\n	<li>🧯 Fire safety and CCTV security</li>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Dehumidified space for furniture/electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🗓️ Short and long term options</li>\r\n	<li>🎁 6. Extra Value Added Services (On Request)</li>\r\n	<li>🧼 Post move cleaning</li>\r\n	<li>🪴 Plant movement</li>\r\n	<li>🐶 Pet shifting (dog/cat)</li>\r\n	<li>📃 Movement NOC &amp; documentation guide</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Disposable boxes &amp; packing material recycling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Packers and Movers Charges in South City 2 Gurgaon &ndash; Know the exact cost of your shifting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When planning a shifting to South City 2, the first question is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo; This is the first question we clear at ShiftingPort. We try to provide you with transparent, clear and pre-determined prices &ndash; without any hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our rate chart is based on your home size, distance, quantity of goods and any extra services.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 Approximate Charges Table</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🔄 Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>🏠 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌏 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Key factors affecting shifting charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Size of the house and floor access:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Societies like Tulip Orange, Malibu Towne have lift and parking facilities, which can reduce the charges.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Floor number and lift distance from stairs also affect the cost.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Amount of luggage and special items:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Washing machine, 4-door fridge, large bed or wardrobe incur extra packing/loading cost.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Items like crockery, glass furniture, piano may require wooden crate packing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Time and day:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Weekend or late-night shifting may attract some extra charges.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 Depends on the timing allowed by the society.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Special service required:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 If you need unpacking, furniture setup, cleaning or storage, separate price may be added.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 Why is ShiftingPort the most trusted brand with best charging system?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ No hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Free on-site survey before move</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete breakdown shared on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST bill and on-site payment facility</li>\r\n	<li>✅ &quot;No Confusion, No Last Minute Charges&quot; policy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ShiftingPort में, हम वादा करते हैं &ndash; &quot;जो Quote किया गया है, वही Final होगा!&quot;</strong></p>', '<h2>❓ South City 2 Gurgaon Packers and Movers &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 1. Does ShiftingPort serve all the societies and blocks in South City 2?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort services are available in all the blocks and apartments of South City 2 &ndash; like Tulip Ivory, Malibu Towne, Bestech Park View Spa, Mayfield Garden, Uppal&rsquo;s Southend, etc. Our team knows every lane, gate and rule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 2. Can 1 BHK or 2 BHK shifting from South City 2 be done in one day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! If the society gate pass is received on time and space is available for the truck, then 1BHK or 2BHK house shifting can be completed in a single day. Our team can complete the entire job in 4&ndash;6 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 3. Is advance booking necessary?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, some societies in South City 2 have entry pass, lift booking and time restrictions for shifting. Hence we recommend booking at least 2&ndash;3 days in advance so that the team can reach on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 4. Does ShiftingPort provide society gate pass and NOC?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You have to get NOC and gate pass from your RWA. But we help you a lot with it &ndash; like vehicle number, staff details, ID proof etc. in advance so that you can get NOC easily.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 5. Are TV, fridge, glass items shifted safely?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we shift all valuables in multi-layer packing. For LED TV, Crockery, Furniture we use Thermocol, Bubble Wrap and Wooden Crates.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 6. Does ShiftingPort transport bikes and cars?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we transport your car and bike in a covered vehicle, with GPS tracking, without any scratches. Whether you need to shift to Delhi, Jaipur or Bangalore &ndash; we provide services on every route.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 7. Is shifting possible at night or weekend?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, many societies have weekend or late evening slots for shifting. Our team is ready according to that time, provided we get permission from your society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 8. Does the team also do furniture setup and unpacking after shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we reassemble beds, sofas, dining tables etc. and also do box unpacking and waste removal if you ask for it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 9. Is transit insurance necessary?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Not necessary, but we recommend taking insurance for large or valuable items. This will help you get a claim in case of any untoward incident during transit. ShiftingPort provides you with a policy from an IRDA approved insurance partner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🔹 10. How to book?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book with us in 3 easy ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call / WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are available 24x7 to help you.</strong></p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in South City 2 Gurgaon | Safe & Fast Shifting', 'Packers and Movers South City 2 Gurgaon, Movers in South City 2 Gurgaon, House Shifting South City 2, Office Relocation South City 2 Gurgaon, Car Relocation Services South City 2, Bike Shifting South City Gurgaon, Best Packers near Tulip Ivory, Affordable Movers Malibu Towne, Trusted Relocation Company South City 2, Top Packers and Movers South City 2 Gurgaon, Local Shifting Service South City 2, Moving Services Near Me South City 2, Packers for Malibu Towne Gurgaon, Safe Household Movers Gurgaon, Verified Movers South City Gurgaon', 'ShiftingPort offers expert Packers and Movers services in South City 2 Gurgaon for home, office & car relocation. Safe packing, on-time delivery, affordable rates. Trusted by families in Tulip Ivory, Malibu Towne, Bestech Park View & more.', '2025-07-08 21:08:45', '2025-07-08 21:56:21');
