(71, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 10, 1, 1, 1, 12, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 22', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-22', '1999', NULL, 'Safe and professional packers and movers in Sector 22 Gurgaon. ShiftingPort offers home, office, vehicle relocation, and storage with expert team, secure packing and 24x7 support. Trusted by thousands for smooth, stress-free moving.', '<h2>🏡 Planning to shift to Sector 22 Gurgaon? Get professional help from ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 22 in Gurgaon is one of those areas that offers all the modern living amenities, great connectivity and an accessible lifestyle. The posh colonies, societies and independent housing systems here make it a prime location for residential and commercial shifting. Whether you are thinking of house shifting, office relocation or furniture and vehicle moving &ndash; ShiftingPort is your most trusted choice to do it all in a safe, fast and comfortable manner in Sector 22.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>The features of Sector 22 make it a premium shifting zone:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏙️ The area includes residential areas like Huda Flats, Railway Road Colony, Jyoti Park, Police Colony, and DLF Colony.</li>\r\n	<li>🚇 The proximity to MG Road, IFFCO Chowk and NH-48 connects the area well to other sectors of Delhi and Gurgaon.</li>\r\n	<li>🏫 Schools, hospitals, markets and metro are all located nearby, making relocation smooth and convenient.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Now let&#39;s talk about shifting&mdash;shifting to Sector 22 is not just about moving stuff, it is the beginning of a new life. And ShiftingPort understands that.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹 Our approach is local-friendly and society-ready specifically for Sector 22</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 We follow all local rules like lift access, gate permissions, truck entry timing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹 From packing to unpacking, our team provides precise planning and timely service at every step</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking to shift from 1BHK to 4BHK, Independent House or Duplex in Sector 22, or want to move office, then ShiftingPort&#39;s experience and team makes this entire process easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>💬 &quot;We shift your feelings, not stuff&quot; - this is our basic mantra.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our service is active in every Block, Street and Colony of Sector 22 Gurgaon &ndash; be it the lane of Jyoti Park or the Apartment Society of Old Delhi Road, we reach there on time, with a smile.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>⭐ Why ShiftingPort is the Most Trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 22 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 22 Gurgaon is a location where every family, office or professional needs a trusted, experienced and accountable shifting partner. And that is why ShiftingPort is today known as the most trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 22, Gurgaon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This section targets keywords like &quot;best packers and movers sector 22 gurgaon&quot;, &quot;trusted movers in sector 22&quot;, &quot;verified packers sector 22 gurgaon&quot; for ranking on Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 1. Trusted Brand - Trust is our identity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done safe and successful shifting of 500+ houses and 100+ offices in Sector 22. Every customer chooses us because:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ We have a track record of 100% safe deliveries</li>\r\n	<li>✅ No items are broken or missing</li>\r\n	<li>✅ We treat every shifting like a mission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧑&zwj;🔧 2. Trained and verified staff</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff doesn&rsquo;t just lift items &ndash; they manage your trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👷&zwj;♂️ Every employee is background checked</li>\r\n	<li>📛 Service is provided only in uniform and ID card</li>\r\n	<li>🗣️ Every team member is polite, professional and customer-friendly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. High-quality packing material</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 22 flats and independent houses often contain glass, marble, antique items and electronics. We use:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🛡️ 5 layer packing &ndash; Bubble Wrap, Foam, Corrugated Sheet, Stretch Film, and Furniture Blanket</li>\r\n	<li>🪵 Wooden Crates &ndash; For fragile items like artworks, temples, showcases</li>\r\n	<li>🧳 Labelled Boxes &ndash; Every box is tagged with name, room and contents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🕒 4. Timely Shifting &ndash; No delays</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many societies in Sector 22 have fixed gate timings. We plan the entire shifting process accordingly:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📆 Pre-scheduling of time and date</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 Live location of truck through GPS tracking</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Lift &amp; Entry Permission is taken in advance</li>\r\n	<li>📞 Dedicated Move Manager is in touch all the time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 5. Transparent rates and no hidden charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You can be at peace when you shift from us because:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧾 The rate quoted to you will be final</li>\r\n	<li>💬 Complete price breakup is sent on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>📋 GST bill and online payment facility is available</li>\r\n	<li>💡 &quot;Pay What You See&quot; &ndash; No Surprises!</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💼 6. End-to-End Complete Relocation Experience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just Packers &amp; Movers &ndash; we are Total Moving Partner.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Packing + Loading + Transport + Unloading + Unpacking</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Weekend/Night Move for Office Shifting</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Furniture Re-assembly, Cleaning Support, Insurance</li>\r\n	<li>🏬 Short Term Storage Facility (When you haven&#39;t found a new house)</li>\r\n	<li>💯 Our Regular Clients in Sector 22 include:</li>\r\n	<li>🏘️ Shivaji Nagar Flats</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Devika Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🕌 Houses near Arya Samaj Road</li>\r\n	<li>🌇 Houses near Palam Vihar Border</li>\r\n	<li>🚕 Family Relocation in Udyog Vihar and Delhi Cantt</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔍 Our presence in Sector 22 Gurgaon &ndash; Reliable service in every lane, every colony, every society</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 22, Gurgaon is a mixed residential and semi-commercial area with all types of homes, flats, and offices. Shifting in the lanes, colonies, and societies here requires a local expert team that has a ground understanding of the area. ShiftingPort is the first choice of every customer who wants their shifting to be completed on time, safely, and without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍Which areas do we cover?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are active in the following areas and societies under Sector 22:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jyoti Park</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&ndash; It is full of 2-3 BHK flats and independent houses. Our team plans the shifting keeping in mind the tight entry, no-entry times, and truck movement rules of these lanes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Huda Flats Sector 22</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&ndash; A preferred location for government and private employees. There are multi-storey buildings, where our team already has experience of working with lifts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Railway Colony / Police Line</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&ndash; This area is highly regulated with security permissions and entry-gate norms. Our experience guarantees hassle-free shifting here.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>DLF Colony / Shivaji Nagar adjoining areas</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&ndash; Societies where high-security and entry pass is required, we reach there only after taking permission in advance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Blocks around Old Delhi Road</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>&ndash; There are small and big houses and many rental properties here. These are areas where quick shifting on the weekend is the first choice of the customer.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Why is shifting in Sector 22 a little different?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🚧 Many lanes here are narrow, where the movement of big trucks is limited &ndash; so we work with small vehicles and smart planning of time.</li>\r\n	<li>🔐 Society Gate Timings and Luggage Checking is a common process &ndash; ShiftingPort team manages all this in advanc