r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call / WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are available 24x7 to provide complete assistance before and after your every shifting.</strong></p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Sector 22 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort – Safe & Fast Shifting', 'packers and movers sector 22 gurgaon, best packers movers sector 22 gurgaon, home shifting sector 22, office relocation sector 22 gurgaon, local shifting in sector 22, car bike transport gurgaon, shifting service near me, packers and movers near me, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 22, packers movers gurgaon sector 22', 'ShiftingPort offers reliable packers and movers in Sector 22 Gurgaon. Safe house shifting, office relocation, vehicle transport & warehousing – all at best price with no hidden charges. Book 24x7.', '2025-07-08 21:23:38', '2025-07-16 09:55:25'),
(72, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 11, 1, 1, 1, 13, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 23', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-23', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort offers professional packers and movers in Sector 23 Gurgaon. From local home shifting to office and vehicle relocation, we provide timely, damage-free and affordable services. Book your move today and experience stress-free shifting.', '<h3>🏠 House Shifting in Sector 23 Gurgaon is now Easy &ndash; Get Reliable Shifting Services with ShiftingPort</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 23 Gurgaon is one of the areas where thousands of people move in and out every year. Whether you are shifting from Palam Vihar or coming from Sector 22, Udyog Vihar, or Delhi &ndash; Sector 23 Gurgaon has always been a preferred location. The demand for houses in the societies like Surya Vihar, Rail Vihar, Shiv Vihar, New Palam Vihar Extension, and Ashok Vihar Phase III Extension is also very high. Hence, when it comes to shifting, choosing a reliable and professional Packers and Movers becomes the most important thing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort brings you a solution that will not only pack and shift your belongings but will also make your entire shifting experience stress-free. We are available in every block and street in Sector 23 &ndash; Block A, B, C, D, Shiv Puri, Harijan Basti, Sheetla Mata Colony, and Ashok Vihar Border &ndash; where our team reaches on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why do you need professional Packers and Movers in Sector 23 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 23 has a diverse area &ndash; you will find wide roads, dense settlements, and narrow lanes in some places. Also, many societies have parking restrictions and gate passes. In such situations, only an experienced team can carry out the shifting without any hassle. The ShiftingPort team knows every street and rules here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our services are specifically designed for those who want:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Secure packing and scratch-free delivery</li>\r\n	<li>⏰ Timely shifting and tracking facility</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 Clear rates without hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ Uniformed staff and coordinated process</li>\r\n	<li>🏘️ Local team covering every area</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 In which areas of Sector 23 is ShiftingPort available?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are providing shifting services in every major area in Sector 23, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏠 Surya Vihar Part 1 &amp; 2</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 New Palam Vihar (Extension &amp; Blocks)</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Rail Vihar Society</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Shiv Vihar, Shiv Colony</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Harijan Basti, Sheetla Mata Road</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Ashok Vihar Phase III Extn.</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Sector 23 Main Market Area</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 DLF Gate No. 1 Border Area</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our vehicles reach every street, every colony on time and take complete arrangements like gate pass, lift access and packing clearance from the customer before starting the shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📈 Who liked us the most in Sector 23?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done 300+ successful shiftings in Sector 23 so far &ndash; including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;👩&zwj;👧&zwj;👦 Families who moved from Palam Vihar or Ashok Vihar to Sector 23</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Professionals who moved from Delhi to New Palam Vihar</li>\r\n	<li>💼 Offices who shifted from small space to bigger flat or kothi</li>\r\n	<li>🧳 Students and Single Professionals who shifted from PG to flat</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has a solution for every kind of need &ndash; fast, reliable and affordable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 What are our services available in Sector 23 Gurgaon? &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers &amp; Movers</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just a name, it is a trusted service in Sector 23 Gurgaon. Whether you are shifting from a small flat or a big bungalow &ndash; every service is customized to you. We have successfully shifted homes, offices and vehicles in every lane, colony and society of Sector 23.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Read about all our services in detail here:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Relocation &ndash; From 1BHK to Villa</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have shifted many 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK and Villas in areas like Rail Vihar, New Palam Vihar, and Surya Vihar in Sector 23. Our home shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Safe packing of all items from kitchen, bedroom, drawing room</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Dismantling and safe packing of items like sofa, bed, dining table</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Labeling of each item by making an inventory list</li>\r\n	<li>🚚 Sequential loading of truck and unloading at the new location</li>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ Re-setup and disposal of packing waste in your presence</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office/Startup Relocation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 23 has many big and small offices and co-working spaces, which we have shifted. We provide the following services for your office shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💻 Packing of IT equipment like computers, printers, monitors, CCTV</li>\r\n	<li>📂 Confidential labeling for data-sensitive files</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Tagging of boxes and machines according to each department</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 Shifting at night or weekend without affecting work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 3. Local Shifting &ndash; From Sector 23 to nearby areas (Intra-City Shifting)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>From Sector 23 to Palam Vihar, Sector 22, Sheetla Mata Road, or Rajendra Park, we do the shifting in just 3&ndash;6 hours:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧳 One-Day Full Shifting &ndash; Be it 1BHK or 3BHK</li>\r\n	<li>🛻 Complete packing and security even for short distance shifting</li>\r\n	<li>📦 GPS tracking and security cover in all vehicles</li>\r\n	<li>🔧 Furniture dismantling and re-setup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 4. Car and bike transportation (Vehicle Shifting Services)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort also transports your vehicles to a safe place. We provide car and bike transport from Sector 23 across India:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🛻 Both Covered and Open Container options</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Door Pickup and Door Delivery</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Vehicle is fixed with strapping and safety pads</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Live GPS Tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Storage and Warehouse Facility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you do not want to shift right now or the possession of the house is delayed, we can keep your belongings in Short Term or Long Term storage:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏢 CCTV-secured warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>🧰 Moisture-proof and pest-resistant environment</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Every box is tracked with barcode and inventory</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 6. Packing and Unpacking &ndash; by Professional Experts</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Everyone has a different way of packing Crockery, TV, Showcase Items or Frames in Sector 23. ShiftingPort professionally packs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧻 5 Layer Bubble Wrap + Foam + Stretch Film</li>\r\n	<li>🪵 Wooden Crate for Glass, Artworks &amp; Electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🗂️ Matching Full List on Unpacking and Garbage Removal</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>⭐ Why is ShiftingPort your first and right choice in Sector 23 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 23 Gurgaon is counted among those areas where all types of families &ndash; from middle class to upper class &ndash; live according to their convenience. In such a situation, when the time of shifting comes, the need for a reliable, professional and transparent packers and movers is the most important. ShiftingPort fulfills this need &ndash; that too in a completely professional manner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let&#39;s find out why Sector 23 customers choose ShiftingPort first:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Local Area Knowledge + Fast Execution</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know every lane, every pocket and colony of Sector 23 - be it:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📍 Surya Vihar</li>\r\n	<li>📍 New Palam Vihar (Blocks A to D)</li>\r\n	<li>📍 RWA societies near Sheetla Mata Road</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Independent Floors near Udyog Vihar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>With this local understanding, we manage every aspect of your area like traffic, parking, entry time and lift access in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ 2. Verified, Experienced and Staff in Uniform</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every employee at ShiftingPort:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧍&zwj;♂️ is in uniform</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Police Verified and Background Checked</li>\r\n	<li>🧳 Trained in handling electronic items, fragile goods, and furniture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Customers receive respect and professional behavior at every stage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. High-Quality Packing &ndash; Customized Approach for Sector 23</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every home is different, so every packing is also different. We have used these packing methods in many flats and floors in Sector 23:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧼 Bubble Wrap + Foam Sheet + Thermocol</li>\r\n	<li>🪟 Wooden Box for LCD/LED and Frames</li>\r\n	<li>🪑 Furniture Blanket for Sofas, Beds, Modular Furniture</li>\r\n	<li>🧴 Kitchen Crockery is packed in Anti-Vibration Layer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 4. Timely Delivery &ndash; Be it Local or Intercity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have completed many shiftings in Sector 23 in 3 to 5 hours. We have:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🕒 Fixed Time Scheduling System</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Trucks with GPS Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;💼 On-Ground Supervisor</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 Lift &amp; Gate Permission is filed in advance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>So we complete 98% of shiftings on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💸 5. Transparent Pricing &ndash; No Hidden Charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort respects your budget. We never give you &#39;more after work&#39; surprises.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📊 Pre-Move Survey to get the perfect estimate</li>\r\n	<li>📩 Complete Breakup on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST Bill and Payment Receipt</li>\r\n	<li>🛑 Zero Hidden Charges Policy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 6. Real-Time Support &ndash; Solution to every question at any time</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are at Palam Vihar Border or in any street of Surya Vihar &ndash; our support never sleeps:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📞 24x7 Call and WhatsApp Help</li>\r\n	<li>🛰️ Real-Time Truck Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>🧍 Relationship Manager Assign</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Photo Proofs of Packing &amp; Loading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛏️ 7. Value-Added Services &ndash; Extra facilities for Sector 23 residents</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort not only provides goods lifting and moving, but we also provide these additional facilities to Sector 23 residents:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🧽 Post-Move Deep Cleaning (On Request)</li>\r\n	<li>🐶 Pet Relocation (Local + Intercity)</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Furniture Arrangement</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Temporary Storage Facility</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Transit Insurance + Claim Support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Packers and Movers Charges in Sector 23 Gurgaon &ndash; Full Price Details</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When you plan to shift from Sector 23 Gurgaon, the first question that comes to mind is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo; ShiftingPort answers this question with a very transparent, estimated and no hidden cost rate list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our prices are completely based on the quantity of your belongings, distance, floor access and special requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 Sector 23 Gurgaon Packers and Movers Estimated Price Chart:</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🔄 Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>🏠 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌏 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Main factors affecting prices &ndash; Sector 23 Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏢 Floor and lift facility:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Flats that do not have lifts or have very narrow staircases may cost a little extra.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📦 Item volume and weight:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Heavy furniture, kitchen items, washing machines, TVs, cupboards etc. demand separate packing and labour.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🛠️ Special items (pianos, paintings, showpieces):</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>These require wooden crates or multi-layer packing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚚 Site Gate and No-Entry Time:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Some societies in Sector 23 have time limits for loading/unloading.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🌃 Night or Weekend Moving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>There may be a little extra charge for shifting on night shifts or Sundays.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why ShiftingPort&#39;s Price Structure is the most trusted in Sector 23?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📲 Accurate Quotations after Free Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>🔒 Zero Hidden Charges Policy</li>\r\n	<li>💬 Complete breakup on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>📋 GST Invoice and Digital Payment Facility</li>\r\n	<li>💯 &ldquo;Jo Bola Wahi Bill&rdquo; Transparency</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓ FAQ &ndash; FAQs about Sector 23 Gurgaon Packers and Movers</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are answers to frequently asked questions by customers about shifting in Sector 23 Gurgaon. If you have any questions in mind, you may find the answer below:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 1. Does ShiftingPort serve every block and colony of Sector 23?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we cover every area of ​​Sector 23 &ndash; HUDA Plots, RWA Societies, L-Block, Shiv Puri, Chander Lok, Om Vihar and areas around Palam Vihar Border. No matter where you are, our team will reach your doorstep on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 2. Can house shifting be done in 1 day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! If you are doing a local shifting in Sector 23 (e.g. Sector 23 to Palam Vihar or Sector 22), we can do 1BHK, 2BHK and even 3BHK shifting in a single day &ndash; just need to take permission from the society in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 3. Do we do office shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort is experienced in office, startup and corporate office shifting as well. We have done many office shifting from Sector 23 to Cyber ​​City, MG Road, Udyog Vihar or Sohna Road &ndash; without any data loss or property damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 4. Do we need to book in advance for shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> It is always better to book at least 2 to 3 days in advance so that the team can prepare for time-slots and permissions &ndash; especially for flats and RWA gate passes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 5. Are packing materials charged separately?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Our quotation is a full package which includes packing material, truck, labour etc. But if any special packing is required (like Wooden Crate or Thermocol Casing), then that can be extra &ndash; which will be cleared in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 6. Is car and bike transport also done?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! We also provide Car/Bike Transport service from Sector 23 to cities like Delhi, Mumbai, Jaipur, Chandigarh, Pune &ndash; with GPS Tracking, Door Pickup and secure lashing system.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 7. Is shifting done at night or on Sundays also?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, many customers want to shift during Weekends or Evening Time. We also plan night shifts as per Society Guidelines. Just confirm the timing and permission in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 8. Do you dismantle and then fit the furniture?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Our professional staff dismantles your Bed, Sofa, Dining Table, Almira etc, packs it safely and reassembles it at the new location &ndash; without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 9. Is there luggage insurance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we do offer Transit Insurance (with IRDA approved companies). It is optional but highly recommended for high-value luggage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book ShiftingPort in 3 easy ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call / WhatsApp: </strong>+91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We are available for you 24x7!</strong></p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Sector 23 Gurgaon | Affordable & Safe Shifting', 'Packers and Movers Sector 23 Gurgaon, Home Shifting Sector 23, Office Relocation Sector 23, Bike Transport Sector 23 Gurgaon, Packers Movers, Packers and Movers, packers and movers in sector 23 gurgaon, best packers and movers gurgaon sector 23, packers and movers near me', 'Looking for trusted packers and movers in Sector 23 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort offers professional home, office & vehicle relocation with safe packing, timely delivery & transparent pricing. Book now for hassle-free moving!', '2025-07-09 06:53:38', '2025-07-09 07:21:27');
