(73, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 12, 1, 1, 1, 14, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 24', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-24', '1999', NULL, 'Planning to shift your home or office in Sector 24 Gurgaon? Get a smart moving experience with reliable packing, safe delivery and tracking facility from the professional team at ShiftingPort - that too within your budget.', '<h2>🏡 Home or Office Shifting in Sector 24 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort is your trusted partner</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 24, Gurgaon is an area known for its serene location, great connectivity and premium residential societies. With MG Road, Cyber ​​City and NH-8 just minutes away, many people decide to settle down or shift their office here. But when it comes to shifting, only professional and experienced packers and movers are right for a location like Sector 24.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is why hundreds of families and businesses in Sector 24 chose ShiftingPort &ndash; a name that shifts not just goods, but also trust and convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 Why is the need for shifting in Sector 24 Gurgaon increasing?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏘️ High-Rise Apartments like DLF City Court, Sahara Grace, and Shivam Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 MG Road proximity for office relocation</li>\r\n	<li>🛣️ Metro connectivity (Sikanderpur and MG Road Metro very close)</li>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;👩&zwj;👧&zwj;👦 Family-friendly colonies like Akashneem Marg, Samrat Ashok Enclave</li>\r\n	<li>🏫 Schools, parks, hospitals all nearby</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a situation, people often move to Sector 24 in search of a better home or a bigger office space. And every move requires a partner who can complete the shifting on time, safely and without any hassle &ndash; and this is what ShiftingPort does.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Why is ShiftingPort the first choice for Sector 24?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Local experience &ndash; We understand every street, society and no-entry time of Sector 24</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete solution from packing to furniture setup</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS enabled truck and real-time tracking</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional &amp; verified staff &ndash; with uniform and ID</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Available even in short notice &ndash; whether it is local or intercity move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We know that Sector 24 has many local challenges like parking rules, lift timings and society gate passes. But the team of ShiftingPort understands all these in advance and plans the shifting accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ We cover these locations in Sector 24:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Akashneem Marg</li>\r\n	<li>Samrat Ashok Enclave</li>\r\n	<li>DLF City Court Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>Sahara Grace</li>\r\n	<li>Suncity Success Tower (near MG Road)</li>\r\n	<li>Shivam Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>Independent Houses &amp; Villas in A Block &amp; B Block</li>\r\n	<li>Colonies near HUDA Park</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team comes to your doorstep and handles everything from packing to moving in a professional manner with utmost care.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>⭐ Why ShiftingPort is the most trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 24 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When shifting to a premium and serene location like Sector 24, not just your belongings but also your emotions, your memories and the things you have earned with your hard work move from one place to another. In such a situation, there is a need for a moving partner who is not only professional but also reliable. ShiftingPort is providing services in Sector 24 Gurgaon with this thought in mind &ndash; where every moving is completed like a mission.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Years of Trust &ndash; Trust of Sector 24 Residents</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have successfully moved many homes and offices in Sector 24 &ndash; Akashneem Marg, Shivam Apartments, DLF City Court and hundreds of other locations with clean records:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>500+ Successful Local &amp; Intercity Moves</li>\r\n	<li>100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee</li>\r\n	<li>Verified by Local Clients &amp; Societies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧑&zwj;🔧 2. Trained &amp; Verified Staff &ndash; Uniform &amp; ID Proper</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Before coming to Sector 24, our team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Follows proper dress code</li>\r\n	<li>Have Government-verified ID cards</li>\r\n	<li>Handles every item with respect</li>\r\n	<li>Follows Lift Timing, Parking Guidelines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Every employee who comes to your home is professional &ndash; your privacy and safety is our priority.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. Premium Packing &ndash; Customized Material for Every Item</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know that Sector 24 homes have precious items like Crockery, Home D&eacute;cor, Electronics, Furniture. So we use:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>5-Layer Packing (Bubble, Stretch, Foam, Corrugated, Plastic Wrap)</li>\r\n	<li>Thermocol Safety for Fragile Items</li>\r\n	<li>Wooden Crates for Glass Tables or Art Pieces</li>\r\n	<li>Numbered Boxes with Inventory List</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏱️ 4. Time-Bound Delivery &ndash; On-Time Pickup &amp; Drop</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many societies in Sector 24 have No-Entry Hours. That&#39;s why we offer you:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Pre-Scheduled Time Slots</li>\r\n	<li>Truck is GPS Enabled</li>\r\n	<li>Save time with Route Optimization</li>\r\n	<li>Pre-Confirm Lift Access and Parking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Average Delay Time is &lt;10 minutes &mdash; which shows our professionalism.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📄 5. Transparent Pricing &ndash; No Hidden Charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort gives you a transparent quotation from day one:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Packing + Labour + Transport = All Inclusive</li>\r\n	<li>Final rates are fixed in the Pre-Move Survey itself</li>\r\n	<li>Detailed estimate is shared on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>GST Invoice and Payment Options (UPI, Bank, Cash)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📞 6. Dedicated Move Manager &amp; 24x7 Support</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort provides every Sector 24 customer with a dedicated move manager who:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Stays in touch with you at every stage</li>\r\n	<li>Provides live location of the truck</li>\r\n	<li>Resolves any issues immediately</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The customer support team is active 24x7 &mdash; via call, WhatsApp and email.</strong></p>', '<h2>🚚 ShiftingPort Services in Sector 24 Gurgaon &ndash; Packers and Movers, Home, Office, Vehicles, and more</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A single moving solution is not enough for the modern societies, flats, office complexes, and independent housing in Sector 24 Gurgaon. That is why ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has designed custom services for all types of clients in Sector 24 &mdash; to make every move smooth, safe, and stress-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Relocation &ndash; 1 BHK to 5 BHK</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have successfully shifted many houses from places like Shivam Apartments, Akashneem Marg, DLF City Court. Our home relocation services include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing of kitchen, bedroom, drawing and pooja ghar</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Dismantling and assembly of refrigerator, washing machine, bed, cupboard</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Safe packing of expensive electronics (TV, microwave, laptop)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Unpacking and garbage collection after shifting (optional)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Inventory list and labeling system for the entire move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team has frequently worked in places like DLF Access Road, Shivam Enclave, Akashneem Residency.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office &amp; Corporate Moves</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 24 has many small and big office complexes and coworking spaces. If you are shifting your business, we offer the following services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Weekend or night time shifting (no disruption in business hours)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Safe packing of desks, chairs, computers, printers, servers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Department-wise labeling and data protection</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Installation and reorganization at the new location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have strong experience working in DLF Corporate Park and nearby corporate buildings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛻 3. Local Shifting &ndash; Within or Near Sector 24</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are shifting from Sector 24 to nearby areas like DLF Phase 2, MG Road, Sikanderpur or Udyog Vihar, we can:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete Shifting in 1 Day (1BHK to 3BHK)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Service at Affordable Rates</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Accept Last Minute Bookings</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck + Staff + Packing Material All Included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 4. Car &amp; Bike Transport (Vehicle Relocation)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many customers of Sector 24 get their vehicles transported to cities like Noida, Jaipur, Mumbai. Our vehicle transport comes with:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS-enabled covered or open container</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Safe loading and unloading</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Lashing &amp; Wheel Lock system</li>\r\n	<li>✅ On-time pickup and tracking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 5. Warehousing and storage service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If your new home is not ready yet, or you are moving abroad &mdash; we have:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ CCTV-equipped warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Dust-proof and pest-resistant units</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Box-wise tagging and logbook</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Short-term and long-term options</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎁 6. Professional packing and unpacking service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Packing expensive goods in a posh location like Sector 24 is an art. That&#39;s why we offer:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Double wrap packing for fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Termocol boxes and bubble wrap for TVs, laptops, artworks</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture blankets and foam sheets for large furniture</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional unpacking after shifting (optional)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>📊 Packers and Movers Sector 24 Gurgaon &ndash; Charges &amp; Pricing Guide</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever you think of shifting your home, office or vehicle in Sector 24 Gurgaon, the first question that comes to mind is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo; ShiftingPort offers you a completely transparent and easy to understand charges structure with no hidden costs and no confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 Estimated Shifting Rates &ndash; Tailored for Sector 24 Gurgaon:</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"responsive-table\">\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Shifting Type 🔄</th>\r\n			<th>🏠 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌏 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Major factors affecting price in Sector 24:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1️⃣ Floor and Access</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Is lift available in the building or not?</li>\r\n	<li>Is it ground floor or 5th floor?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2️⃣ Volume of Goods</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Quantity of Furniture, Appliances, Fragile Items.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3️⃣ Packing material required</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Wooden Crates, Bubble Wrap, Foam Sheets etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4️⃣ Society Gate Rules</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Truck Entry Timing and Loading/Unloading Time Slots.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5️⃣ Weekend/Night Moving</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Weekend or Late Night shifting requires a separate team and truck.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 An example &ndash; 2BHK local shifting from Sector 24 to DLF Phase 3:</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Price (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹1,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Labour Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Total</th>\r\n			<th>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>💬 Note: These charges are approximate. We conduct a free pre-move survey to know the exact price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🛡️ Why is ShiftingPort the most trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 24 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 24 Gurgaon is a well-planned and residentially rich area where shifting is not just about moving stuff &mdash; people here want:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹The work to be done on time</li>\r\n	<li>🔹No damage</li>\r\n	<li>🔹The staff to be professional and courteous</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And most importantly, everything to be done in a smooth and stress-free manner.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort meets all these expectations &mdash; that&rsquo;s why we are considered one of the most recommended Packers and Movers in Sector 24.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏆 1. Local Expertise &ndash; Knowledge of every lane and society of Sector 24</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are familiar with every lane, colony and apartment of Sector 24:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Vasant Apartments, RWA Colony, colonies near Railway Road</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Direct access to MG Road, DLF Cyber ​​City, and NH-8</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Traffic routes, society gate timings, loading-unloading points &ndash; experience it all</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧍&zwj;♂️ 2. Trained and Verified Staff &ndash; Your luggage is precious to us too</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>All our staff:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Come with proper ID and uniform</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Are respectful and soft-spoken</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Trained in electronic, fragile and furniture packing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. High-Grade Packing &ndash; Zero Damage Promise</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹5 Layer Protection: Bubble Wrap + Foam + Corrugated Sheets + Stretch Film + Blankets</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Wooden Crate Packing (TV, Crockery, Glass Tables, Antiques)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Waterproof Packing Option also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 4. Time-Bound Delivery &ndash; Delay Zero Policy</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🕒 Shifting always starts and ends on time</li>\r\n	<li>⏱️ Pre-approved Time-Slot Coordination with Society</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 Dedicated Trucks for Gurgaon Local or Intercity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛰️ 5. GPS Tracking and 24x7 Customer Support</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Live Truck Location</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Packing and Loading photos on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dedicated Move Manager (Personal Handler for You)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 6. No Hidden Charges &ndash; Complete Transparency</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Final Quotation is given only after Survey</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GST Bill, Material Charges and Labour Details upfront</li>\r\n	<li>🔹No Last Minute Surprises</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 7. Value-Added Services also available:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Unpacking and Furniture Reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>🛏️ Furniture Dismantle/Setup</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Post-Move House Cleaning (On Request)</li>\r\n	<li>🐶 Pet Relocation</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Transit Insurance (IRDA Approved)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏁 Why 100+ Families in Sector 24 chose ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Verified and Reliable Service</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Customized Plan for Every Budget and Home Size</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Same Day Local Shifting (1BHK&ndash;3BHK)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Dedicated Priority Support for Premium Clients</li>\r\n	<li>✅ 98.7% On-time Completion Rate in Gurgaon</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want stress-free, damage-free and time-bound shifting from Sector 24 or to Sector 24, then ShiftingPort is the best and wisest choice for you.</p>', '<h2>📌 Sector 24 Gurgaon Packers and Movers &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Does ShiftingPort serve every society in Sector 24?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, ShiftingPort services are available in almost all societies and colonies in Sector 24 &ndash; like Vasant Apartments, Shivpuri, colonies near Railway Road, RWA sector areas etc. We understand each society&rsquo;s entry-gate rules, loading time slots and vehicle parking requirements and plan accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Can 1BHK or 2BHK shifting be done in a single day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, complete 1BHK and 2BHK shifting within Sector 24 or nearby areas is completed in 4 to 6 hours &ndash; provided lift permission and vehicle entry approval is taken from the society in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Do you do office shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely! There are many big and small offices in Sector 24 and nearby areas. We shift office computers, furniture, files and servers in a safe manner &ndash; and if needed, we also provide weekend or night shifting options.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Is it mandatory to take out luggage insurance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> It is not mandatory, but we do recommend Transit Insurance. This will ensure that you get full compensation in case of any unfortunate damage to the luggage. Our insurance partner is IRDA approved.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. Is packing material charged separately?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, all packing materials (like boxes, bubble wrap, foam, stretch film) are priced based on the size of the shifting and are included in the quote. There are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Do you have GPS tracking facility?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, all our trucks are GPS enabled, so customers can view live location on mobile. Apart from this, photos of packing, loading and delivery are also sent to you on WhatsApp.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Does ShiftingPort help with unpacking and furniture setup?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, our staff visits your new home to help you unpack and re-setup sofas, beds, dining tables, wardrobes, etc. Apart from this, the packing waste material is also cleaned before leaving.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. How many days in advance should I book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> To get better service and timely slots, it is better to book 2 to 3 days in advance, especially during weekends or festivals and this will help us plan on time by taking permission from your society in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. Is there a facility for car or bike transport?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we have the facility to send car or bike from Sector 24 to any city (like Delhi, Jaipur, Mumbai, Bangalore). We transport vehicles in GPS-enabled Covered Containers &ndash; with Zero Dent Guarantee.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓10. How to book ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> You can book us:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 <strong>Call / WhatsApp:</strong> +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is available 24x7 for your queries and bookings.</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Sector 24 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort – Safe & Fast Relocation', 'Packers and Movers Sector 24 Gurgaon, House Shifting in Sector 24, Office Relocation Sector 24, Car Bike Transport Sector 24, Best Movers Gurgaon, Affordable Packers in Sector 24, Shifting Services Gurgaon, Sector 24 Local Moving, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 24, sector 24 packers and movers, packers movers gurgaon sector 24', 'Trust ShiftingPort Packers & Movers for safe, timely and affordable home, office and car shifting services in Sector 24 Gurgaon.', '2025-07-09 10:13:59', '2025-07-09 11:11:11'),
(74, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 13, 1, 1, 1, 15, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 25', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-25', '1999', NULL, 'Shifting your home or office in Sector 25 Gurgaon? Get a tension-free shifting done with ShiftingPort. Experience the most reliable Packers and Movers with safe packing, trained staff and on-time delivery – Call Now!', '<h2>🏡 Need for Shifting to Sector 25 Gurgaon and Why ShiftingPort packers and movers is the Best Choice?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 25 in Gurugram is a highly developed and well-equipped area that offers a modern lifestyle, proximity to corporate offices and luxurious residential societies. The proximity to major business and metro hubs like DLF Cyber ​​City, MG Road, IFFCO Chowk is a great convenience for people in their daily lives. This has made Sector 25 an area where people are constantly shifting &ndash; whether to move to their new home or to shift office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The major societies in Sector 25 such as DLF Ridgewood Estate, Beverly Park 1 and 2, DLF City Phase II, DLF Belvedere Park, and Shyam Vihar Apartments reflect the high-end living standards here. When shifting in these colonies, people need a team that not only works on time but also moves their belongings safely from one place to another. This is where <strong>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers</strong> comes in.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Why is ShiftingPort the first choice of people in Sector 25?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just a shifting service but an experience that every customer remembers. Shifting in a premium area like Sector 25 requires more than just labour or trucks, but a professional and intelligent team that understands your society rules, works within tight shifting windows, and transfers all the belongings without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team knows every lane, every tower, and every entry gate of Sector 25. We know how to park in the Beverly Park parking lot near IFFCO Chowk, or what is the truck entry time at DLF Ridgewood Estate. This local experience is what sets us apart from other movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Features of our services:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Vehicles with GPS tracking that arrive on time</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Uniformed, trained and courteous staff</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Customized packing for all items &ndash; LED TV, crockery, sofa, wardrobe etc.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete transparency at every stage from booking to shifting</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Pre-booking, quotes and live updates on WhatsApp</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are shifting from 1 BHK to 4 BHK or an office from DLF to Golf Course Road, ShiftingPort understands every need and provides the service accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most of the people in Sector 25 are working professionals, business owners or MNC employees who are short of time. In such a situation, they are looking for a Packers and Movers who live up to their expectations &ndash; and that is ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t just shift, we move the memories, emotions and trust of your home from one place to another with complete respect and safety.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚛 ShiftingPort &ndash; The Safest, Fastest and Budget-Friendly Packers and Movers in Sector 25</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 25 Gurgaon is a place where an IT professional is shifting to Beverly Park 2 near DLF Cyber ​​City the day after tomorrow, and the next day a family is moving from Ridgewood Estate to South City. In such a situation, there is a need for a Packers and Movers who understand the needs of every client, value their time and also take care of the budget. The name of this trust and confidence is &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t just do shifting, we believe in giving every customer a &ldquo;Premium Yet Affordable Moving Experience&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ Safe packing, with Zero Damage guarantee</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The biggest feature of ShiftingPort is that we never compromise on packing. We protect expensive and fragile items with special packing in premium locations of Sector 25 like DLF Belvedere Park, Richmond Park, and DLF Ridgewood Estate:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Bubble wrap + thermocol + crates for LED TVs, glass tables and crockery</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Furniture covers + stretch film for sofas, beds and wardrobes</li>\r\n	<li>🎨 Frame protection and custom crating for paintings and artworks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Many clients say after seeing our packing &ndash; &ldquo;We have seen such packing for the first time&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏱️ Timely shifting &ndash; with tracking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Most shifting in Sector 25 is time-bound, especially due to society rules. We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>⌛ Provide Fixed Slot Booking</li>\r\n	<li>🗺️ Avoid traffic by optimizing routes</li>\r\n	<li>📲 Send every update to the client with GPS-tracking</li>\r\n	<li>📞 A Dedicated Move Manager stays in touch with you throughout the shifting process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our on-time arrival and early completion rate is 98.9% in Sector 25.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 Budget-friendly rates &ndash; no hidden charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In high-profile locations like DLF, people think that Packers and Movers will be very expensive. But this is not the case with ShiftingPort. We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Provide free pre-move survey</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Send complete price breakdown on WhatsApp itself</li>\r\n	<li>✅ No hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For example &ndash; The price of shifting a 2 BHK from Ridgewood Estate to DLF Phase 3 ranges from ₹5,999 to ₹6,999 (including GST).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Local experience and complete understanding of DLF Society SOPs</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is well aware of every street, society and gate rule of Sector 25. We know:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Which gates allow truck entry</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Lift booking timings</li>\r\n	<li>✅ How to obtain loading/unloading permissions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This is why we ensure no hassles or delays during shifting in Sector 25.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ShiftingPort is not just a mover but a trusted partner who promises to provide you with Premium, Safe and Fast Shifting in Sector 25 Gurgaon &ndash; without breaking your budget.</strong></p>', '<h2>🌟 Why ShiftingPort is the Most Trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 25 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in a premium area like Sector 25 in Gurgaon is not just a movement of goods, it is an experience &ndash; where time, safety, and professionalism matter. ShiftingPort has earned this trust by successfully shifting hundreds of families and corporate clients in Sector 25 over the last 5 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are the reasons that make ShiftingPort the &quot;Most Recommended Packers and Movers&quot; in Sector 25:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 1. Premium Packing Quality &ndash; Special Handling for High Value Goods</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 25 DLF societies like Ridgewood Estate, Belvedere Park, and Richmond Park often have expensive furniture, imported electronics, and artifacts. We take this seriously and do:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ 5-Layer Protection (Foam + Bubble Wrap + Corrugated Sheet + Stretch Film + Outer Cover)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Separate &ldquo;Handle with Care&rdquo; boxing for fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Wooden Crates for artwork and expensive glass tables</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Even society guards often say after seeing our packing &ndash; &ldquo;For the first time I have seen such professional work.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ 2. Trained, Uniformed and Verified Staff &ndash; Both Trust and Respect</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Movers and Packers are not just labour &ndash; they are trained professionals who:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Come with uniform and company ID</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Take entry after understanding the society&rsquo;s SOP beforehand</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Speak politely to every client</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Handle every item as if it is their own</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Most of our clients join us for the second move as well &ndash; that is our victory</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏱️ 3. Time-Bound Delivery &ndash; Never Delay in Sector 25</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Most societies in Sector 25 have fixed truck entry timings (e.g. 9 am to 11 pm or 3 pm to 5 pm). We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📋 Take Lift Booking Confirmation in advance</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 Send truck and staff to location well in advance</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 Complete the entire shifting within 3 to 6 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our punctuality rate is more than 98.5% &ndash; giving you peace of mind and time savings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💬 4. Transparent Pricing &ndash; No Hidden Costs</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>For ShiftingPort in Sector 25 we always:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📲 Provide full rate breakdown on WhatsApp or site visit</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 GST bill, moving charges, packing cost &ndash; everything is clearly mentioned</li>\r\n	<li>🧮 No hidden charges or higher prices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For example, 3 BHK Shifting in Ridgewood Estate costs from ₹8,499 to ₹10,999 &ndash; All Inclusive.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 5. Dedicated Move Manager and Live Support</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every Sector 25 client gets a:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🤝 Dedicated Manager who gives updates at every stage</li>\r\n	<li>🛰️ Live Location Tracking</li>\r\n	<li>📷 Packing, Loading photos are shared on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>📞 24x7 Customer Support Line</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Wherever you are &ndash; we are with you every step of the way &ndash; before, during and after your shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 6. Specialized Services for Sector 25</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 25 Gurgaon, we provide:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Professional Shifting of 1 BHK to 4 BHK and Villas</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Weekend and Late-Night Shifting Options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Permission Handling Help before Society Gate Pass / Entry</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture Disassembly &amp; Reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Insurance and Temporary Storage Facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has become the first choice of people shifting to Sector 25 Gurgaon &ndash; because we understand the profile of the area, society rules, and premium expectations of clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 Our Services &ndash; What ShiftingPort does for you in Sector 25 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 25 Gurgaon is an area where there is a huge demand for all types of shifting, from residential to commercial. It is home to premium societies like Ridgewood Estate, Richmond Park, Beverly Park, DLF City Club, as well as many mid-size offices and corporate setups. ShiftingPort is a one-stop solution for every needy person here &ndash; whether you are shifting house, office shifting, or just shifting car/bike.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. House Shifting &ndash; From 1 BHK to Villa</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We are already active in every residential society in Sector 25 &ndash; be it Ridgewood Estate or Hamilton Court. Our team considers house shifting as a well-planned process where every item, every corner is associated with a memory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our domestic shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Safe Packing of Kitchen, Drawing Room, Bedroom and Puja Ghar</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Dismantling and damage-proof wrapping of Sofas, Beds, Wardrobes</li>\r\n	<li>🖥️ ​​Special foam protection of electronic items like TV, Fridge, Washing Machine</li>\r\n	<li>🪔 Special crate packing for Fragile Items (Glass, Statues, Paintings)</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Item-wise inventory list so that unpacking is also tension-free</li>\r\n	<li>🚚 Fast loading &ndash; unloading with skilled labour</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have prior experience of entry protocol, truck entry time, and lift usage SOP of gated societies like Ridgewood Estate &ndash; ensuring a smooth shifting day for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office and Corporate Moving &ndash; Zero Downtime Promise</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Confidentiality and time are critical during shifting in many office buildings of Sector 25. We offer you weekend or after-office-hours moving options so that your operations have zero disturbance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Corporate Shifting, we provide:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💻 Safe transit of Desktops, Servers, Printers and Document Storage</li>\r\n	<li>🔒 Privacy-based labeling for data-sensitive items</li>\r\n	<li>🧠 Department-wise box segregation</li>\r\n	<li>🪑 Furniture dismantling, reassembly &amp; wiring support</li>\r\n	<li>🗓️ Pre-scheduled timing so that traffic or society gate rules are not a hindrance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our experience in DLF Corporate Park and nearby buildings shows that office shifting can also be organised and secure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛻 3. Local Shifting &ndash; Within or near Sector 25</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sometimes people just need to move within the society or to a nearby sector (like Sector 24, DLF Phase 2, MG Road). For this, we offer Express Local Moving service, which completes the shifting in 4&ndash;6 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In this service:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏘️ Short-distance within 10 KM shifting</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 1 truck + 3&ndash;4 laborers</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Minimum packing + maximum speed</li>\r\n	<li>💰 Professional service in budget</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Cleaning and unpacking also available after shift</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 4. Vehicle (Car/Bike) Transport</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to send a car or bike from Sector 25 to any city in India &ndash; ShiftingPort is for you:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS-enabled Containers</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Covered &amp; Open transport options</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Foam base + wheel lock + lashing system</li>\r\n	<li>🛡️ Zero Damage Guarantee</li>\r\n	<li>🕒 Same-day pickup and scheduled delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏬 5. Temporary Storage &amp; Warehouse facility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have time to get the keys of your new house or you are returning from abroad &ndash; then we provide short/long-term storage:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏠 CCTV-monitored warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>📦 Box-wise inventory tagging</li>\r\n	<li>🧴 Moisture-proof, pest-controlled environment</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Furniture dismantling &amp; packing for safe storage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 6. Packing &amp; Unpacking as Standalone Service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you just need to get your stuff packed or unpacked at the new location, we provide professional services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Only Packing by expert team</li>\r\n	<li>🛠️ Furniture dismantling &amp; screw locking</li>\r\n	<li>🧹 Unpacking, box disposal &amp; furniture setup on new location</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 25 Gurgaon means &ndash; Trust ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are moving from Beverly Park to MG Road, or Ridgewood to Golf Course Road &ndash; we make every move Safe, Smart and Stress-Free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Packers and Movers Charges in Sector 25 Gurgaon &ndash; Know the estimated rates</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The first question when planning shifting to a premium area like Sector 25 in Gurgaon is &ndash; &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort brings you a very clear and transparent rate chart, so that you can decide your budget without any confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 What are the basis of our charges?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📦 Quantity of goods (1 BHK, 2 BHK, Villa etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Floor and Lift availability</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Distance &ndash; within Sector 25, nearby or other cities</li>\r\n	<li>🚛 Truck and labor requirement</li>\r\n	<li>🔧 Furniture dismantling/reassembly and other services</li>\r\n	<li>🕐 Weekend/Night shifting or special time window</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 Estimated Shifting Rate Chart &ndash; for Packers and Movers Sector 25 Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🔄 Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>🏠 Local (5&ndash;15 KM)</th>\r\n			<th>🚚 Up to 100 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛣️ Up to 500 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🛤️ Up to 1000 KM</th>\r\n			<th>🌏 1500+ KM</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹7,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,999 &ndash; ₹10,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹11,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹17,999 &ndash; ₹21,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹23,999 &ndash; ₹28,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,499 &ndash; ₹10,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,999 &ndash; ₹20,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹29,999 &ndash; ₹34,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3 BHK Home</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹13,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹13,999 &ndash; ₹18,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹22,999 &ndash; ₹27,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹28,999 &ndash; ₹35,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹36,999 &ndash; ₹42,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4 BHK / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,999 &ndash; ₹19,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹20,999 &ndash; ₹26,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹30,999 &ndash; ₹39,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹42,999 &ndash; ₹49,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹51,999 &ndash; ₹64,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,999 &ndash; ₹6,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,999 &ndash; ₹9,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹10,999 &ndash; ₹14,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹15,999 &ndash; ₹18,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹21,999 &ndash; ₹25,999</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,999 &ndash; ₹3,499</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,999 &ndash; ₹5,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,499 &ndash; ₹8,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,999 &ndash; ₹11,999</td>\r\n			<td>₹12,999 &ndash; ₹15,499</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 What do our top societies in Sector 25 charge?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have listed the average charges based on the last 100+ moves:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏢 Ridgewood Estate (2BHK to Sushant Lok) &ndash; ₹6,999</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Beverly Park to Delhi NCR &ndash; ₹9,999</li>\r\n	<li>🏠 Richmond Park 3BHK Full House &ndash; ₹11,999</li>\r\n	<li>🚗 Car Transport to Mumbai from Sector 25 &ndash; ₹14,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 Why Our Pricing is Most Trusted in Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ No rates are quoted before Pre-Move Survey</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Final bill remains same as quoted &ndash; No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Price Breakdown and Labour/Truck details are sent on WhatsApp beforehand</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST Invoice and Online Payment facility</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓Sector 25 Gurgaon Common questions related to shifting - easy answers for you</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. Do you shift to every society in Sector 25?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Of course we do. Be it Ridgewood Estate, Richmond Park or Beverly Park - our vehicle and team understand the rules of every society. We take care of gate pass, time slot, everything in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Can the house be shifted in one day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, it can be done easily. If your house is 1BHK or 2BHK and you have to shift nearby, then we pack all the stuff and deliver it to the new house in a single day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Do you get the Society NOC or Entry Pass?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The customer has to get the NOC, but our team gives you the vehicle number, staff list, and time details in advance so that RWA does not face any problem.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. What if you have to shift the car or bike?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>This is our daily habit. We can deliver your car or bike from Sector 25 to any part of Delhi, Jaipur or Mumbai. GPS tracking is done and we guarantee dent-free delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Do you get your stuff unpacked or just drop it off?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We do whatever is required. Unpacking the bed, setting the cupboard, unpacking the boxes - our team does it all. You just sit in your new house, we will take care of the rest.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. Is it necessary to get insurance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Not necessary, but it is wise. If there is any risk in long distance shifting, insurance protects you. We will make the process easy with your help.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7. What if you have to shift at night?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, you can. We can shift at night as well - you just need prior permission from the society. The rest is our responsibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8. How many days in advance should you book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Tell us at least 2-3 days in advance. We will plan the team, truck and packing material in time. We do it at the last minute too, but it is good if there is some planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9. Can we track the truck live?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes, absolutely. Every vehicle has GPS &ndash; you can see on your mobile where the goods have reached. Also, our Move Manager will always be on line.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>10. How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>It is very easy:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞<strong> Call/WhatsApp: </strong>+91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 <strong>Or Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>', 'Best Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 25| ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers Sector 25 Gurgaon, Packers and Movers in Sector 25 Gurgaon, Shifting Services Gurgaon Sector 25, Home Shifting Sector 25 Gurgaon, Office Movers Sector 25, Car Bike Transport Sector 25, Affordable Movers Gurgaon, Verified Packers in Sector 25, Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 25, Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 25', 'Looking for reliable Packers and Movers in Sector 25 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort offers Safe Packing, On Time Delivery and Hassle-free Home, Office and Vehicle Shifting – Know Price and Services.', '2025-07-09 21:37:02', '2025-07-09 22:21:45');
