(76, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 15, 1, 1, 1, 17, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 27', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-27', '1999', NULL, 'Make shifting in Sector 27 Gurgaon easy and tension-free. ShiftingPort Packers and Movers brings trained staff, robust packing and on-time delivery - all with no hidden costs. Get an estimate on WhatsApp today!', '<h2>🏡 Why shifting to Sector 27, Gurugram is the best decision?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking for a place in Gurugram where office, malls, schools and metro are close by &ndash; then Sector 27 is perfect for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This area is counted among the most prime locations of the city. Living here means &ndash; everything around you. This is the reason why hundreds of people are shifting here every month. And what makes their shifting easy is &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 27.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 5 biggest features of Sector 27</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. Location is super connected</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹IFFCO Chowk Metro Station &ndash; just 5 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹MG Road Malls (MGF Metropolitan, DT City Centre) &ndash; nearby</li>\r\n	<li>🔹DLF Cyber ​​City and NH8 &ndash; direct connection</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Adjacent to DLF City Phase 1</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Living near Block E, F, G means living in a posh area.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Balance &ndash; for both family and office life</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Quiet societies like Saraswati Kunj</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Reputed schools and hospitals nearby</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>High rental demand + resale value</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹&nbsp;ideal for both investment and living</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Full security and clean area</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹&nbsp;Gated societies, guards and clean roads</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Then why is shifting a problem?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting to Sector 27 is not as easy as it sounds. There are some challenges here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Parking restrictions &ndash; No space for trucks in many societies</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Shifting timing limits &ndash; In some colonies, shifting is allowed only till morning or afternoon</li>\r\n	<li>🔹High-rise flats &ndash; Different process for moving with lift</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Security clearance &ndash; Every society has its own guard system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ How does ShiftingPort make shifting to Sector 27 easy?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have shifted more than 100+ families to Sector 27. We know every street, every society and moving rules here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹First visit the site and make a complete plan</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Bring trucks, staff and packing at pre-approved time</li>\r\n	<li>🔹If needed, send small trucks or manual labour in narrow lanes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Take permission by following society&#39;s security rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Sector 27 residents trust ShiftingPort</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are moving from Saraswati Kunj to Golf Course Road, or from Block G to Phase 5, we just need a call.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 27 are experts in all types of shifting - be it 1BHK or villa.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📦 Local shifting | 🚛 Intercity moving | 🏢 Office relocation - everything under one roof.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚛 Why is ShiftingPort Packers and Movers the most reliable in Sector 27?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When you think of shifting in Sector 27, just trucks and labour are not enough. You need a reliable partner who will handle your entire moving in a smooth, safe and professional manner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is the name of this trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧭 1. Local Experience of Sector 27</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have worked in every street, every apartment and every society of Sector 27. We know:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Where to park a truck in Saraswati Kunj</li>\r\n	<li>What is the right time for shifting in DLF City Phase 1 &ndash; Block E, F, G</li>\r\n	<li>How to get NOC before moving in RWA Sector 27</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Don&rsquo;t worry, we are aware of every rule and every corner.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 2. Packing Quality &ndash; Because your belongings are precious</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know that every item is not just stuff, it is your memories, needs and investments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That&rsquo;s why we use:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>5-layer carton boxes</li>\r\n	<li>Double bubble-wrap</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture edge protectors</li>\r\n	<li>Thermocol and foam for crockery and mirror items</li>\r\n	<li>Customized crates for TVs and electronics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Every box is labeled so that unpacking is easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 3. GPS-enabled transport &ndash; Tracking every step of the way</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have clean and maintained trucks of different sizes &ndash; up to 14ft, 17ft, 19ft.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every truck is equipped with GPS system so you can track in real-time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Benefits:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>No worry of delivery delay</li>\r\n	<li>Where has the luggage reached &ndash; information every moment</li>\r\n	<li>Guaranteed on-time arrival</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ 4. Trained staff &ndash; no damage, no hassle</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Background verified</li>\r\n	<li>Has 3+ years of moving experience</li>\r\n	<li>Knows how to dismantle and re-install sofa, AC, TV, geyser</li>\r\n	<li>Handles fragile items differently</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Works like a professional in your home, not like an outsider.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ 5. Safe, Insured and Time-bound service</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want, you can take insurance cover of the luggage on every moving &ndash; accidental damage is also covered.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are punctual:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The time decided is the same for pickup and delivery</li>\r\n	<li>No hassle, no excuses</li>\r\n	<li>📞 Quick Support &mdash; when you need it, how you need it</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are moving after 2 days or tomorrow &ndash; we are available for emergency shifting as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 Call / WhatsApp: +91-8586828846<br />\r\n📧 Email: info.@shiftingport.com<br />\r\n📍 Sector 27, Gurgaon &mdash; Around you, as per your need</p>', '<h2>📦 A glimpse of our packing and moving process</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When you are shifting your home or office, the biggest fear is &mdash; <strong>&ldquo;what if the stuff breaks?&rdquo;</strong>, <strong>&ldquo;will it reach on time or not?&rdquo;</strong>, <strong>&ldquo;will something be missed?&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 27 eliminates all these worries &ndash; with its 100% organized and transparent moving process.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 1. Site Visit and Personalized Quote</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Not every shifting is the same. That&rsquo;s why we conduct a free site visit before moving, which includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹On-spot assessment of your entire belongings</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Which truck will be required, how many staff will be needed</li>\r\n	<li>🔹How many boxes will be required, quantity of fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Information about lift, parking, society rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We then give you a clear and fixed price quote &ndash; without any hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 2. Smart Packing with High-Quality Material</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our packing process is systematic and professional. Different material is used for each item:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Item</th>\r\n			<th>Packing Material</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Clothes</td>\r\n			<td>Wardrobe box / Suitcase</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Crockery</td>\r\n			<td>Bubble-wrap + Thermocol wrap</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>TV / LED</td>\r\n			<td>Foam padding + Wooden crate (optional)</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Sofa / Bed</td>\r\n			<td>Stretch film + Blanket cover</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Electronics</td>\r\n			<td>Static-proof wrapping</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Each box is sealed and labeled:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tags like &ldquo;Kitchen | Fragile | Top Load Only&rdquo; also make unpacking easier.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧑&zwj;🔧 3. Skilled Loading &ndash; Damage-Free Handling</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Loading is not just a matter of picking up and placing it in the truck. It requires smart planning and training.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ShiftingPort team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Puts the heaviest items on the bottom, the fragile ones on top</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Balances the weight in box stacking</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Cover furniture with blankets after wrapping</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dismantles sofa, dining table and loads it securely</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Result: Luggage doesn&#39;t move during travel and nothing comes broken.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 4. Safe Transport &ndash; with GPS Tracking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>All our trucks:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Are GPS-enabled</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Regularly disinfected</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Properly tarpaulin-covered</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Drivers are well-trained and route-expert</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You get live tracking &ndash; via Google Map link.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 5. Unloading and Placement &ndash; ​​As you wish</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>On delivery, our team not only unloads the goods, but also:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Reassembles the furniture</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Place the boxes at the place specified by you</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Cross-checks all the boxes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Disposes garbage (packing material) if desired</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Moving plan, which makes it stress-free</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our entire process is designed in such a way that you just have to supervise &ndash; no tension, no confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📅 With advance booking, you can plan your move completely.</li>\r\n	<li>📱 Emergency shifting? Shifting is possible within 24 hours.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏙️ Sector 27 Gurgaon Societies &amp; Colonies We Serve</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 27, Gurugram is an area where all types of residential and commercial properties are present &mdash; from posh apartments to independent houses. This is why services like house shifting, office moving, and furniture transport are always in demand here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 27 covers the entire area &mdash; every street, every society, every block.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Top societies and locations where we do regular moving</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. DLF City Phase 1 (Blocks E, F, G)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Posh residential area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Mix of high-rise flats + bungalows</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Local experience of moving even in narrow lanes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Complete compliance with society gate entry rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Saraswati Kunj Apartments</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Residential cluster with peace and greenery</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Favourite place for families and senior citizens</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift access + security check-in is known to our team</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. RWA Sector 27 Plots</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Independent houses area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹More furniture shifting and dismantling/reinstallation required</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Narrow streets require small trucks and local labour &ndash; we provide</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Apartments near IFFCO Chowk</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹High traffic area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Time-bound loading/unloading</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Complete move possible in 2 hours &ndash; with ShiftingPort</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5. Builder floors adjacent to MG Road</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Demand for working professionals area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Compact staircase, zero lift &ndash; smart manpower required</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Our team is specially trained for such floors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 What do we move in this area?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We do all types of shifting in Sector 27 and nearby areas:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🏠 Moving of 1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK houses</li>\r\n	<li>🛋️ Furniture shifting (Sofa, Almira, Bed)</li>\r\n	<li>🖥️ Office relocation &ndash; with computer, files, server</li>\r\n	<li>🧳 PG shifting of Students &amp; bachelors (low-budget)</li>\r\n	<li>🚪 Dismantling + move of Fridge, washing machine, AC, geyser</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Nearby Areas also covered:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not limited to Sector 27 only. We also expertly cover major locations nearby:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹DLF Phase 2</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 24, Sector 25</li>\r\n	<li>🔹MG Road Metro Area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Golf Course Road (near DLF South Point, Global Foyer)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Udyog Vihar Phase 2 &amp; 3 (for office shifting)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📞 Moving from any area of ​​Sector 27?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are shifting from Block E to Block F, or Saraswati Kunj to DLF Phase 1 &ndash; all we need is 1 call.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Rates and affordable packages &ndash; with transparency</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The first thing that comes to mind when you hear the name of shifting is &ndash; how much will it cost?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Confusion regarding rates is common in posh areas like Sector 27, Gurugram. Some put hidden charges, some take extra in the name of kilometers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But nothing like this happens in ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 27. We give you a transparent, budget-friendly and flexible moving plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 How are rates decided in ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our method of fixing the price is very simple and logical:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Factor</th>\r\n			<th>Impact on Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Size of your home</td>\r\n			<td>1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK or Villa</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Distance of the move</td>\r\n			<td>From Sector 27 to Sector 56 or till Noida</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Quantity of items</td>\r\n			<td>Number of furniture, electronics, fragile items</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Society access</td>\r\n			<td>Whether lift is available, and which floor</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing requirement</td>\r\n			<td>Only loading or full-service packers</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Based on this data, we give you a clear, fixed-price quote &mdash; no hidden charges.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💸 Our Popular Packages &ndash; For Sector 27 Clients</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏠 1BHK Local Shifting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Starting from ₹2,999</li>\r\n	<li>1 truck, 2 staff</li>\r\n	<li>Basic packing included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏡 2BHK Complete Shifting</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Starting from ₹4,999</li>\r\n	<li>1 truck, 3-4 staff</li>\r\n	<li>Packing + dismantling + unloading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏢 Office Relocation (Small Scale)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Starting from ₹6,000</li>\r\n	<li>Workstations + desktops + files</li>\r\n	<li>After-hours shifting also possible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🧳 Students/PG Moving Pack</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Starting from ₹1,499</li>\r\n	<li>5&ndash;6 boxes + luggage</li>\r\n	<li>Quick loading/unloading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Note: Final price is confirmed after site visit or WhatsApp inventory check.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚫 No Hidden Charges, Just Fair Pricing</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our pricing policy clearly includes these things:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>No extra charge for weekend shifting</li>\r\n	<li>No parking timing penalty (pre-informed)</li>\r\n	<li>No GST confusion &ndash; complete transparency</li>\r\n	<li>No call-center traps &ndash; talk directly to local team</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🆓 What all is available for free?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Site visit / inventory check</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Move planning consultation</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Breakdown of charges in Quotation</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Labeling &amp; checklist support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You know at every step how much is being spent and why.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 Get Free Estimate Now &ndash; In 2 Minutes<br />\r\nIf you are in Sector 27 and want to know how much your shifting will cost &ndash; just send a photo of the goods on WhatsApp.</p>', '<h2>🙋&zwj;♂️ Frequently Asked Questions in Sector 27 Gurgaon &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Answers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Have you done shifting in Sector 27 before?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, we have worked in every colony of Sector 27 &ndash; DLF City Phase 1 (E, F, G Blocks), Saraswati Kunj and plots with RWA. We know every step like parking, society entry timing, NOC from guard.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How are the charges decided? Is there anything hidden?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Charges are completely clear &ndash; depends on the size of the house, distance, and packing.<br />\r\nThere are no hidden charges. The quote you get is final &ndash; on paper.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you guys do the packing or do I have to do it myself?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>The whole team does the packing. We bring our own material &ndash; boxes, bubble wrap, tape, everything.<br />\r\nThe goods are packed securely and labeled so that there is no confusion even after shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How much time will shifting of 1BHK take?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If lift is available and there is not much luggage, then 1BHK can be shifted in 3&ndash;5 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If moving starts in the morning, then it can be easily completed on the same day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Is the staff reliable or do you bring it from outside?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The staff is our own trained team &ndash; background verified, experienced and in uniform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Only those people go for every shifting who know Sector 27.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you do dismantling and installation of AC, Bed, Sofa etc.?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Yes. Bed dismantling, Sofa wrapping, AC uninstall&ndash;reinstall, TV wall mount removal &ndash; we do everything.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t just lift the luggage, we also do the complete setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓What if we have to move tomorrow?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If there is urgency, then we can get the shifting done same-day or next-morning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Just send the details on WhatsApp today, the team is ready for site visit within 2 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There are two easy ways:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📱 Send the photo of the goods and address on WhatsApp</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🌐 Fill the form on the website &ndash; www.shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The team will call you within 10 minutes and the shifting slot will be finalized.</p>', 'Top Packers and Movers in Sector 27 Gurgaon | Safe & Fast', 'packers and movers sector 27 gurgaon, home shifting services, best movers dlf phase 1, gurgaon local movers, trusted packers sector 27, best packers and movers sector 27 gurgaon, packers and movers gurgaon sector 27,  packers and movers in gurgaon sector 27,', 'Need Fast and Secure Shifting in Sector 27? ShiftingPort Offers Trusted Packers, Quick Packing, and Zero Hidden Charges. Get Free Quote Now!', '2025-07-10 11:17:49', '2025-07-10 12:55:39');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(77, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 16, 1, 1, 1, 18, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 28', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-28', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provides fast, safe and affordable shifting services in Sector 28 Gurgaon. Be it home, office or furniture - our local team handles everything, without any hassle.', '<h2>🏙️ Sector 28 Gurgaon: Where shifting means making life better</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 28, Gurgaon is one of those places where shifting doesn&rsquo;t just mean changing the address &ndash; it is a bold and smart decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Living here means &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Proximity to high-profile areas like DLF,</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Metro stations, schools, hospitals all within 5&ndash;10 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>✅ And a colony that is quiet and connected.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌇 Why do people choose Sector 28?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 28, Gurgaon is one of the few sectors that is located in the middle of DLF Phase 1 and MG Road. People who shift here include</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👨&zwj;👩&zwj;👧&zwj;👦 families,</li>\r\n	<li>👩&zwj;💻 IT professionals,</li>\r\n	<li>📈 and small business owners &ndash; everyone.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Why?</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹The lanes here are quiet and green</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Builder floors near big societies like Jalvayu Vihar, Housing Board Flats and DLF</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Every basic facility is nearby</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And yet the rental or property rate is slightly below Phase 1 or Golf Course Road</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>That is, the right value for money.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚦 Connectivity that makes everyday life easy</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹MG Road Metro Station &ndash; just 4 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹NH-48 Highway &ndash; can be caught in 10 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹IFFCO Chowk and Cyber ​​Hub &ndash; 10&ndash;12 minutes away</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Autos, e-rickshaws and cabs &ndash; available at every corner</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This means &ndash; it becomes easy to balance both work and family.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Shifting has to be done&hellip; but why take the trouble?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Some of the common problems faced by people shifting to Sector 28 are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Society shifting rules</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Truck parking restrictions even on wide roads</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift timing restrictions in high-rise flats</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Delay in security clearance</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And the everyday packing-hustle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This is where ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 28 makes your job easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔑 Why is ShiftingPort the best in Sector 28?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Daily work in local area - fully aware of lanes, blocks, societies</li>\r\n	<li>🔹SoS (Same-day shifting) possible</li>\r\n	<li>🔹From furniture dismantling to crockery safe-pack</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Trained staff + GPS tracking + fully insured system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Now changing address in Sector 28 is not just logistics - it&#39;s a lifestyle upgrade. And ShiftingPort makes it smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 28 &ndash; A name of trust at every turn</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nWhen you decide to shift to Sector 28, the real work begins from there. How will the packing be done, how will the truck enter the society, when will the goods reach, and will everything be safe &ndash; these questions run in everyone&rsquo;s mind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this is where ShiftingPort Packers and Movers comes in &ndash; which gives not just moving, but a complete shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Ground level experience of Sector 28</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We know every corner of Sector 28.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Be it the lanes of Jalvayu Vihar, or the lanes of Housing Board Colony &ndash; or the builder floors bordering DLF Phase 1.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We know:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹What is the correct time to bring stuff to the society</li>\r\n	<li>🔹How to get an entry pass from the guard</li>\r\n	<li>🔹When to get lift access</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Where to park the truck without being towed</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And which blocks require extra manpower</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>These are the details that only a local mover understands &ndash; and this is the biggest strength of ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛡️ Packing quality &ndash; not just fast, but also accurate</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You can trust ShiftingPort because we:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Use foam + bubble wrap combo for crockery, glass, d&eacute;cor items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Offer wooden crate wrapping for TVs and large electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sofa, bed, almirah are dismantled first and then safely wrapped</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Kitchen and pantry items are packed in a separate box category</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Each box is labelled &ndash; so there is no confusion during unpacking</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ Team that understands responsibility, not just work</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Each staff member in our team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Trained for heavy lifting, dismantling and wrapping</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Police verified &ndash; no random labour</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Behaviourally trained, so work is done in the comfort of your home</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Timing and cleanliness are important</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Professionalism is a must in premium societies of Sector 28 &ndash; and we deliver on that expectation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Vehicle is safe, tracking is on-point</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our trucks are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹GPS enabled</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Daily sanitised</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Fully packing-ready</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Size options from 14ft to 19ft &ndash; depending on your luggage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You get live tracking of every move &ndash; so you know where the luggage has reached.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Paperwork, gate-pass and society rules? We take care of it.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many societies in Sector 28 require NOC or entry slip before shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort manages the entire process for you &ndash; so that you don&rsquo;t have to fill even a single form.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ In Short &ndash; Why ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Local understanding + Fast execution</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Budget-friendly clear pricing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹No hidden charges, no delays</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Full support &ndash; before the move, during the move, and even after the move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Now you can worry free and prepare for your new home in Sector 28 &ndash; ShiftingPort will take care of the rest.</p>', '<h2>🚚 Our Packing and Moving Process in Sector 28 Gurgaon &ndash; Reliable at Every Step</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting is not just about packing and moving. In an area like Sector 28, where every society has its own rules and the lanes are sometimes narrow and sometimes busy &ndash; a good mover is the one who takes every step carefully.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The process of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 28 is not just fast, but systematic and safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 1. Site Visit or WhatsApp Inventory Check &ndash; Start Clear</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting starts with planning. We first do a free survey:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Either our team comes to your home</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Or you send us your belongings (photos/videos) on WhatsApp&nbsp;Then we make an item-wise list that counts everything &ndash; furniture, electronics, kitchen items, books, d&eacute;cor etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Then we give you a clear estimate &ndash; how much it will cost, how many people, how many hours it will take. No guesswork.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 2. Professional Packing &ndash; which is safe and smart too</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 28 customers have a special demand &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The packing should be such that the goods do not break and also do not take time.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why we work with a different strategy:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Item</th>\r\n			<th>Packing Material Used</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Crockery / Glass</td>\r\n			<td>3-layer bubble wrap + News wrap + Box cushioning</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>TV / LED</td>\r\n			<td>Foam padding + Optional wooden crate</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture</td>\r\n			<td>Blanket cover + Stretch film wrapping</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Kitchen items</td>\r\n			<td>Divider boxes + Labelling</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Clothes / Books</td>\r\n			<td>Separate wardrobe cartons</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Each box is labelled:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&ldquo;Fragile &ndash; Handle with care&rdquo;, &ldquo;Top Load Only&rdquo;, &ldquo;Bedroom&rdquo;, &ldquo;Kitchen&rdquo;</strong> &ndash; so that you do not have any hassle in unpacking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ 3. Skilled Loading &ndash; Taking care of each item</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Loading is not just a matter of picking up and placing it. Our team loads things by balancing them &ndash; heavy items below, fragile ones above.&nbsp;If almirah, bed, sofa are open, they are dismantled and kept safely.&nbsp;Extra padding is put on furniture corners so that no scratches occur on the way.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 4. Safe Transport &ndash; Keeping in mind the traffic of Sector 28</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Our drivers know every turn of Sector 28, DLF Phase 1, MG Road</li>\r\n	<li>🔹We bring the truck on time so that society timings are followed</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GPS tracking is provided live so that you know where the truck is at all times</li>\r\n	<li>🔹The internal flooring of the truck is also cushioned</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 5. Smooth Unloading and Setup &ndash; Exactly the way you want</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Every box is placed at the place you specify</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture is reassembled</li>\r\n	<li>🔹If external help is needed for TV or AC, we provide coordinated support</li>\r\n	<li>🔹We also carry packing material (garbage) if you want</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ What is special in ShiftingPort in the entire moving?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹No confusion &ndash; every step documented</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dedicated move manager &ndash; just for your shifting</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Society timings, lift rules, parking slots &ndash; everything is in our system</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Team in uniform &ndash; with identity and trust</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>What people in Sector 28 want most is:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&quot;Goods delivered safely, on time, and no rush&quot; &ndash; and that&#39;s what we do.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏘️ Sector 28 Gurgaon Colonies and Societies Where ShiftingPort Shifts Daily</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 28, Gurgaon is an area that looks quiet and simple, but inside it is a highly demanded residential pocket &ndash; especially for those who want to live close to DLF Phase 1, MG Road and IFFCO Chowk.&nbsp;It does not have high-rise societies, but mostly builder floors, housing board flats, and independent plots. And each area has its own peculiarities &ndash; narrow lanes, guard rules, lift availability, and society gate entry rules.&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 28 understands all these complexities completely &ndash; so we work in these areas without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 1. Jalvayu Vihar Apartments (Airforce Housing Society)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Most recognizable society in Sector 28</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Multiple blocks, separate entries</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Parking is limited so small truck and quick unloading required &ndash; our team is trained for this</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Gate-pass and verification is mandatory in the society, which we arrange in advance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 2. HUDA Housing Board Colony (Sector 28)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Mostly independent homes and duplex floors</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Residential preference of elderly couples and families</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Full experience of unloading and carrying goods in narrow lanes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture dismantling and compact lifting is required &ndash; our local team is expert in this</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ 3. Builder Floors along DLF Phase 1 Border</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 28 adjoining DLF Phase 1 has a lot of private floors</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift availability is not available in most places, shifting has to be done using stairs</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Customers here want fast shifting &ndash; Work completed in 2&ndash;3 hours</li>\r\n	<li>🔹We send small trucks with 3&ndash;4 workers, so that work can be done swiftly even in tight lanes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌇 4. Commercial Floors adjacent to MG Road</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 28 boundary touches MG Road, where there are many small offices and shops</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Office shifting, moving of files, chairs, computer systems etc. takes place at these places</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Commercial items need to be delivered quickly and safely &ndash; we provide special wrapping and after-hour shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛣️ 5. Flats and Streets near IFFCO Chowk</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹There are many old flats here which do not have lifts</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Unloading is necessary on time as traffic control is strict on IFFCO Chowk road</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Our team reaches there before time so that shifting is completed without any delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Our coverage in Sector 28:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Jalvayu Vihar</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Housing Board Colony</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Ardee flats (which touch the border 🗺️ We also do regular moving in these nearby areas:</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Around the rear gates of DLF Phase 1</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Commercial blocks near MG Road and ABW Tower</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 28 internal streets (Lane 1 to Lane 6)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🗺️ We also do regular moving in these nearby areas:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 27 (DLF City Phase 1)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sector 24, Sector 25</li>\r\n	<li>🔹MG Road Metro Area</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Udyog Vihar Phase 2 &amp; 3</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Golf Course Road side sectors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Wherever you are in Sector 28 &ndash; ShiftingPort has reached there, and is ready to reach again.&nbsp;Be it your home or office, PG shifting or furniture &ndash; we just need a call.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 ShiftingPort Moving Rates &ndash; Straightforward and Affordable for Sector 28 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 28 Gurgaon customers are those who neither want to spend extravagantly nor compromise on the safety of their belongings.<br />\r\nThis is why ShiftingPort has designed transparent, smart and customized packages &ndash; so that every kind of shifting is completed on budget, on time and tension-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 How are the rates of shifting decided?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>First of all, know that we do not rely on fixed rate charts, but make the right quote according to each customer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rates are decided on these factors:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>📋 Factor</th>\r\n			<th>💡 How It Affects</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK</td>\r\n			<td>Packing material and manpower depend on volume of items</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Distance</td>\r\n			<td>How far is the new location from Sector 28?</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Lift / Stairs</td>\r\n			<td>Time and effort required for loading &amp; unloading</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Details</td>\r\n			<td>Basic wrapping or high-grade bubble wrap with crate?</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture Dismantling</td>\r\n			<td>Includes disassembling and assembling of bed, AC, TV, etc.?</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Time Urgency</td>\r\n			<td>Same-day shifting or scheduled shifting?</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 How does the factor 💡 affect</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹1BHK, 2BHK, 3BHK Packing and manpower according to the amount of goods</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Distance How far is the new location from Sector 28</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift / ladder Time and effort required for loading-unloading</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Packing details Basic wrapping or high-grade bubble-wrap with crate?</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Is dismantling of furniture like opening and assembling of bed, AC, TV etc. included or not?</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Time urgency Same-day shifting or scheduled shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Our Popular Local Packages (for Sector 28)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 1RK / 1BHK Local Shifting &ndash; ₹3,500 to ₹6,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 2BHK Local Shifting &ndash; ₹5,500 to ₹9,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 3BHK with full furniture + appliances &ndash; ₹8,500 to ₹13,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Office / PG Shifting &ndash; ₹4,000 to ₹10,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Furniture / Move of just one or two items &ndash; ₹1,000 to ₹3,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Note: Final rate is always confirmed after site visit or WhatsApp inventory.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎁 What is included in this package?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing material (boxes, bubble wrap, stretch film)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Loading &amp; Unloading</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling &amp; reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Proper labelling + fragile handling</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST-inclusive final billing (No hidden charges)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Local move manager support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Custom package for Sector 28 &ndash; as per your requirement<br />\r\nIf you:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Want only furniture shifting</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Or are moving from PG and have less luggage</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Or need immediate shifting on weekend</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Or want night move after office hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Then we prepare customized quote for you &ndash; exactly as per your requirement, without any extra charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💳 Payment Options</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Cash / UPI / Online transfer</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Booking in advance from just ₹500</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Rest payment after completion of move</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GST bill facility also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 What about hidden charges?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There is no hidden charge in ShiftingPort. Everything is already written in the quote &ndash; packing, lift charge, manpower, truck, fuel, everything is included.&nbsp;We are not the movers who ask for &ldquo;2,000 rupees extra after moving&rdquo; silently.</p>', '<h2>❓ Sector 28 Gurgaon Shifting FAQs &ndash; Your Answers, Straightforward and Clear</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How quickly can ShiftingPort shift in Sector 28 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If you book today, we can send a team to your doorstep by 8 am the next morning.&nbsp;Emergency same-day shifting is also possible &ndash; especially for 1BHK or smaller moves.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Are your services available in all societies of Sector 28?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, we provide regular services in every colony of Sector 28:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Jalvayu Vihar</li>\r\n	<li>Housing Board Colony</li>\r\n	<li>Builder floors bordering DLF Phase 1</li>\r\n	<li>Flats adjoining MG Road</li>\r\n	<li>Internal lanes (Lane 1 to 6)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We are fully aware of the shifting rules of every society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Are your rates fixed or vary according to the goods?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Rates depend on the quantity of goods, distance, lift/stairs, and packing requirements.&nbsp;We give you final quote immediately after WhatsApp inventory or site visit &ndash; no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you bring all the packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, we bring bubble wrap, cartons, stretch film, tape, and all other material ourselves. If you want wooden crate or premium packing, you can tell us in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Is your team verified? How can we trust if they work in-house?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Our entire team is background verified, uniformed and trained.&nbsp;There is a move supervisor in every shifting who manages everything &ndash; and every customer is given staff details in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓What if any goods get damaged during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>We take responsibility even in rare cases. If you want, you can take transit insurance &ndash; which covers accidental damage as well.&nbsp;Our packing is so safe that nothing happens in 99% of the cases.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you also dismantle and