(78, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 17, 1, 1, 1, 19, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 29', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-29', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers do daily moving of PG to 3BHK in Sector 29 Gurgaon. Be it in front of Leisure Valley or in brewery lane – we pack your belongings and transport them to the new place in a completely safe and smart manner.', '<h2>🏙️ Sector 29 Gurgaon &ndash; Shifting with ShiftingPort means comfort, speed and confidence</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking for a place in Gurgaon that is a perfect blend of work, comfort and connectivity &ndash; then Sector 29 is your answer. And when it comes to shifting here, ShiftingPort offers you not just a moving service but a carefree experience.&nbsp;Sector 29 is the place where mornings start at Leisure Valley Park and evenings end near Kingdom of Dreams. In between is the daily rush, office commute, kids&#39; school pickup, and once a week dinner at places like Vapour or Prankster. That means everything is close by and life is perfectly balanced.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Sector 29 &ndash; Prime Location which is talked about all over Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹HUDA City Centre Metro &ndash; walking distance</li>\r\n	<li>🔹MG Road, Cyber ​​City &ndash; 5 to 10 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹NH-48 and Golf Course Road &ndash; connect without any traffic jam</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Premium areas like DLF Phase 4 and Sector 30 just opposite</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Living here means &ndash; &ldquo;Work is near, peace is also near, and every facility is just a call away&rdquo;.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Livability and ambiance &ndash; Perfect for every professional and family</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>In Sector 29 you get:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Spacious builder floors</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Some old but well-maintained HUDA plots</li>\r\n	<li>🔹High-quality PGs and guest houses</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And many commercial-residential mix properties</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Most of the people who shift here are:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹IT/MNC employees</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Doctors, consultants</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Freelancers or small business owners</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Outstation professionals who want to base themselves in Gurgaon for 1&ndash;2 years</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>⚠️ Shifting to Sector 29 is not easy if you don&rsquo;t know the local rules</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There are many things that cause problems while shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Trucks cannot be unloaded in no-parking zones</li>\r\n	<li>🔹PGs and guest houses have specific timings for bringing goods</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Traffic police tow vehicles during moving in some lanes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Night moving is not allowed in commercial zone lanes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All these things seem easy when you have a local expert &ndash; ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Local Trust of ShiftingPort in Sector 29</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is doing daily moving in Sector 29 &ndash; from PG shifting to full 3BHK move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We know:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Where to park the truck safely</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Which building has lift available</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Where to park short-height truck</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And from which guards to take permission first</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>For us, Sector 29 is not just a location &ndash; it is a daily identity.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 ShiftingPort Packers &amp; Movers in Sector 29 Gurgaon &ndash; Who Shift Trust, Not Just Stuff</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Living in Sector 29 is a premium decision &ndash; and shifting in such an area means the need for more caution, more systems and more professionalism.&nbsp;Whether you are shifting from a PG to your 1BHK flat or from a 3BHK apartment to another society &ndash; it is not easy to ensure the safe arrival of your belongings without understanding the lanes and rules of Sector 29.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Choosing ShiftingPort means hiring a team that knows every lane, every building and every shifting challenge of this area in a jiffy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛣️ We know the ground reality of Sector 29</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Trucks have limited time in the lanes near HUDA Metro</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Unloading cannot be done late in the evening around Kingdom of Dreams and Leisure Valley Park</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Commercial lanes with breweries remain jammed during the day &mdash; moving there happens only early in the morning or at night</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Many societies have restrictions on entry pass and lift timings</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has ready solutions for all these problems &mdash; so no work gets stuck, it just goes smoothly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧠 Local Experience + Planning Skills = Zero Stress Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t just move your stuff &mdash; we move it through a structured process:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Advance planning and precise timing of vehicles</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Pre-approval of gate-pass or society NOC</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift, parking and unloading strategy ready</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Staff assigned in advance, so there&rsquo;s no confusion</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Backup arrangements for last-minute changes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>These are the things that ordinary movers don&rsquo;t understand, and that&rsquo;s what sets ShiftingPort apart.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ Our Team &ndash; Recognizable, in uniform, trained</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>People in Sector 29 expect people who come to their homes to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Be neat and clean</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Understand the stuff, not just lift it</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Handle everything gently</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And stick to the timing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The ShiftingPort team operates on this professional standard. Every move has a supervisor who manages the entire process &ndash; with your instructions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Packing quality &ndash; trusted by Sector 29</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Bubble wrap + box cushioning for crockery</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Foam + crate for TV and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sofa, bed, almirah are dismantled and wrapped in furniture blankets</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Clothes and books are kept in wardrobe boxes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Every box is labelled &ndash; &ldquo;Kitchen&rdquo;, &ldquo;Fragile&rdquo;, &ldquo;Top Load Only&rdquo; etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Zero confusion in unpacking &ndash; and negligible chance of damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹100+ successful shifting only in Sector 29</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Daily moving within and from Sector 29</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Police-verified staff</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Fast, clear pricing &ndash; no hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Customer support available till after move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Be it the streets or societies of Sector 29 &ndash; ShiftingPort is known to all.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Just call us &ndash; we will take all the hard work and responsibility on ourselves.</strong></p>', '<h2>🚚 ShiftingPort&#39;s moving process in Sector 29 - thoughtful, not rushed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 29 is not as simple as just calling a truck and some labourers.&nbsp;Every lane, society and gate has its own rules - and keeping these complexities in mind, ShiftingPort has designed a process that makes every kind of shifting smart, safe and smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 1. Evaluation of goods through site visit or WhatsApp</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>We first understand your goods - either:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>by doing a quick site visit</li>\r\n	<li>or by seeing photos/videos of the items sent by you on WhatsApp</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Then we prepare a detailed shifting plan:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>How many boxes are needed</li>\r\n	<li>How many staff will be required</li>\r\n	<li>Which vehicle will go</li>\r\n	<li>And how much time will the moving take</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All this is sent to you with a transparent quote - no guesswork, no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 2. Advance Packing Plan &ndash; Item wise packing</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has a dedicated packing standard for everything:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Item</th