 and lightweight</li>\r\n	<li>Our mini-move team is ideal for student shifting &ndash; smart service at a low cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 4. Kingdom of Dreams / IFFCO Chowk Border Zones</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>This side has some office-cum-residence flats</li>\r\n	<li>Commercial shifting like files, chairs, computers, decor items</li>\r\n	<li>Early morning or late night moving is allowed here &ndash; and our team is trained for that time slot</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>🛣️ 5. HUDA City Centre and Leisure Valley Park Backside Streets</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>There are some old colonies, temporary PGs and studio flats here</li>\r\n	<li>Parking is tight in these streets &ndash; so we use small-body tempo or mini truck</li>\r\n	<li>Locals call us for low-cost shifting packages and fast in/out work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 We do regular moving in these streets of Sector 29:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Leisure Valley Gate 1&ndash;2&ndash;3</li>\r\n	<li>Jalvayu Vihar (Sector 29 Blocks)</li>\r\n	<li>Brewery Lane (Vapour, Prankster line)</li>\r\n	<li>Kingdom of Dreams Backstreet</li>\r\n	<li>Inner lanes opposite HUDA Metro</li>\r\n	<li>Shyam Chowk, Park Facing builder floors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Nearby Coverage that connects to Sector 29:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sector 28, Sector 30</li>\r\n	<li>DLF Phase 4</li>\r\n	<li>MG Road</li>\r\n	<li>IFFCO Chowk</li>\r\n	<li>Sushant Lok Phase 1</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>In every lane of Sector 29, we have unloaded the truck, picked up the goods, and completed the move with a smile.</strong><br />\r\nShiftingPort becomes the first step to your new home &ndash; without any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 ShiftingPort Moving Rates in Sector 29 Gurgaon &ndash; Clear and Reliable</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>People living in premium areas like Sector 29 Gurgaon don&rsquo;t just want cheap rates, but also want a system that works.&nbsp;ShiftingPort&rsquo;s pricing model is built around this very idea &ndash; no hidden charges, no confusion.&nbsp;Only the charges that are actually required for the job &ndash; and a transparent quote, with no &ldquo;post move negotiation&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 What determines the moving rate?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Popular Local Shifting Packages (for Sector 29)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 1RK / 1BHK (Student / PG Move) &ndash; ₹3,000 to ₹5,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 2BHK Full Flat Move &ndash; ₹6,000 to ₹9,500</li>\r\n	<li>👉 3BHK with dismantling &ndash; ₹9,000 to ₹13,500</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Office / Shop shifting (files, chairs, computers) &ndash; ₹5,000 to ₹10,000</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Furniture-only shifting (Sofa, Bed, etc.) &ndash; ₹1,000 to ₹3,000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Note: Final quote is always confirmed after WhatsApp inventory or site visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎁 What is included in every package?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Basic + Premium packing material (carton, bubble, stretch film)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Loading + Unloading</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling + reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Lift handling and staircare</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Fragile item wrapping and labelling</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST-inclusive bill</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Post-moving support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Custom Shifting Package for Sector 29</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every customer in Sector 29 has different needs:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Some want to move on a weekend</li>\r\n	<li>Some want to move just 5&ndash;6 items from their PG</li>\r\n	<li>Some need early morning packing</li>\r\n	<li>And some just need unpacking support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We make customized quote as per your requirement &mdash; without adding any hidden fees.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💳 Payment Options &ndash; As per your convenience</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Booking from ₹500, rest after work</li>\r\n	<li>UPI, Google Pay, Bank Transfer, Cash all accepted</li>\r\n	<li>GST invoice facility</li>\r\n	<li>For companies: proper documentation and signed delivery note</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>⚠️ Hidden Charges? Absolutely not!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s rule is - whatever is said, that is what is written.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Quote already includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Truck fare</li>\r\n	<li>Packing material</li>\r\n	<li>Staff charges</li>\r\n	<li>Lift/No-lift handling</li>\r\n	<li>taxes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>After the move, the story of &quot;Sir, it will cost ₹1,500 more&quot; doesn&#39;t happen here.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📞 Want to know the rate? So just do this:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Send photos of the item on WhatsApp Or fill out our website form And you will get a quote with a full breakdown in 15&ndash;30 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wherever you are in Sector 29 Gurgaon &ndash; from Leisure Valley to PG Zone &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>ShiftingPort packages are designed to suit your time, budget and convenience.</strong></p>', '<h2>❓ Sector 29 Gurgaon moving FAQs &ndash; Your answers, straight and reliable</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How quickly can ShiftingPort do shifting in Sector 29 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If booking is done in the morning, moving is possible by evening on the same day.&nbsp;Emergency shifting facility is also available &ndash; especially for PG and 1BHK moves.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you have service in every street and society of Sector 29?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We serve every location of Sector 29:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Jalvayu Vihar</li>\r\n	<li>Builder floors near Leisure Valley</li>\r\n	<li>Backstreets of Kingdom of Dreams</li>\r\n	<li>Brewery zone (Vapour, Prankster area)</li>\r\n	<li>Streets opposite HUDA Metro</li>\r\n	<li>commercial+residential mix zones</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you bring all the packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We bring bubble wrap, cartons, tapes, foam sheet, stretch film &ndash; everything.&nbsp;You don&#39;t need to buy anything separately.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓How are rates decided? Is there a fixed rate?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Rates are always decided based on the quantity, distance, destination, lift/parking and packing details.&nbsp;We send a final, GST-inclusive quote via WhatsApp inventory or after a brief site visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Is your team reliable? If they work indoors, is there verification?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>100%&nbsp;ShiftingPort&#39;s team is police verified, trained, and in uniform.&nbsp;Each move has a supervisor who manages the team - and crew details are sent to you before the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you face traffic or timing issues in Sector 29?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, Sector 29 has limited unloading times and truck entry in some lanes.&nbsp;But our team knows the local rules, entry gates and timings - we come prepared with everything already set.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you dismantle and reassemble TV, AC, bed?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>TV wall mount removal/install</li>\r\n	<li>Sofa/bed dismantle &amp; reassemble</li>\r\n	<li>Modular furniture fitting</li>\r\n	<li>And if you need an electrician, we will coordinate it.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓What if something breaks?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Our packing is high-quality, but ShiftingPort provides full support in case of rare damage.&nbsp;If you want, you can also take the insurance option &ndash; which covers accidental damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Do you shift only furniture or some items as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes.&nbsp;In Sector 29, people often shift only sofa, washing machine, table or cupboard &ndash; for this we have a mini-move package which starts from ₹1,000.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The lanes of Sector 29 are our daily route &ndash; so we do every moving with the same confidence as you love your belongings.</strong></p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 29 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers in gurgaon sector 29, packers and movers sector 29 gurgaon, packers movers sector 29 gurgaon, packers and movers gurgaon sector 29, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 29, packers movers in gurgaon sector 29, movers in jalvayu vihar gurgaon, house shifting sector 29, furniture movers gurgaon, shifting services near kingdom of dreams, local packers gurgaon sector 29, pg shifting gurgaon', 'Looking for fast, reliable and safe Packers & Movers in Sector 29 Gurgaon? Get secure shifting with ShiftingPort – no stress, no hidden charges.', '2025-07-10 15:30:05', '2025-07-10 16:01:12');
