mini-move possible?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely.&nbsp;Our PG &amp; Mini-move package in Sector 30 starts from ₹1,200 &ndash; perfect for small moves like Sofa, 2 bags, 1 table.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Do you do emergency shifting for Medanta hospital staff?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We do Same-day and Early Morning shifting for Medanta staff. We have full experience of entry gate, parking and no-disturbance rules.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Does ShiftingPort bring all the packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;Cartons, bubble wrap, stretch film, foam sheets, tapes &ndash; we bring everything. We do not compromise on packing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. Are there any extra charges if there is no lift in Sector 30?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If there is no lift, the goods have to be unloaded manually, which increases manpower.&nbsp;We tell you in advance how much will be the charge for which floor &ndash; there are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Do we also dismantle and reassemble AC, TV, furniture?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We do all the dismantling/reassembly work like TV unmount, bed dismantle, sofa disassemble. We can also arrange technicians if needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. There is no truck entry in some lanes of Sector 30, do you manage it?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely.&nbsp;We have prepared special small-body trucks and skilled labour keeping in mind the narrow lanes and restricted entries in Sector 30. We know where mini-tempo will be best.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. How to get moving quote?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Send photo of goods on WhatsApp&nbsp;Or fill a 2 minute form&nbsp;You will get complete price breakdown in 10 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. How is payment done? How much do you have to pay for booking?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Booking gets confirme