(80, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 19, 1, 1, 1, 21, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 31', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-31', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort moves daily in every street, block and society of Sector 31 Gurgaon. Professional shifting from 1RK to 3BHK and clinics - with transparent rates, fast service and full packing. Send photos on WhatsApp (8586828846) today and get a quote in 30 minutes!', '<h2>🏙️ Sector 31 Gurgaon &ndash; The perfect blend of peace and convenience, shifting made easy with ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking for a place in Gurgaon where you can find peace, every amenity is close by, and everyday life goes on without the hustle and bustle &ndash; then Sector 31 can be your next home.<br />\r\nThis area is preferred by those who want open air, greenery, and connectivity &ndash; all in one.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And when it comes time to move to a well-planned residential area like Sector 31, you need a local expert team like ShiftingPort packers and movers&ndash; who not only move the stuff but also make every move stress-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Sector 31 &ndash; The perfect balance of location and connectivity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 31 is also known as the Green Belt Residential Sector of Gurgaon.&nbsp;Every important place is just 5&ndash;10 minutes away from here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>HUDA Metro Station &ndash; 4 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>NH-48 Highway &ndash; 3 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>Medanta Hospital &ndash; 5 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>Rajiv Chowk &ndash; 7 minutes</li>\r\n	<li>Civil Lines, Sector 14, 15, 32 all nearby</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you are looking for a house for yourself or want to shift near your office &ndash; Sector 31 is a practical and peaceful location in every way.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️Who lives here?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In the streets of Sector 31, you will find:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Government officials and Defence retirees</li>\r\n	<li>IT professionals who work in Gurgaon</li>\r\n	<li>Doctors from hospitals like Medanta and Artemis</li>\r\n	<li>Local businessmen whose work is in MG Road, Sadar or Civil Lines</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>And this is the reason why the demand for shifting here remains throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Shifting in Sector 31 is not easy &ndash; if you don&rsquo;t have local knowledge</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Entry is restricted in some blocks (like Block A and C)</li>\r\n	<li>Truck entry in some streets is only allowed before 9 am or after evening</li>\r\n	<li>Manual labour required as lifts are not available</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture-heavy houses are more &ndash; dismantling/re-assembly is a must</li>\r\n	<li>Parking is often shared &ndash; parking a truck can be tricky</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The ShiftingPort team knows every lane in Sector 31 &ndash; so we plan it all in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 31?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We have a weekly move in every block</li>\r\n	<li>Full knowledge of local RWA rules</li>\r\n	<li>Experienced crew + ID verified staff</li>\r\n	<li>Safe shifting from 1RK to 3BHK and clinics</li>\r\n	<li>Rate and timing &ndash; both are clear, no hassle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ShiftingPort is not just a movers team for Sector 31 residents, but a reliable local service &ndash; which works on time, safely and with the system.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🤝 Why ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers is the first choice in Sector 31 &ndash; when trust and understanding are needed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 31 Gurgaon is an area where people live with their families for years.&nbsp;The atmosphere here is peaceful, but the houses are big, and shifting often involves a heavy load of furniture-heavy items, fragile crockery, and kitchen essentials.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a situation, one needs movers who bring not just trucks and labour &ndash; but understanding, planning, and courtesy.&nbsp;ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers has become that trusted name for Sector 31.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧠 We know Sector 31 inside out</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Advance intimation is required for entry into Block A and B</li>\r\n	<li>In some colonies, truck entry is only through gate no. 2</li>\r\n	<li>Parking is tight in central park-facing homes</li>\r\n	<li>Manual shifting is more frequent as very few homes have lifts</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is bulky &ndash; hence a dismantle/reassemble specialist is required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort team knows the practical reality of every block and lane of Sector 31.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Pre-Move Planning &ndash; so that nothing goes adhoc on the day of move</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Our process starts from here:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Inventory check via WhatsApp or site visit</li>\r\n	<li>House and society inspection &ndash; whether there is lift or not, which entry gate</li>\r\n	<li>Truck size and crew strength finalize</li>\r\n	<li>Packing requirement discussion</li>\r\n	<li>Time slot and gate permission lock</li>\r\n	<li>Every step is ready before the move.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ Trained and Verified Crew &ndash; Specially aligned for Sector 31</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Police verified movers</li>\r\n	<li>Soft-spoken and uniformed staff</li>\r\n	<li>Supervisor in every move</li>\r\n	<li>Extra care to Senior citizens and women customers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team considers your home as &ldquo;beginning of a new home&rdquo; and not a &ldquo;move site&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 High-grade Packing &ndash; As per Sector 31 standards</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Item</th>\r\n			<th>Packing Method</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>TV / AC</td>\r\n			<td>Foam + Bubble + Carton</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Sofa / Almirah</td>\r\n			<td>Blanket + Stretch wrap</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Kitchen Items</td>\r\n			<td>Labelled boxes with cushioning</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Fragile Crockery</td>\r\n			<td>Triple layer wrap + Fragile tags</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Books / Clothes</td>\r\n			<td>Heavy-duty cartons or wardrobe box</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Clear label on every carton &ndash; so that unpacking is smooth too.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Our Regular Presence in Sector 31</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Weekly move in Block A, B, C, D</li>\r\n	<li>Shifting of doctors associated with Medanta</li>\r\n	<li>Joint moves associated with Sector 15, 32, and Sushant Lok</li>\r\n	<li>Mini-move packages from PG to 1RK for ₹1000&ndash;₹2000</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ShiftingPort moves not just belongings, but also the trust of people in Sector 31 &ndash; that too without any hassle.</strong></p>', '<h2>📦 ShiftingPort Moving Process for Sector 31 Gurgaon &ndash; Systematic and Stress-Free</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When shifting to Sector 31 Gurgaon, just hiring a truck and labour is not enough.&nbsp;The size of the houses here is big, the furniture is complex, some streets are narrow and there are time restrictions on parking or entry of trucks.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers has developed a structured moving system for Sector 31 that works according to your every need and local reality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Step 1: Site Visit or WhatsApp Inventory Collection</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>If you want, you can send us pictures of your house and list of goods on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>Or we do a free home visit as per your convenience</li>\r\n	<li>This gives us clarity in deciding truck size, labour requirement and packing plan</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ We give you the correct quote after seeing your goods &ndash; without any hidden charges</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Step 2: Planning and Schedule Finalization</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We do planning as per the gate rules and timing of your society</li>\r\n	<li>Whether there is a lift or not, how many floors are there, whether manual shifting is required or not &ndash; everything is confirmed</li>\r\n	<li>Early morning or weekend shifting facility is also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Keeping in mind the reality of Sector 31, we plan everything in advance, so that there is no hassle on the day of move.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 3: Professional Packing &ndash; With Premium Material</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Item</th>\r\n			<th>Packing Style</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>LED TV / Microwave</td>\r\n			<td>Thermocol + Bubble + Box</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Sofa / Bed</td>\r\n			<td>Blanket wrap + Stretch Film</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Glass Items</td>\r\n			<td>Triple Cushioning + Fragile Tags</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Clothes / Shoes</td>\r\n			<td>Wardrobe Box or Suitcase</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Kitchen Items</td>\r\n			<td>Labeled heavy-duty cartons</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>We pack every item according to its structure and value.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ Step 4: Safe Loading &ndash; According to Weight and Fragility</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>First of all in heavy furniture base</li>\r\n	<li>TV, Crockery, mirror and other things are fixed on top</li>\r\n	<li>If there is staircase or lift access, manpower is deployed accordingly</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture dismantlement and secure wrapping is done on-site</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Our staff is fully trained on how to lift and place every item.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Step 5: Timely Transport &ndash; with GPS Enabled Truck</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Available from small tempo to 14ft trucks</li>\r\n	<li>We know which routes in Sector 31 have traffic, where the truck can pass through</li>\r\n	<li>Timing is set as per your requirement</li>\r\n	<li>Every truck has GPS &ndash; so you can track</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 Step 6: Unloading and Final Setup</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The goods are placed in the exact room where you want</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is reassembled</li>\r\n	<li>Packing material is collected</li>\r\n	<li>Boxes are opened as per labeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>After the move is complete, we support you till you are completely set up.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Bonus Step: Review &amp; Feedback</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every move closes with a feedback form, which lets us know how the client&#39;s experience was &ndash; and where we can improve even more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>The ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers &nbsp;process is not just about picking up belongings &ndash; it is a carefully designed relocation journey for every home.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏘️ Sector 31 Local Streets &amp; Societies &ndash; Where ShiftingPort Moves Every Day</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 31 Gurgaon is not just a residential area it is a hub where hundreds of shiftings happen every month &ndash; from PGs to 3BHK flats, clinics to offices.&nbsp;And most of these people choose ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers &mdash; because we know every street, society and rule of the sector like a local.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Major Residential Areas where we move regularly:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏠 Block A, B, C, D &ndash; HUDA Approved Floors</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Most prime location of Sector 31</li>\r\n	<li>Homes here are spacious &ndash; usually 2BHK / 3BHK</li>\r\n	<li>Truck entry is according to restricted timing &ndash; our team takes permission in advance</li>\r\n	<li>Lift is less &ndash; so we send manual trained crew</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏘️ Villas &amp; Independent Houses &ndash; Park Facing / Central Park Line</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Furniture-heavy shifting</li>\r\n	<li>Trucks cannot enter through the gate, so distance-based loading planning is done</li>\r\n	<li>More senior citizens and joint families live here &ndash; who need smooth shifting</li>\r\n	<li>More Sunday or holiday moves &ndash; ShiftingPort reserves such slots in advance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🛌 PG and 1RK Flats &ndash; Near Medanta Road and Exit Points</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Fast shifting for students and interns</li>\r\n	<li>Mini-move package &ndash; ₹1000 to ₹2500</li>\r\n	<li>Packing + shifting complete in 1 hour</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day shifting possible on weekends</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏨 Clinics and Workspaces &ndash; In Quiet Back Lanes of Sector 31</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Physiotherapy, Dental, Small Consulting clinics</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture + files + electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Off-hour shifting so that practice doesn&rsquo;t stop</li>\r\n	<li>Sensitive item handling &ndash; UPS, chairs, fragile units</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Regular Coverage of ShiftingPort Streets:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Gate No. 1 &amp; Gate No. 2 Entry Belts</li>\r\n	<li>Community Park lanes (Block B and D)</li>\r\n	<li>Back road from Medanta to Sector 31</li>\r\n	<li>1RK colonies near Sector 32 exit</li>\r\n	<li>Connecting patch towards Old Gurgaon (Civil Lines Border)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Nearby Sectors with which we also do Combined Moves:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sector 15 Part 1 &amp; 2</li>\r\n	<li>Sector 14 (Old Gurgaon)</li>\r\n	<li>Sector 32 (Industrial Area)</li>\r\n	<li>Sector 45 &amp; Medanta Zone</li>\r\n	<li>DLF Phase 3 (via Hero Honda Chowk)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 What do we move in Sector 31?</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Type</th>\r\n			<th>Description</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK / 2BHK Flats</td>\r\n			<td>Sofa, Bed, Kitchen, TV etc.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK Villas</td>\r\n			<td>Full Furniture dismantle + re-setup</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>PG Move</td>\r\n			<td>Bag + Table + Mattress type items</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Clinics</td>\r\n			<td>Dental Chairs + Files + Systems</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture-only Move</td>\r\n			<td>Sofa set, Almirah, Tables</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>ShiftingPort&#39;s experience in every street, gate, and park facing location of Sector 31 speaks volumes &ndash; that&#39;s why people call us without a second thought.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 ShiftingPort moving rates for Sector 31 Gurgaon &ndash; completely transparent and as per local practicality</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The first question while shifting to a full-residential area like Sector 31 is &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;What will be the rate?&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>And often people either fall for over-quoted movers or cheap movers who reveal hidden charges on the last day.&nbsp;There is no misleading quote or hidden charge at ShiftingPort packers and movers.&nbsp;We clearly tell you every rate upfront &ndash; as per the item, distance and your society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 What factors does moving rate depend on?</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Factor</th>\r\n			<th>Impact</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Your Home &ndash; 1RK, 2BHK or 3BHK?</td>\r\n			<td>Determines the volume of goods</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Truck Size &ndash; Mini or 14ft?</td>\r\n			<td>Depends on entry space and items</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Is there a lift or not?</td>\r\n			<td>Increases manual labour requirement</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Distance &ndash; Local move or nearby sector?</td>\r\n			<td>Affects truck travel cost</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Is furniture dismantling needed?</td>\r\n			<td>Extra time + technician required</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Fragile / High value items?</td>\r\n			<td>Extra packing safety needed</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Typical Moving Rates for Sector 31</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Package</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Rate (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Suitable For</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>PG / 1RK Move</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</td>\r\n			<td>Students, Interns</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,500 &ndash; ₹4,500</td>\r\n			<td>Singles, Couples</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,500 &ndash; ₹8,000</td>\r\n			<td>Small Families</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK Full House</td>\r\n			<td>₹8,500 &ndash; ₹13,500</td>\r\n			<td>Furniture-heavy Homes</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Clinic / Office Move</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,000 &ndash; ₹11,000</td>\r\n			<td>Dental, Consultancy etc.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture Only Move</td>\r\n			<td>₹800 &ndash; ₹3,000</td>\r\n			<td>Sofa, Almirah, Table etc.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📝 All rates include labour + truck + standard packing material. GST will be charged separately if you want for invoice.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎁 What is included in every package?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Packing material (Cartons, foam, bubble, stretch wrap)</li>\r\n	<li>Trained movers and supervisor</li>\r\n	<li>Truck charges (Petrol, driver)</li>\r\n	<li>Loading + Unloading</li>\r\n	<li>Dismantle/reassemble (bed, table, TV etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>Labels &amp; Fragile handling</li>\r\n	<li>Optional: Insurance &amp; GST bill</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💳 How to make payment?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Booking confirm for ₹500</li>\r\n	<li>Balance payment after move</li>\r\n	<li>Accepted: UPI, GPay, Bank Transfer, Cash</li>\r\n	<li>GST invoice and payment receipt is received</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📱 How to get the quote?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Send photos on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>Or get a free site visit</li>\r\n	<li>You will get a complete breakup in 15&ndash;30 minutes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>No confusion in booking &ndash; everything is pre-decided</strong></p>', '<h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) about Moving in Sector 31 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Does ShiftingPort move in every lane and block of Sector 31?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely.&nbsp;We cover Block A, B, C, D, park-facing villas, PGs and clinics &mdash; every society and lane of Sector 31.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Can we shift just a few pieces of furniture or 4-5 items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;Our mini-move package starts from ₹1000 &mdash; perfect for light loads like Sofa, Table, Mattress.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Does ShiftingPort do a site visit before giving a quote?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, absolutely.&nbsp;If you wish, our team can visit your home in Sector 31. Otherwise, you can WhatsApp the photos of the items and get a quote within 15&ndash;30 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Do you bring packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We bring bubble wrap, cartons, stretch film, foam sheets, and tapes ourselves.<br />\r\nYou don&#39;t need to bring anything.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. Is there an extra charge if there is no lift?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If there is no lift, manual labour is required, which makes the cost vary a little.&nbsp;But we tell you the flat charge in advance - no hidden fee.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Is TV, bed, sofa dismantled and reassembled?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;ShiftingPort has trained technicians who dismantle and reassemble furniture.<br />\r\nTechnical tasks like TV unmount and AC removal can also be done (some charges may apply).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Which lanes of Sector 31 have restricted entry?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>In Block A and D, truck entry is usually allowed only before 9 am or after 6 pm.<br />\r\nOur team checks these rules beforehand and plans for them.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. Do you do same-day shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, if available.&nbsp;Same-day is possible in 1RK, PG, or urgent shifting Sector 31.&nbsp;If you book early, time slot can be confirmed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. Is there compensation in case of damage to luggage?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Our packing is professional but in rare cases if there is any damage, we provide full support.&nbsp;If you want, you can also take insurance add-on before move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓10. How to book and how is payment done?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Advance booking from ₹500</li>\r\n	<li>Final amount after move</li>\r\n	<li>Payment options: GPay, UPI, Bank Transfer, Cash</li>\r\n	<li>GST invoice and receipt are also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 <strong>WhatsApp now for quote:</strong> +91-8586828846</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> info@shiftingport.com</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>When shifting from Sector 31 requires local understanding, correct rates and time management &ndash; ​​ShiftingPort is the right choice in Gurgaon.</strong></p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 31 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers sector 31 gurgaon, packers movers sector 31 gurgaon, packers and movers gurgaon sector 31, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 31, packers movers gurgaon sector 31, furniture shifting gurgaon, house relocation gurgaon, best movers near medanta, shifting service in sector 31, trusted packers gurgaon', 'Looking for fast, safe and reliable shifting in Sector 31 Gurgaon? Get professional movers from 1RK to 3BHK from ShiftingPort – Low rates, No hidden charges!', '2025-07-10 20:16:56', '2025-07-10 21:11:11');
