ight transport</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Your luggage is as important to us as it is to you.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🕒 4. On-time arrival and completion &ndash; no excuses</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 34, traffic is unpredictable, but our planning is tight:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>30 mins buffer window</li>\r\n	<li>Early crew reporting</li>\r\n	<li>Material loading ready at night</li>\r\n	<li>Trucks on standby for emergency move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have completed entire PG shifting in 2 hours many times &ndash; and that too with zero damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 5. No Hidden Charges &ndash; The biggest foundation of trust</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many movers ask for money after shifting by making excuses like &ldquo;extra floor charge&rdquo;, &ldquo;extra manpower&rdquo;, or &ldquo;loading delay&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What ShiftingPort says in the beginning is the same:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Written estimate</li>\r\n	<li>Final rate clear in advance</li>\r\n	<li>No negotiation during shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Your experience should be clean and professional &ndash; this is our priority.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 6. Recommendation of 1000+ Sector 34 Clients</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our satisfied clients are from Sector 34 to many sectors of Gurgaon:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>College students</li>\r\n	<li>IT professionals</li>\r\n	<li>Family movers</li>\r\n	<li>Local shop owners</li>\r\n	<li>Freelancers shifting home office setups</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Google reviews, WhatsApp messages, and referrals &ndash; this is our real marketing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 Trust because we do more than &ldquo;just pick up and move&rdquo;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers treats your shifting as a proper process &ndash;<br />\r\nwith pre-planning, care, and commitment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Choosing us in Sector 34 Gurgaon means &ndash;<strong> freedom from tension and a new beginning with peace.</strong></p>', '<h2>❓ FAQ &ndash; Common questions and answers about Packers and Movers in Sector 34 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Does ShiftingPort do same-day shifting in Sector 34?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, absolutely.&nbsp;If the item is small like 1BHK or PG shifting, we can arrange same-day moving. Our local team works daily in Sector 34, so availability is fast.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Do you deliver from Sector 34 to other cities (like Delhi, Noida, Jaipur)?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers deliver from Gurgaon to all over India. Be it Delhi NCR or Bangalore, Mumbai, Jaipur &ndash; we manage everything from doorstep pickup to safe delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. What are the charges for PG shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>PG shifting costs between ₹1200 and ₹2500, depending on the items, floor and distance.&nbsp;Our Mini Move package is most preferred by students and bachelors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Do you bring packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We bring bubble wrap, stretch film, cartons, tape, and furniture sheets ourselves.&nbsp;Each item has a different quality and layer of packing - from crockery to electronics.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. Do you do furniture shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;Many people in Sector 34 shift bulky items like sofa, almirah, table from one floor to another or to a nearby sector.&nbsp;Our Furniture-Only Plan is most practical for this.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Is there a facility for car and bike shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, absolutely.&nbsp;We get a wooden crate for bike and an open/enclosed container for car.&nbsp;We pick up the car from your home and do doorstep delivery &ndash; with proper tracking and damage cover.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Is there any compensation in case of damage or loss of luggage?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>We provide full security, but transit insurance is also available for unexpected situations.&nbsp;As per records, ShiftingPort has completed 99.5% of moves without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. Is shifting possible on weekends?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely.&nbsp;We work with a full team even on Saturday&ndash;Sunday and holidays &ndash; so that your office or personal time is not disturbed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. How many days in advance is it right to book?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>For a small move (PG or 1BHK), 1 day in advance is also fine.&nbsp;If you are shifting to 2BHK or outstation, it is better to book 2&ndash;3 days in advance so that the plan remains smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓10. How can we be sure that you are the right movers?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>The biggest reason to trust us is our ground experience in Sector 34.&nbsp;We already know the rules of your block, street and society.&nbsp;Google reviews, local references and repeat customers &ndash; this is our real proof.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 34 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort Trusted Shifting Experts', 'packers and movers sector 34 gurgaon, packers and movers in sector 34 gurgaon, packers movers sector 34 gurgaon, packers movers gurgaon sector 34, packers and movers gurgaon sector 34, packers movers in gurgaon sector 34, best packers movers gurgaon sector 34, packers and movers near me, shiftingport movers gurgaon, house shifting sector 34, movers in gurgaon, bike relocation gurgaon, trusted movers sector 34', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers makes shifting of your home, office, bike or car in Sector 34 Gurgaon easy, fast and completely safe. Get free estimate now with zero hidden charges and local team!', '2025-07-11 14:50:19', '2025-07-11 15:16:49'),
(84, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 23, 1, 1, 1, 25, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 35', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-35', '1999', NULL, 'Make shifting easy in Sector 35 Gurgaon with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. From PG to 3BHK, Car to Office - local experience, clear estimate and 100% reliable service for every move.', '<h2>🏠 Why is the demand for Packers and Movers in Sector 35 Gurgaon increasing rapidly?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 35 Gurgaon may look like a quiet residential sector, but the area has become quite dynamic in terms of shifting activity these days.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dozens of houses, offices and tenants change their addresses every week.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The team of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers works every day in the streets, blocks and societies here &mdash; and we know what people here want most: fast, safe and hassle-free shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 Highlights of Sector 35 Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Mix of old and new homes in HUDA-approved blocks</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Connectivity advantage of nearby Subhash Chowk, Hero Honda Chowk and Sector 34</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Good balance of both rent and ownership</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Schools, coaching centres, showrooms and job hubs in nearby sectors</li>\r\n	<li>🔹All this makes Sector 35 a point where the process of move-in and move-out is constantly going on.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a situation, every second house needs a local and sensible packers and movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧳 Who shifts to Sector 35?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>👨&zwj;👩&zwj;👧 Families:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is common to buy a house bigger than 3BHK or 2BHK or move from society to individual floor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>👨&zwj;💼 Working Professionals:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Offices are on MG Road, Cyber ​​City, and Sohna Road, so many people commute from here daily. Moving from PG to flat is common.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏢 Small Business Owners:</strong><br />\r\nThere are some home-run offices, tuition centres and freelance studios around Sector 35 which keep getting office relocation done.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚛 Students and Bachelors:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because of nearby colleges and institutes, bachelors shifting is also quite common.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 But can every mover manage all this?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Some lanes in Sector 35 are a little narrow, and some societies have strict entry timings.&nbsp;If movers are not aware of the local structure and society rules, then the move can lead to delay, confusion and sometimes even damage of goods.&nbsp;The true meaning of Packers and movers is &ndash; a service partner who:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Knows the turn of the lane</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Knows which block the truck can enter</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Understood which building does not allow shifting for more than 2 hours</li>\r\n	<li>🔹And most importantly &ndash; who can reduce your stress with his experience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why ShiftingPort Packers and Movers &ndash; Best-fit for Sector 35?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Worked in every lane of Sector 35</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Experience from PG shifting to 4BHK relocation</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Same-day shifting facility</li>\r\n	<li>🔹No hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Customized plan for every client</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort doesn&rsquo;t just pick up the goods, it plans the move &ndash; so that you feel peace, not shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Services in Sector 35 Gurgaon &ndash; Trusted Solution for Every Moving Need</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>There is not just one type of shifting requirement in Sector 35 Gurgaon &mdash; some need to move from PG to 1BHK, some family is shifting from 3BHK to a new society, and some people just want to shift their car or bike out of Gurgaon.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers here caters to all types of relocation with professional, local knowledge and customized planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting &ndash; Small or big, every home move is easy</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>People in Sector 35 shift from PG, 1BHK, 2BHK to fully-furnished independent floors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our home shifting package includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Pre-move survey and planning</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Special packing of fragile items (crockery, TV, mirror)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture dismantling and reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Lift or no, manpower complete</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Unloading + box labeling + room-wise placement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers have moved dozens of houses in Sector 35 without a scratch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation &ndash; From small business to startup</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>There are many freelancer studios, tiffin centres and coaching hubs in and around Sector 35.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹We have relocated many offices here:</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Workstation dismantle</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Safe packing of PCs, printers and routers</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Organised shifting of confidential files</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Safe removal of network wires</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Next-day or weekend shifting facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We make office moves time-sensitive and without downtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗🛵 3. Car &amp; Bike Transport &ndash; Sector 35 to PAN India</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>With relocation in Gurgaon, the demand for car and bike transport has increased rapidly.<br />\r\nShiftingPort&rsquo;s vehicle shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Foam wrapping + wooden crate option for Bike</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Open and closed container truck for Car</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Door-to-door pickup &amp; drop</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Tracking support and damage cover available</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Services to Delhi NCR, Jaipur, Pune, Bangalore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage / Warehousing &ndash; safe place for temporary shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many clients in Sector 35 want to store their belongings for short term &ndash; like in case of renovation, rent gap or job transfer.<br />\r\nWe provide:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Per-day, weekly, monthly storage plans</li>\r\n	<li>🔹CCTV-monitored, pest-free warehouses</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Labelled inventory and moisture-proof packing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Pickup-storage-delivery all from one place</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪑 5. Furniture Only Shifting &ndash; Sofa, Almirah, Table etc.</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Internal shifting or furniture shifting is very common in Sector 35, especially in ground-to-1st floor cases.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have mini-move setup:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹1&ndash;2 helpers + small truck</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Bubble + sheet wrapping</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Complete shifting from ₹1000 to ₹1800</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Same-day delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧳 6. Students / PG Mini Moves &ndash; Budget-friendly Quick Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 35 has a large number of bachelors and students who keep changing rooms from nearby sectors or PGs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers offers mini-move packages:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Compact packing of clothes, books, kitchen items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Scooter or mini-truck facility</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Move complete in ₹1200&ndash;₹2500</li>\r\n	<li>🔹No hidden fees + fast support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Why is ShiftingPort the best for Sector 35 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Local-friendly approach of every service</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Weekend and emergency shifting available</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Written estimate and transparent pricing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹4.9⭐ rated service with repeat customers</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Real trust of Packers and Movers, not show-off</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>🏘️ Local Reality of Sector 35 Gurgaon &ndash; Where ShiftingPort provides Packers and Movers services on a daily basis</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 35 Gurgaon may be a medium-sized residential sector, but shifting happens here every week.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to the different blocks, lanes and layouts, the most important thing for Packers and Movers here is local understanding and flexible planning.<br />\r\nThe ShiftingPort team doesn&rsquo;t just send vehicles to Sector 35 &ndash; we know every turn, every gate, every block.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🗺️ Popular Zones of Sector 35 where we are most active:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Block A, B, C &ndash; Old HUDA floors and independent houses</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In these blocks, 1st and 2nd floor shifting is more common.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>There is no lift, stairs are narrow, so manpower selection matters a lot here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The ShiftingPort crew knows which items to lift up by hand and which ones to dismantle and take away.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Sector 35 service lanes &ndash; lanes connected to Main Sohna Road</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>PG shifting and bachelors move is more common here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Keeping in mind the narrow lanes, different entry time and tight parking spaces, mini truck and smart packing work is done.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🔹 Flats and builder floors adjacent to DLF Phase 1</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some of these societies are semi-gated, where the window for shifting is available only from 9 am to 12 pm.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team reaches in advance with advance gate-pass and packing planning so that no client&#39;s time is wasted.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Where do people come from and where do they move in Sector 35?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>As per our data, the shifting pattern in Sector 35 looks like this:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Internal shifting (sector 35 A to B block or flat change in same sector)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Move-ins from Sector 15, 31 and 46</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Move-outs towards Palam Vihar, MG Road, and DLF Phase 3</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Big demand from Dwarka, Janakpuri, and Uttam Nagar towards Delhi</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers creates custom plans according to all these routes and requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Local Knowledge = Zero Last-Minute Trouble</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>While working in Sector 35, we have seen many cases where:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Movers did not know the society entry time</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Parking was far away and had to carry the luggage manually</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Gate-pass was not made till the last moment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>But ShiftingPort knows all this in advance:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Which society closes entry after 10 am</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>In front of which block the truck will have to be reversed</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Where more helpers will be needed and where less manpower will be needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Why is shifting smooth with us in Sector 35 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>We do advance planning &ndash; no chaos on the day of shifting</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Manpower is trained and polite</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Truck size and luggage weight match perfectly</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Society gate-pass, watchman dealing and floor support &ndash; everything is managed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛣️ Our daily presence is our experience</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 35 we:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Completed 3BHK floors in 6 hours</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Delivered 5+ PG shifting same-day</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Relocated 4 office setups on a weekend</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Stored 15+ clients&rsquo; luggage and delivered it safely after 2 weeks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All this is possible &ndash; only because ShiftingPort Packers and Movers knows the ground reality of every turn, restriction and requirement of Sector 35.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔧 How ShiftingPort Packers and Movers works in Sector 35 Gurgaon &ndash; Step-by-Step Process</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When someone calls us for shifting in Sector 35 Gurgaon, our planning starts from there.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t ask &ldquo;How much luggage is there?&rdquo;, we ask &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&ldquo;On which floor is your house?&rdquo;,</strong> <strong>&ldquo;Will the truck enter there?&rdquo;</strong>, <strong>&ldquo;Is the lift working?&rdquo;</strong>, <strong>&ldquo;What is the society entry time?&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>This is what makes ShiftingPort Packers and Movers different.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>☎️ Step 1: Contact and Quick Response</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You WhatsApp or call us &mdash; we ask you basic info:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Pickup &amp; Delivery location</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Nature of luggage (home, office, bike etc.)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Condition of floor, lift, parking</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Expected date and time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our daily team is present in Sector 35, so the response is fast and human &ndash; no bots or delays.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎥 Step 2: Free Survey &ndash; Site Visit or WhatsApp Video Call</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We visit the site physically or get a video survey done.<br />\r\nThis gives us clarity on:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>What should be the truck size</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>How much packing material will be required</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>How many helpers and how much time will it take</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Is furniture dismantling required or not</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Pre-move planning makes the shifting day chaos-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Step 3: Quotation &ndash; Written and Transparent</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>After the survey, we give you a proper written quotation, in which everything is clear:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Total cost (with/without packing)</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>What is included &ndash; loading, unloading, transportation</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>No hidden charges</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 35 clients appreciate us because we charge only what is told beforehand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 4: Packing &ndash; Safety First, Speed ​​Second</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>On the day of move, our team arrives on time &ndash; with respect and safety of the goods:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Double bubble wrapping for crockery and glasses</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Sheet wrap + corner protectors for furniture</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Cushioning for electronics</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Labeled cartons for clothes</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Separate packaging for books, shoes, kitchen</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We look at every item with the value it has for its owner.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Step 5: Loading and Transportation &ndash; With Local Insight</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Truck size is pre-decided keeping in mind the lanes, turns and societies of Sector 35.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Heavy stuff below, fragile above</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Secure tie-downs and sequence-based loading</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>GPS-enabled vehicle</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Experienced drivers who know the Gurgaon routes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If the destination is outside Sector 35, time buffer and fuel margin is managed in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Step 6: Unloading and Setup &ndash; Zero Confusion, Total Clarity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Unloading on delivery is done smartly:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Each carton is kept in the room where it is labeled</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Furniture is reassembled</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Client is asked to verify if any item is missing or damaged</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Final cleaning and material disposal is also done by us</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💳 Step 7: Payment and Feedback &ndash; After full satisfaction</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>For payment we:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Accept Cash, UPI, Online transfer</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Provide proper bill/invoice</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Ask for Google Review or direct WhatsApp feedback from the client &ndash; ​​so that we can improve further</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 We are not just Movers, we are a process partner</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers keep shifting in Sector 35 Gurgaon:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Time-based</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Stress-free</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>And aligned with local-realities.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Zero Chaos, Pure Coordination &ndash; this is our promise.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>🌟 Why ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is the most trusted in Sector 35 Gurgaon?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When someone shifts their home or office in Sector 35 Gurgaon, the first question that comes to their mind is &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&quot;Will the goods reach on time and safely?&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&quot;Will there be any last minute problems on the day of shifting?&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&quot;Are the movers trustworthy?&quot;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>There is only one trusted answer to all these questions &ndash;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And the reason behind this is not just our name, but our hard work and experience every day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ 1. Ground knowledge of every street, block and society of Sector 35</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not new here &ndash; we work daily in A, B, C block, Main Road, and interior lanes in Sector 35.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>In which block the truck has to be reversed</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Where the gate-pass is made online</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>In which societies the guard strictly follows the time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Understanding all these things saves us from last-minute hassles &ndash; and this builds trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ 2. Trained Team &ndash; No casual labour</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We don&rsquo;t bring random labour. The entire team of ShiftingPort is trained, uniformed and experienced:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Every worker knows how to lift the luggage, where to hold it</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Fragile luggage gets extra care</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>How to talk to clients &ndash; this is also taught</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You will neither feel embarrassed nor delayed &ndash; only clean, professional work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📦 3. High Quality Packing &ndash; Because we consider luggage as responsibility, not luggage</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 35 clients have often said &ndash;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ldquo;We have never seen the way you packed the sofa before!&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this is our daily standard:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>3-layer wrapping for sofa and furniture</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>double bubble + stretch film for crockery</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>foam guards for TV and microwave</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>labeled cartons for clothes and books</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This is the reason why 97% of our moves so far have been without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🕒 4. Time Commitment followed &ndash; No excuses, only punctuality</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many Gurgaon movers don&rsquo;t turn up on time &ndash; but for ShiftingPort it&rsquo;s not time, it&rsquo;s discipline:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Survey and shifting both on time</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Early morning or late evening move possible</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>No chaos with pre-move planning</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Backup vehicle ready for emergency move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 5. No Hidden Charges &ndash; Clarity builds trust</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort charges only what is written beforehand &ndash;<br />\r\nNo negotiation on the day of move, no last-minute shock:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Written quotation</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Transparent cost breakup</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>No fuel, toll or floor-charge drama</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>People from Sector 35 come to us again and again &ndash; because we earn respect, not just money.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 6. Trust and Repeat Business of 1000+ Sector 35 Clients</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is trusted by families, bachelors, and businesses in Sector 35:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>&quot;Last time you shifted my brother&#39;s stuff&quot;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>&quot;5 people in our society have already got their shifting done by you&quot;</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>&quot;Your helper was the same one who came 2 years ago - he does a good job&quot;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>It&#39;s not just service, it&#39;s a relationship that we build.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Trust is built because we don&#39;t just lift boxes - we take responsibility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort The meaning of packers and movers in Sector 35 Gurgaon has changed - it now means:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Work on time</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Damage-free delivery</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>Clear estimate</li>\r\n	<li><strong>🔹</strong>And planning by understanding the client&#39;s tension</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓ FAQs &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions about Packers and Movers in Sector 35 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Does ShiftingPort do same-day shifting in Sector 35?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, absolutely.&nbsp;If the luggage is not too heavy or outstation, we can complete same-day shifting. We have a daily team in Sector 35, so the work can start quickly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Do you do furniture shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We safely shift items like sofa, almirah, bed, dining table from one floor to another without packing &ndash; starting at ₹1000.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Do you do shifting even if you move out of Sector 35?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;Whether you are moving from Sector 35 to Delhi, Noida or Jaipur, or any other city &ndash; we provide PAN India packers and movers service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Do you do bike and car shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely.&nbsp;For bikes, we provide wooden crate and foam packing. For cars, there are both enclosed and open container options &ndash; with pickup and drop facility.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. What is the charge for PG shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>PG or mini shifting costs ₹1200 to ₹2500. This includes shifting of clothes, books, kitchen items and daily-use items.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Do you bring packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;Bubble wrap, stretch film, tape, cartons &ndash; we bring everything. Customised packing is also available for electronics and fragile items.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Does ShiftingPort work on weekends and holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We also do shifting on Saturday-Sunday and public holidays. Advance booking is advisable for weekend move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. What if any item gets damaged during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>We take maximum care but insurance option is available for precaution. In rare cases, damage compensation process is clear and written.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. How much advance do I have to pay?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>₹200&ndash;₹500 token advance is taken for small shifting (PG, 1BHK). 10&ndash;20% is taken as confirmation for big shifting. Final payment is taken after delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓10. Why is ShiftingPort considered better than other movers?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Because we don&#39;t just give rates, we give local experience, trained staff and zero chaos process. The trust of our 1000+ satisfied clients in Sector 35 is our biggest proof.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 35 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort Local Moving Experts', 'packers and movers sector 35 gurgaon, packers and movers gurgaon sector 35,  packers movers gurgaon sector 35,  packers and movers in gurgaon sector 35, packers and movers near me, local packers and movers, shiftingport movers gurgaon, home shifting gurgaon sector 35, office relocation gurgaon, bike transport gurgaon, trusted movers sector 35', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provide safe and timely shifting services of home, office, bike and furniture in Sector 35 Gurgaon. Get free quote today with fast response, no hidden charges and 1000+ happy clients!', '2025-07-11 16:47:49', '2025-07-11 17:18:57');
