50 moves</li>\r\n	<li>Every client review: &ldquo;Peaceful shifting experience&rdquo;</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓ Sector 38 Gurgaon Packers and Movers Questions Everyone Wants to Ask</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q1. Does ShiftingPort do shifting in builder floors in Sector 38?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, yes.&nbsp;Most of the shifting in Sector 38 is from builder floors where there is no lift or narrow lanes.&nbsp;Our team is expert in manual stair-shifting &ndash; whether it is 3rd floor or heavy luggage.&nbsp;We plan with light commercial vehicle and proper manpower.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q2. Do you do PG shifting or small luggage shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, yes.&nbsp;We provide PG shifting packages starting from ₹1200, which include items like just a few boxes, an almirah or a study desk.&nbsp;It is a very economical solution for students, job professionals or solo movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q3. Is it your or the client&#39;s responsibility to provide gate pass in societies in Sector 38?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>The responsibility of getting the gate-pass is of the client, but we provide complete help.&nbsp;We guide the client beforehand on how to talk to the gate guard, which ID to give, and how to keep track of the shifting timing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q4. Does ShiftingPort also do dismantling and re-assembly of the items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, and that too very cleanly and safely.&nbsp;Beds, dining tables, modular wardrobes, TV units &ndash; all these are dismantled and re-fitted by our trained team.&nbsp;We work with proper tools and safe practices so that no item gets damaged.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q5. Do you also do unpacking and garbage removal after shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, if the client wishes, we also provide the facility of unpacking and setup.&nbsp;Putting clothes in the almirah, setting up the TV, and picking up the packing trash &ndash; all this can be included.&nbsp;There is a little extra charge but the experience is stress-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q6. What happens if something gets damaged during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>We do 98% of the moves damage-free because our packing is multi-layered.&nbsp;But if something gets damaged, we offer insurance claim or internal compensation process for it &ndash; with full satisfaction of the client.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q7. Do you do same-day shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, we do &ndash; if slot is available.&nbsp;Many times emergency shifting happens in Sector 38 Gurgaon and we have done same-day 2BHK or small moves.&nbsp;You just need to inform a little early &ndash; so that the team can be ready.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q8. Can we shift bike or car also?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes.&nbsp;We do vehicle relocation from Sector 38 to all over India.&nbsp;Bike is sent in foam wrapping + carton case and car is sent in hydraulic ramp truck.&nbsp;Tracking and delivery time is shared in advance.</p>', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 38 Gurgaon – Reliable and Fast Service', 'packers and movers sector 38 gurgaon, packers movers sector 38 gurgaon, packers and movers gurgaon sector 38, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 38, packers and movers near me, shiftingport packers movers, movers and packers sector 38 gurgaon, home shifting sector 38, bike relocation gurgaon, office movers sector 38 gurgaon', 'Need to shift home or office in Sector 38 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort Packers and Movers offers safe, affordable and fast service - from builder floors to high-rise flats. Call now!', '2025-07-12 07:53:09', '2025-07-12 08:25:16'),
