\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 ShiftingPort packers and movers only charges for the service that the client charges &ndash; no force-pack or surprise billing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📲 How is the estimate made?</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>You send a list of items or a video on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>Site visit (free) is done for Sector 43 clients</li>\r\n	<li>We send you a written quotation within 30 minutes &ndash; on WhatsApp or email</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3>⚠️ Hidden Charges? Absolutely not</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our quotations include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing material</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Manpower</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST (if applicable)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Setup + Re-arrangement charges</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No move is started without a written estimate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 ShiftingPort&#39;s Step-by-Step Shifting Process in Sector 43 Gurgaon &ndash; Safe, Smooth, and Stress-Free</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting to a premium and well-managed area like Sector 43 Gurgaon is not a simple task.&nbsp;For shifting to societies like The Palm Springs, Parsvnath Exotica, Devinder Vihar and Sushant Lok</p>\r\n\r\n<p>you need a mover who not only moves the goods but also executes each step with planning, professionalism and care.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers follows a step-by-step shifting process for every society in Sector 43 &mdash; making your experience fast, clean and smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Enquiry and Consultation &ndash; Starting with clarity</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You call or WhatsApp us</li>\r\n	<li>We ask basic information: how much is the goods, which floor is it, is there a lift or not, when is the shifting to be done</li>\r\n	<li>If needed, we also do a free video survey or site visit (same-day possible in Sector 43)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Client gets clarity of cost estimate, timing and planning in the first interaction itself.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Quotation and Confirmation &ndash; Estimate with Zero Hidden Charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We send you a detailed quotation according to the goods and service</li>\r\n	<li>Every element is written in it: packing, transport, manpower, dismantling, GST</li>\r\n	<li>You approve the quotation and we confirm the move date</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Written estimate increases confidence &ndash; no last-minute arguments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Packing &ndash; Category-wise Safe Wrapping</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Thermocol + bubble + foam sheet for fragile items (TV, crockery, mirrors)</li>\r\n	<li>Plastic wrapping + corner pads for sofa and furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Individual cushioning and labeled tagging for designer items</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe cartons for clothes &ndash; with hanger</li>\r\n	<li>Moisture-proof packing for electronics</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Premium packing keeps items safe, scratch-free and organized.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Loading &ndash; Smart Weight Balance and Secure Trucking</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Manpower is decided according to lift or staircase</li>\r\n	<li>Fragile items are loaded on top of truck, heavy items are loaded below</li>\r\n	<li>Space in truck is optimized with blankets and straps</li>\r\n	<li>Truck type is fixed according to building gate and parking restriction (LCV, Tata 407, etc.)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Items do not shift during move in truck &ndash; safe delivery guaranteed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Transport &ndash; Time-Commitment and GPS Access</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Truck reaches society gate at the decided time</li>\r\n	<li>Society entry pass, gate protocol and lift permission are cleared in advance</li>\r\n	<li>Client can also take live truck tracking option if he wants</li>\r\n	<li>Full waterproofing is done in rainy season</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No delay, no excuse &ndash; just scheduled and clean execution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Unloading and Setup &ndash; House is made ready-to-live</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Items are set room-wise at the destination</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is reassembled (beds, tables, wardrobes etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>Boxes are opened and wrapping is removed</li>\r\n	<li>Client is given final walkthrough as per checklist</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You don&rsquo;t get tired after shifting &ndash; house becomes usable immediately.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ After-Move Support &ndash; The move doesn&rsquo;t end, the relationship begins</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>If any item is forgotten, broken, or setup is mismatched &ndash; it is fixed immediately</li>\r\n	<li>Repeat customers are given special offers on future shifting</li>\r\n	<li>Facility to collect packing material or revisit shifting is available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Not a one-time mover, we become your trusted shifting partner.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🌟 Why Choose ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers in Sector 43 &ndash; Trust, Experience and Local Understanding</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 43 Gurgaon is not just a luxury area, but an expectation-driven zone.&nbsp;Residents here &ndash; whether they are senior professionals staying in Parsvnath Exotica,<br />\r\nor luxury apartment owners in The Palm Springs &ndash; demand quick, silent, and damage-free service when it comes to shifting.<br />\r\nShiftingPort Packers and Movers understand the ground realities and society protocols here &ndash;&nbsp;so we don&rsquo;t just move, we work as sector-specialists.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧍&zwj;♂️ 1. Local Expertise &ndash; Understanding of every society and every street of Sector 43</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We have done shifting dozens of times in Devinder Vihar, Jalvayu Vihar, Parsvnath Exotica and Sushant Lok</li>\r\n	<li>We have regular contact with the entry system, lift timing and security staff of every society</li>\r\n	<li>We know how much manpower will be required in which building, where the truck can stop and in which streets we need a mini truck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No confusion, no delay &ndash; every move is perfectly planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧳 2. Premium Packing &ndash; Security as per Sector 43 standards</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Imported crockery, leather sofas, glass tables or high-end electronics &ndash;</li>\r\n	<li>We do customised packing of every item</li>\r\n	<li>Thermocol, foam sheet, bubble wrap, corrugated boxes and moisture-proof covers are always available</li>\r\n	<li>We also make wooden crates for TVs and delicate items</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Zero damage shifting &ndash; the item reaches as it is.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏱️ 3. Time Discipline &ndash; Exact arrival as per Society shifting slot</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sector 43 societies provide fixed time slots &ndash; we plan dispatch accordingly</li>\r\n	<li>From lift timing to gate entry &ndash; the entire truck, crew and material is ready in advance</li>\r\n	<li>We also handle early morning or late evening shifting (on booking)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No last-minute stress &ndash; your shifting plan remains completely smooth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ 4. Verified, Trained Crew &ndash; Professional people you can trust</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every helper is background verified and professionally trained</li>\r\n	<li>Comes in proper uniform, gloves, tools and safety gear</li>\r\n	<li>No smoking, no misbehavior &ndash; our crew is respectful and soft-spoken</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You let the crew handle things confidently even in front of the family.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 5. One Contact Point &ndash; Every client gets a dedicated move coordinator</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You don&rsquo;t have to talk to different people for each step</li>\r\n	<li>One person explains the quotation, manages the move, and is available even after shifting</li>\r\n	<li>WhatsApp updates, material confirmation and crew arrival &ndash; all coordinated by one contact</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Communication is clear and service is organized.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💵 6. Transparent Pricing &ndash; full details without hidden charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>ShiftingPort explains every cost item-wise &ndash; no &ldquo;you found out after the move&rdquo; thing</li>\r\n	<li>Written estimate is sent on WhatsApp or email</li>\r\n	<li>No tips forced, no GST confusion &ndash; total clarity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Budget remains under control and confidence remains.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 7. Custom Plans &ndash; Only the service you need</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Want packing only? You will get it</li>\r\n	<li>Want to send a bike but not furniture? Done</li>\r\n	<li>Want shifting without dismantling furniture? We handle it</li>\r\n	<li>Want to move 2km away from PG? Mini truck available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No extra cost, no unwanted service &ndash; full flexibility.</p>', '<h2>❓ Top 10 FAQs of Sector 43 Gurgaon Clients &ndash; Trusted Answers by ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Has ShiftingPort worked with Sector 43 societies like Parsvnath Exotica or Palm Springs?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We have worked with all major Sector 43 societies multiple times.&nbsp;Society protocol, lift timing, gate clearance &ndash; our team has complete knowledge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Is there any survey to inspect the items before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We do video survey or physical visit &ndash; that too free of cost, especially in Sector 43.&nbsp;This makes your quote accurate and move is planned in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Can just 1&ndash;2 furniture items be shifted?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We do light-load or mini-shifting as well.&nbsp;If you need to send only bed, fridge or sofa, we send mini truck and 2 helpers &ndash; same-day move is possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Is there special packing for expensive crockery or LEDs?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We have foam, bubble wrap, thermocol and wooden crates packing available for fragile items.&nbsp;We shift luxury items in item-wise customized packing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Is shifting possible on weekend or Sunday?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We work for 7 days. As per the slot of gated societies in Sector 43,&nbsp;We also handle early morning or evening shift &ndash; with pre-approval.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Are shifting charges fixed in advance?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. Once you approve the quotation, there is no hidden charge after that.&nbsp;GST, dismantling, material &ndash; everything is clearly mentioned in the written estimate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Do you dismantle and re-setup the furniture?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. Sofa, double bed, modular wardrobes, dining tables &ndash; everything is dismantled and set up in the same way at the new location.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Does ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provide storage service?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. If your goods need to be stored temporarily (renovation, rent gap),<br />\r\nwe provide CCTV-monitored storage in a secure warehouse &ndash; from 3 days to 3 months.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Is the waste material (cartons, wrap) collected after shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. As per the convenience of the client, we also collect used packing material &ndash; so that there is no clutter in your new house and a clean environment is maintained.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔟 How much advance is required for shifting to Sector 43?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>A nominal advance is taken &ndash; usually 10&ndash;20% of the total amount&nbsp;so that the truck and crew can be blocked. The rest of the payment is made after delivery.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 43 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 43 gurgaon, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 43, packers and movers gurgaon sector 43, packers and movers near me, packers and movers sector 43, best shifting services gurgaon, home relocation in sector 43, office movers gurgaon, ShiftingPort movers and packers sector 43,', 'Choose expert packers and movers for premium flats and offices in Sector 43 Gurgaon – ShiftingPort provides the fastest, safest and most organized shifting service.', '2025-07-12 14:19:52', '2025-07-13 09:24:04');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(93, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 32, 1, 1, 1, 34, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 44', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-44', '1999', NULL, 'Shifting to societies, PGs and offices in Sector 44 Gurgaon is now easy with ShiftingPort. We provide premium packing, time-bound transport and trained crew – everything at fixed rates. From home shifting to office relocation and storage – trust only the experts.', '<h2>🏙️ Increasing demand for shifting in Sector 44 Gurgaon &ndash; Know the real reasons</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 44 Gurgaon today is not just a residential area but has become a business and lifestyle hub.&nbsp;The area is close to HUDA City Centre Metro Station and NH-48,&nbsp;making it the epicentre of shifting activity of hundreds of professionals and families every day.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Specialty of this area:&nbsp;</strong>Premium flats, guest houses, coaching centres and tech offices &ndash; everything is available in one sector.&nbsp;Residential pockets like DLF Corporate Greens, IFFCO Chowk proximity, and Sudarshan Vihar have made<br />\r\nSector 44 a dynamic relocation zone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Sector 44 societies and their shifting needs</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sudarshan Vihar: Middle to high income group flats, where mostly transferred government employees and working couples live</li>\r\n	<li>Sector 44 HUDA Flats: Here family shifting as well as bachelor PG shifting is very common</li>\r\n	<li>Private Villas and Independent Floors: The properties here have high-value furniture and d&eacute;cor items, whose safe shifting is critical</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 In these areas, the expectation from movers is not just to carry the goods, but to take complete responsibility.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧭 Why is the demand for Packers and Movers increasing in Sector 44?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Frequent transfers due to proximity to Metro station and NH</li>\r\n	<li>Bachelorettes shifting due to coaching hubs and rental properties</li>\r\n	<li>Corporates shifting guest houses or studio apartments for employees</li>\r\n	<li>High ratio of weekend shifting and urgent same-day moves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 People here are not satisfied with &ldquo;standard shifting&rdquo; &ndash; they want time-bound, damage-free and society compliant move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers &ndash; Why are they Best Fit for Sector 44?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just a truck and carton company &ndash;&nbsp;We understand the pulse of Sector 44 and design our services accordingly:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Light-load crew for lift-less buildings</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Hourly pack + move plans for PG shifting</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Full setup + unpack for guest house shifting</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Wooden crate + labeled tagging for fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Night-time relocation with zero noise for office move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 We consider shifting a responsibility, not a process.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 Local Factor: What sets us apart</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Knowledge of every society, lane and parking pattern in Sector 44</li>\r\n	<li>Nearby access to warehouses (4 minutes away from IFFCO Chowk)</li>\r\n	<li>On-call material delivery, urgent manpower availability</li>\r\n	<li>Real-time handle of local traffic and entry restrictions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 The ShiftingPort team works daily in Sector 44 &ndash; we are not &ldquo;available&rdquo;, we are from here.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers Key Services &ndash; One-Stop Solution for every relocation need in Sector 44 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 44 Gurgaon is not just one category &mdash; from senior government officers to startup founders and PG students, everyone is moving here.&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers offers multiple, customized shifting solutions for this diverse crowd.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting (1BHK to Villa)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Local shifting (within or around Sector 44)</li>\r\n	<li>Intercity shifting (Gurgaon to Delhi, Noida, Jaipur, Chandigarh etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture dismantling and setup</li>\r\n	<li>Premium packing: crockery, TV, d&eacute;cor, artifacts</li>\r\n	<li>Room-wise labeling and unpacking facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Ready-to-live shifting for families &ndash; without any tension.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation (From Small cabin to Full corporate setup)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tables, chairs, documents, partitions, systems &ndash; everything safe shift</li>\r\n	<li>Evening and weekend shifting option (noise-free operation)</li>\r\n	<li>Cabling, networking and label-wise packing of server material</li>\r\n	<li>Team manages setup at destination too</li>\r\n	<li>Hourly plan available for small offices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Shift without closing the office &ndash; with zero downtime strategy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛵 3. Bike &amp; Car Transport (Secure, Tracked, and with Insurance)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Gurgaon to pan India bike shifting &ndash; wooden crate option</li>\r\n	<li>Car transport in open and enclosed carriers</li>\r\n	<li>Transit insurance and live tracking facility</li>\r\n	<li>Pre-inspection report and delivery confirmation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Vehicle shifting is no longer time-consuming, it is a one-call solution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage &amp; Warehouse (both short term and long term)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Facility to store goods during renovation or rent gap</li>\r\n	<li>24x7 CCTV, humidity control, and barcode tagging</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day pickup + scheduled re-delivery</li>\r\n	<li>Secure space available on per box/per item/per flat basis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Shifting and storing &ndash; same place, from same team.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪑 5. Furniture Dismantling &amp; Re-setup (Customized Service)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Safe packing after dismantling modular furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Expert handlers of furniture like IKEA, Pepperfry, Urban Ladder</li>\r\n	<li>Re-assembly and room placement at destination</li>\r\n	<li>Sofa, beds, wardrobes, dining tables &ndash; everything is covered</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No need to call extra carpenter &ndash; we prepare the entire setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 6. Small Load / PG Shifting (Budget Plans for Students &amp; Bachelors)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You can also shift 2&ndash;3 items (fridge, bed, table, etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>Hourly plan of Mini truck + 2 helpers</li>\r\n	<li>Boxes are provided &ndash; packing can be done by you or our team</li>\r\n	<li>Fast move &ndash; same-day delivery with optional unpack</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 The most affordable and practical move option for PGs and bachelors of Sector 44.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 Add-on Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service</th>\r\n			<th>Details</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>AC, Geyser Uninstall / Reinstall</td>\r\n			<td>Certified technicians with all tools</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>LED Wall Mount Service</td>\r\n			<td>Safe uninstallation and repacking</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Material Delivery</td>\r\n			<td>Sending boxes and wrap one day before the move</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Used Material Pickup</td>\r\n			<td>Collecting extra waste after shifting</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<h2>💰 Cost of Packers and Movers in Sector 44 Gurgaon &ndash; How ShiftingPort gives Fair Price Promise</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When someone shifts their home or office in Sector 44, the first question is &ndash;&nbsp;&quot;How much will it cost?&quot;&nbsp;And the second is &ndash; &quot;Will we be asked for anything extra after shifting?&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort packers and movers we believe that clear pricing = client trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why we send a written quotation before every move that details every cost with a breakdown.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 How are charges decided?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every shifting is different, so the charges depend on these factors:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Factor</th>\r\n			<th>Explanation</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Volume of Goods (1BHK, 2BHK...)</td>\r\n			<td>More goods mean bigger truck and higher manpower required.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📍 Distance (local or outstation)</td>\r\n			<td>Greater distance increases fuel, toll, and time costs.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🧱 Floor and Lift Availability</td>\r\n			<td>More helpers needed in buildings without lift access.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🛠️ Need for Dismantling/Assembly</td>\r\n			<td>Furniture disassembly/assembly requires extra skilled labor.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Packing Quality (normal vs premium)</td>\r\n			<td>Fragile items need bubble wrap, foam, and crates, increasing cost.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🗓️ Day and Time of Move</td>\r\n			<td>Demand is higher on weekends and month-end dates.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Estimated Rate List &ndash; Average Charges for Sector 44</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>Starting Price (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Approx Range (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK Local Shift</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK Local Shift</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,000 &ndash; ₹9,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK Premium Shift</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500 &ndash; ₹13,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Office Shifting (Small)</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000 &ndash; ₹10,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport (Local)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹2,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport (Delhi NCR)</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Storage Charges (Monthly)</td>\r\n			<td>₹500/Box</td>\r\n			<td>₹500 &ndash; ₹1,200/Box</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Note: Final price site survey or video call It is confirmed after assessment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 What is included in the quotation?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing Material</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck Charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Manpower (Loading/Unloading)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling &amp; setup</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST (if applicable)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Optional: Insurance, Storage, AC technician etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>❌ Why are there no hidden charges in ShiftingPort Packers and Movers?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every client is given a written estimate on WhatsApp/email</li>\r\n	<li>No move is based on verbal agreement</li>\r\n	<li>Final payment is taken after delivery, only if you are fully satisfied</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 For us, shifting is not just a service, it is a question of client&#39;s trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 Complete process of shifting in Sector 44 Gurgaon &ndash; Absolutely safe, smooth and time-bound execution</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in societies and offices in Sector 44 is not easy &ndash;&nbsp;things like lift timings, entry permission, narrow lanes and time restrictions can complicate the process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has understood every challenge of Sector 44 and designed a step-by-step system,&nbsp;so that every move is organized, predictable and hassle-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Enquiry &amp; Assessment &ndash; It all starts with your question</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You contact us by calling, WhatsApp or filling a form</li>\r\n	<li>We take basic information: how much stuff is there, what is its current location, which floor is it on, when do you want to shift</li>\r\n	<li>We also do a free video survey or physical site visit in Sector 44</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You get a transparent estimate and we are prepared with exact planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Quotation &amp; Confirmation &ndash; Written Estimate, Zero Confusion</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We send you a detailed quotation &ndash; it includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>packing, loading, transport, GST, dismantling, extra services (like AC, LED), etc.</li>\r\n	<li>After client approval, move date and time is fixed</li>\r\n	<li>Preparation for gate pass or lift permission from the society is also done in advance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: No charge comes as a surprise &ndash; everything is done upfront.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Packing &ndash; Safety First, Speed Second</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Foam wrap + bubble + carton for fragile items like crockery, mirror, glass table</li>\r\n	<li>Plastic wrap + corner pads for sofa, beds and chairs</li>\r\n	<li>Labeling and cushion packing for designer items and documents</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe cartons for clothes and moisture-proof covers for electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Wooden crates are also made onsite if required</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Luxury items remain safe in premium flats of Sector 44, without any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Loading &ndash; Custom Planning as per Floor, Lift and Lane</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Ground or 2nd floor flats have different manpower planning</li>\r\n	<li>Lift access is used properly &ndash; without noise and without delay</li>\r\n	<li>Luggage is loaded in the truck in heavy-to-light order</li>\r\n	<li>Secured with protective blankets and straps, so that luggage does not move during transit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Organised loading = quick unloading and less damage risk.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Transport &ndash; Time-Bound and GPS Enabled Move</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Truck reaches Sector 44 as per exact schedule</li>\r\n	<li>Destination society&rsquo;s gate clearance and time slot is planned in advance</li>\r\n	<li>We also offer GPS live tracking, so that you can see real-time location</li>\r\n	<li>Extra protection layers are used for rain or dust</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Luggage reaches safely &ndash; you remain tension-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Unloading &amp; Setup &nd