is background verified and police checked</li>\r\n	<li>Uniformed team comes onsite with gloves and safety gear</li>\r\n	<li>No smoking, loud talking or misconduct &ndash; our crew is respectful and trained</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Full safety assurance for both your family and luggage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Premium Packing Standards &ndash; We shift emotions, not luggage</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Bubble, foam, corrugated sheets for fragile crockery, glass artifacts, LED TVs and designer d&eacute;cor</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe cartons for clothes and stretch wraps for furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Facility to get wooden crates made onsite is also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: The luggage will reach as it is &ndash; no damage, no scratches.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Transparent Pricing &ndash; Every expense is explained item-wise</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Written quotation is sent on WhatsApp or email</li>\r\n	<li>No hidden cost, no increase later</li>\r\n	<li>GST, material, manpower, dismantling &ndash; everything is clearly mentioned</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Budget control and mental peace &ndash; together.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Flexible Shifting Plans &ndash; Plan as per your client</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Just want to send the goods? Possible</li>\r\n	<li>PG shifting? Mini truck at hourly rate</li>\r\n	<li>Want weekend shifting? Guaranteed slot on advance booking</li>\r\n	<li>From full packing to just transport &ndash; you decide, we will serve</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You pay only for what you actually take.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Time Discipline &ndash; Plan the move keeping in mind the Society time slot</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The gate entry time and lift timing of Sector 44 societies are known in advance</li>\r\n	<li>We schedule the move accordingly &ndash; no delays, no confusion</li>\r\n	<li>Late evening or early morning moves are also handled professionally</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You don&rsquo;t have to take any stress on the day of shifting &ndash; everything is planned in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ After-Support and Loyalty Value &ndash; Even after shifting, we are with you</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Post-move visit for unpacking, carton collection or re-arranging luggage</li>\r\n	<li>Response within 24 hours on complaint or feedback</li>\r\n	<li>Special discount and priority slot for repeat clients and referrals</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Once you become a client, you are treated like a family member.</p>', '<h2>❓ Real FAQs asked by Clients of Sector 44 Gurgaon &ndash; Trusted Answers by ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Has ShiftingPort worked with societies in Sector 44 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We have done dozens of shiftings in Sudarshan Vihar, HUDA Flats and private villas.&nbsp;We have complete information about gate pass, lift rules and parking arrangements of every society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Is there a physical or video survey before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We do a free video survey in Sector 44 or doorstep assessment if needed.&nbsp;This gives you an exact estimate and the move is well-planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Is shifting service available for 1BHK or less items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>Yes. We send mini trucks and helpers for PG, 1BHK, or just a few furniture items &ndash; on an hourly basis or flat rate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Is there special packing for fragile items like crockery and glass?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We use bubble wrap, foam sheets, cardboard layering and even wooden crates &ndash;&nbsp;so that any delicate item does not get damaged during the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Does ShiftingPort dismantle and set up the items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. Sofa, bed, dining table, wardrobes &ndash; everything is dismantled and set up again at the destination.&nbsp;There is no need to call a separate carpenter.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Are shifting charges fixed or increased later?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>They are always fixed. Written quotation is sent before the move &ndash;&nbsp;and you make the final payment after delivery, based on satisfaction.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Do you shift on Sundays or holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We are active for 7 days. We plan the move either early morning or late evening as per the gate timing of the societies in Sector 44.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Do we provide storage facility?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. If you need to store goods temporarily (rent gap, renovation),&nbsp;we provide CCTV-secured, dust-free storage &ndash; both short or long term.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Are waste cartons and material collected after shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. As per client&#39;s convenience, we collect used cartons, bubble wraps and plastic sheets the next day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔟 Does ShiftingPort provide goods insurance during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, optional insurance is available. For high-value or long distance moves, we offer goods transit insurance &ndash;&nbsp;so that your goods are completely safe from accidental damage.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 44 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 44 gurgaon, \r\nsector 44 packers and movers, packers movers in sector 44 gurgaon, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 44, packers movers in sector 44 gurgaon, packers and movers near me, home shifting services in gurgaon, office relocation in sector 44,  best movers sector 44 gurgaon, ShiftingPort movers and packers gurgaon', 'Choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers for hassle-free home, office, bike shifting in Sector 44 Gurgaon – with fast, insured and expert crew.', '2025-07-12 16:04:48', '2025-07-13 09:17:31'),
(94, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 33, 1, 1, 1, 35, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 45', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-45', '1999', NULL, 'Shifting to Sector 45 Gurgaon now means stress-free move - with ShiftingPort. We provide secure packing, trained crew and timely delivery, be it 1BHK, office relocation or urgent move - all with transparent rates and local experience.', '<h2>🏙️ Why packers and movers service increased in Sector 45 Gurgaon? Know the ground-level truth</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 45 Gurgaon is one of those areas that offers something for everyone &mdash;&nbsp;HUDA Metro Station is nearby, there are big schools like DPS Gurgaon and Amity,&nbsp;DLF Phase and Cyber City are very easy to reach.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why dozens of families, bachelors, working couples and small businesses are active for shifting here every day.&nbsp;Not just residential shifting in Sector 45,&nbsp;PG relocation, corporate guest houses, coaching centres, and small warehouse movement needs have also increased rapidly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Major societies of Sector 45 and their shifting profile</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 45 is connected to the prime sectors nearby &mdash;&nbsp;because of this, people living here often maintain a high-value lifestyle, and shifting expectations are also the same.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Major residential pockets:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Greenwood City: 3BHK-4BHK luxury floors and villas &mdash; high-end families shift</li>\r\n	<li>Sapphire Apartments: bachelor PG to family rental flats &mdash; frequent move-ins and move-outs</li>\r\n	<li>Ansal Sushant Lok-II extensions: independent builder floors, where furniture-heavy shifting happens</li>\r\n	<li>DPS School and Amity vicinity: academic-year based shifting of students and parents</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 People here consider shifting as a full-scale responsibility, not just shifting of belongings</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Relocation Challenges in Sector 45 &ndash; which common movers cannot underst