ce &ndash; with ShiftingPort packers and movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🛠️ 6 Key Services of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 45 Gurgaon &ndash; Local Solution for Your Every Move</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 45 is not just about furniture shifting &ndash; people move out of PGs into family flats,&nbsp;small businesses expand to other sectors, and sometimes clients need urgent shifting on weekends.<br />\r\nShiftingPort Packers and Movers handles every kind of need in an individual way &ndash;&nbsp;and that is why we are not just movers, but are called &ldquo;relocation partners&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting (1BHK to Full Villa)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Local shifting &ndash; Sector 45 to Sector 46, HUDA City Centre or DLF</li>\r\n	<li>Full packing &ndash; crockery, kitchenware, books, wardrobe, d&eacute;cor</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture dismantling + re-assembly &ndash; bed, sofa, dining, almirah</li>\r\n	<li>Floor-to-floor shifting (taking care of lift and narrow stairs)</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day delivery and setup facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Ideal for families, couples, and senior citizens who want to shift without stress.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation (from Startups to law firms)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Labelled packing of workstations, tables, documents and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Server and cable dismantling/re-installation</li>\r\n	<li>Weekend/night shifting facility to avoid business downtime</li>\r\n	<li>Dedicated teams for business zones like Sector 44, 46, Golf Course Road</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Smooth, silent and structured shift &ndash; so that your productivity is not affected.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛵 3. Bike &amp; Car Transport (Secure and Insured Move)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Foam packing + crate option for scooters, bikes and premium vehicles</li>\r\n	<li>Car shifting in open/enclosed carriers &ndash; pan India</li>\r\n	<li>Vehicle pre-inspection, insurance and delivery confirmation</li>\r\n	<li>GPS-enabled tracking system</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Be it home shift or job transfer &ndash; your vehicle will also reach safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage &amp; Warehouse Facility (Short/Long Term Both)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Facility to store goods during renovation or rental gap</li>\r\n	<li>24&times;7 monitored warehouse &ndash; dust-free, moisture-protected</li>\r\n	<li>Rate plans on per box / per item / per flat basis</li>\r\n	<li>Scheduled pickup and re-delivery option</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 If you get a flat in Sector 45 but don&rsquo;t have space to store your goods &ndash; we are there.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛋️ 5. Furniture Dismantling &amp; Reinstallation (Modular/Heavy Furniture)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Urban Ladder, IKEA, Home Centre furniture dismantle/reassemble</li>\r\n	<li>Bed, wardrobe, dining table, office partition setup</li>\r\n	<li>Tools and technician are brought along</li>\r\n	<li>Full furniture placement facility after shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No need for extra carpenter &ndash; our crew takes care of everything.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 6. Student/PG Shifting (Low budget, high convenience)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Mini truck + 2 helpers model (hourly package)</li>\r\n	<li>Easy shifting of 4&ndash;6 boxes, bed, table, and fridge</li>\r\n	<li>If client does not have packing material, we provide it</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day shift &ndash; without delay and without damage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Perfect solution for PGs, bachelors and working professionals in Sector 45.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📲 Add-on facilities that make shifting complete</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Facility</th>\r\n			<th>Description</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>AC, Geyser Uninstall/Install</td>\r\n			<td>Certified technician, branded tools</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>LED Wall Mount / Uninstall</td>\r\n			<td>Safe handling and reinstallation</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Used Material Pickup</td>\r\n			<td>Post-shifting cleanup of plastic and waste</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Advance Packing Delivery</td>\r\n			<td>Boxes and wrap delivered one day in advance</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting in Sector 45 Gurgaon is now fully organized &ndash; ShiftingPort&nbsp;packers and movers has a solution for your every need.</p>', '<h2>💰 Sector 45 Gurgaon Packers and Movers Cost &ndash; Know the Complete Truth</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When people plan shifting to active areas like Sector 45 Gurgaon,&nbsp;the first question is &ndash;<strong> &ldquo;How much will it cost?&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>and the second worry &ndash; <strong>&ldquo;Will there be any hidden charges later?&rdquo;&nbsp;</strong>At ShiftingPort Packers and Movers we believe in 100% transparent pricing.&nbsp;We give you a detailed quotation before shifting &ndash; via WhatsApp, email or as a printed copy &ndash;&nbsp;in which every expense is written with an item-wise breakdown.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 What do the charges depend on?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting charges in Sector 45 Gurgaon depend on some main factors:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🧾 Parameter</th>\r\n			<th>🔍 Impact on Charges</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Volume of Goods (1BHK, 2BHK...)</td>\r\n			<td>More goods mean higher manpower and a bigger truck.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📍 Distance (e.g., from Sector 45)</td>\r\n			<td>Greater distance increases fuel and toll charges.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🧱 Floor and Lift Availability</td>\r\n			<td>Lack of lift means more helpers and extra time required.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🧰 Need for Furniture Dismantling</td>\r\n			<td>Sofa, bed, table dismantling/assembly requires skilled labor.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🧴 Packing Quality (normal/premium)</td>\r\n			<td>Fragile items require foam, bubble wrap, or crates, adding to costs.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🗓️ Weekend / Month-End Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>Peak times have higher demand, so rates may be slightly higher.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Estimated Rate List for Sector 45</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>Starting Price (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Typical Range (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK Flat Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK Home Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,500 &ndash; ₹9,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK / Villa Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500 &ndash; ₹13,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>PG / Student Move</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500 &ndash; ₹3,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Office Shifting (Small)</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,000 &ndash; ₹12,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport (Local)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport (Enclosed)</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000 &ndash; ₹7,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Storage Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹500/month/box</td>\r\n			<td>₹500 &ndash; ₹1,200 per item</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Final quote is always confirmed after survey (video or onsite).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 What is included in the Quotation?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing material charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Manpower (loading/unloading)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck with fuel and driver</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Basic furniture dismantling</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST (if applicable)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Optional add-ons like AC, LED, insurance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>❌ Hidden Charges? None with us</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Proper quotation and written estimate before every move</li>\r\n	<li>Final payment only after delivery</li>\r\n	<li>Cost of any service is explained in advance</li>\r\n	<li>No verbal commitment &ndash; everything documented</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Client trust is the biggest currency at ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 Complete process of shifting in Sector 45 Gurgaon &ndash; with smart planning at every step</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in societies of Sector 45 has many local challenges:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>like narrow entry lanes, non-availability of lift, time-bound entry permission and furniture-heavy flats.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has designed a structured process keeping all these things in mind &ndash;&nbsp;which ensures smooth and secure shifting at every step.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Inquiry and Free Survey</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Client contacts us by call, WhatsApp or website form</li>\r\n	<li>We take details of the goods &ndash; how many rooms, which furniture, which floor is the shifting to</li>\r\n	<li>We do same-day free video or physical site survey in Sector 45</li>\r\n	<li>After the survey, a detailed estimate is made</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You get clarity from day one, and our plan is custom according to the goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Written Quotation &amp; Move Confirmation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Client is sent a quotation which includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>packing material, manpower, dismantling, transport, GST etc.</li>\r\n	<li>After approval, moving date, time and slot is fixed</li>\r\n	<li>We also take responsibility of society gate pass and lift permission</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: No hidden cost &mdash; everything is documented and upfront.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Professional Packing &ndash; Both Safe and Speedy</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>For fragile items: foam wrap + bubble sheet + cartoon packing</li>\r\n	<li>Clothes: hanger-based wardrobe box</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture: stretch film + corner padding</li>\r\n	<li>Electronics (TV, fridge, washing machine): moisture-proof and shock-safe packing</li>\r\n	<li>If needed, wooden crate is made onsite</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Luxury items of premium flats in Sector 45 remain 100% safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Loading &ndash; Planning according to Floor, Lift and Truck</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>For no-lift flats, manpower is doubled</li>\r\n	<li>Heavy items (bed, fridge) are loaded first &ndash; light items later</li>\r\n	<li>Staircase corners are covered with cushions</li>\r\n	<li>Labeled sequence is followed to organize the goods in the truck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Organized loading ensures that goods are unloaded quickly and in good condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Transport &ndash; Time-optimized and GPS-tracked</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Truck moves at fixed time &ndash; early morning or evening slots also possible</li>\r\n	<li>GPS live tracking facility is available</li>\r\n	<li>Full tarpaulin cover and inner layering for rain/dust protection</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day delivery guaranteed in short distance moves</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Goods reach on time, without delay and damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Unloading and Final Setup</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Flat is stored room-wise</li>\r\n	<li>Beds, tables, and almirahs are reassembled</li>\r\n	<li>Carton is opened and unpacking help is provided (optional)</li>\r\n	<li>Final client walkthrough and satisfaction is confirmed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: New home is ready-to-use &ndash; you don&rsquo;t have to lift anything</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ After-Move Support</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Unused packing material is collected next day</li>\r\n	<li>Immediate help if furniture setup or re-shift is required</li>\r\n	<li>Feedback and complaint are resolved within 24 hours</li>\r\n	<li>Loyalty discount and referral bonus for repeat clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: We stay connected with you even after the move &ndash; support is available on a single call</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 45 Gurgaon is no longer a fear, but a smart process &ndash; with the team at ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🌟 7 Unbeatable Features of ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers in Sector 45 &ndash; Every Reason is Trustworthy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 45 Gurgaon is an area where shifting is not just about moving stuff &ndash;&nbsp;the people here prioritize professionalism, discipline, and smart planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers have inculcated these values in their work &ndash;&nbsp;so we don&rsquo;t just do shifting, we deliver a smooth and stress-free relocation experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Local Experience of Sector 45 &ndash; We know every society, every rule</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We have a regular presence in societies like Greenwood City, Sapphire Apartments, and Ansal Floors</li>\r\n	<li>We know the gate pass, lift timing, and entry restrictions of every building</li>\r\n	<li>This familiarity enables us to provide zero-delay and hassle-free service</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You don&rsquo;t have any tension on the day of shifting &ndash; everything is already planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Trained Crew and Verified Staff &ndash; so you can hand over your luggage without hesitation</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every staff is background checked</li>\r\n	<li>Uniformed team, safety gloves and courteous behavior ensured</li>\r\n	<li>No alcohol, abuse or careless handling &ndash; our crew is disciplined and responsible</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Your luggage as well as your family gets respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Premium Quality Packing &ndash; Customized safety of every item</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Crockery, electronics, d&eacute;cor &ndash; different packing material for all</li>\r\n	<li>Corner pads and stretch wrap for wooden furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Foam layer + outer cartoon sealing for TVs and computers</li>\r\n	<li>Onsite wooden crating facility if needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: The luggage of luxury homes in Sector 45 is shifted absolutely scratch-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Time Commitment and Discipline &ndash; We arrive on time, finish on time</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The move is scheduled as per pre-approved slots</li>\r\n	<li>No-lift floors or traffic-heavy routes are managed in advance</li>\r\n	<li>The team leaves the site only after the move is finished</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Your planning is not disturbed &ndash; shifting is completed smoothly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Clear Quotation, Zero Hidden Charges &ndash; You know from day one, what the cost will be</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Written quotation is sent on WhatsApp/email</li>\r\n	<li>Material, manpower, truck, taxes &ndash; everything is clearly broken down</li>\r\n	<li>Final payment is made only after delivery &ndash; after satisfaction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No sudden increase in amount &ndash; trust and transparency both go together.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Emergency and Weekend Shifting &ndash; When others don&rsquo;t help, we are there</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Standby team ready for short notice move</li>\r\n	<li>Night or Sunday shifting also possible (society rules permitting)</li>\r\n	<li>Express packing options for senior citizen and bachelor clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You can get shifting done even in tight schedule without any compromise.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ After-Support and Loyalty Programs &ndash; We are with you even after the move</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Unused cartons pickup, furniture adjustment, feedback calls</li>\r\n	<li>Priority slots and discounts for repeat clients</li>\r\n	<li>Cashback up to ₹500&ndash;₹1000 on referral</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: ShiftingPort packers and movers becomes your trusted partner not just once, but every time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ This is the reason why people who have done their shifting through ShiftingPort in Sector 45 Gurgaon once, call us the next time too &ndash; and give us referrals too.</p>', '<h2>❓ Sector 45 Gurgaon Shifting Common FAQs from Clients &ndash; With Trustworthy Answers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Does ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers service all societies in Sector 45?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. We have regular work in Greenwood City, Sapphire Apartments, Ansal Floors and other gated societies.&nbsp;We are familiar with the entry timing, lift use policy and gate pass procedure of every society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Is there a survey of items before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We do free video survey or physical inspection,&nbsp;So that you get exact quotation and there is no confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Can shifting be done for just 1BHK or some furniture items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We have mini-shifting packages in which a small truck and 2 helpers are sent.&nbsp;Perfect option for student shifting, PG relocation or bachelor move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Is there insurance cover in case of damage to the goods?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We provide optional goods transit insurance,&nbsp;which secures your goods from accidental damage, fire or rain.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Can we uninstall/install AC, geyser and LED during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We have a team of certified technicians who safely uninstall all these before shifting and professionally set them up again in the new house.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Does ShiftingPort do same-day shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>We do. For local shifting in Sector 45, we complete same-day move &ndash;&nbsp;Packing starts in the morning, delivery and setup done by evening.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Is service available on weekends or holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We work on Sundays, public holidays and evening time as well &ndash;&nbsp;Just society permission should be confirmed beforehand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Do you take back used cartons and wrapping material later?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We collect unused boxes and wrapping the next day &ndash;&nbsp;so your new home stays neat and clean.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Are shifting charges increased after move?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Never. We work as per written quotation.&nbsp;No hidden charges &ndash; whatever is said is fixed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔟 Can you be available quickly in case of urgent shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We have a standby team for Sector 45.&nbsp;For emergency shifting, we can send truck and crew within 2&ndash;4 hours.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 45 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 45 gurgaon, home shifting in sector 45, office relocation sector 45 gurgaon, best movers and packers in sector 45, ShiftingPort packers gurgaon, \r\naffordable shifting services sector 45, packers and movers near me, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 45, packers movers in gurgaon sector 45,', 'Choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers for premium home, office shifting in Sector 45 Gurgaon – with safe, insured, same-day delivery and no hidden charges.', '2025-07-12 16:19:04', '2025-07-13 09:11:14');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(95, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 34, 1, 1, 1, 36, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 46', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-46', '1999', NULL, 'Relocation in Sector 46 Gurgaon is now hassle free - with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. From home shifting, office relocation, bike transport to secure storage - every facility with fast, safe and professional crew. Same-day delivery and no hidden charges guaranteed!', '<h2>🏡 Sector 46 Gurgaon: Changing lifestyle and increasing need for shifting &ndash; every house has its own story</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 46 Gurgaon is today counted among those areas that strike a perfect balance between practical and peaceful lifestyle.&nbsp;Landmarks like DPS International, Amity Global School, and Baani Square are nearby, which attracts both families and working professionals.&nbsp;The special thing about this sector is its mixed residential character &ndash; everything from low-rise builder floors to society apartments and PG accommodations is available here.&nbsp;Because of this, shifting in Sector 46 has become an ongoing process &ndash; someone is buying a new house, someone is moving after the lease ends, someone is packing up due to job relocation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Residential Diversity of Sector 46 &ndash; A new face of shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 46 is not just a process of moving things,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>but is a part of a lifestyle transition.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Residential Floors: 3BHK flats and builder floors in Ansal Sushant Lok-II extensions</li>\r\n	<li>PG Accommodations: Ideal rentals for Bachelors and job professionals</li>\r\n	<li>Societies near DPS &amp; Amity: Family-centric shifting, which requires school timing coordinated move</li>\r\n	<li>Back-lane Commercial Hubs: Relocation of Coaching centres, creches and co-working offices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📦 The move here needs to be completely customized &ndash; as every family has different needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚧 What are the Local Challenges in Sector 46?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Narrow service roads &ndash; small trucks required</li>\r\n	<li>Day-time society restrictions &ndash; shift only during fixed time window</li>\r\n	<li>Heavy furniture movement &ndash; manual handling in homes without lift</li>\r\n	<li>Month-end rush due to high tenant turnover</li>\r\n	<li>Documentation requirement in PG and commercial move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers handles these local aspects daily &ndash; so the client doesn&rsquo;t have any extra headache.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📈 Why is the demand for Packers and Movers increasing?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sector 46 has a high population of job professionals</li>\r\n	<li>Move-ins are fast due to schools and metros being nearby</li>\r\n	<li>Working couples move from furnished flat to unfurnished</li>\r\n	<li>Startups and solopreneurs are shifting from home to office</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>🔁 This is the reason why the demand for short notice, weekend shifting and quick furniture setup is constantly increasing here.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ ShiftingPort &ndash; Smart, Silent and Safe Relocation Partner for Sector 46</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers don&rsquo;t just send trucks and staff,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We first understand your move &ndash; then make a strategy for it.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Local crew who knows the rules of every street and every society of Sector 46</li>\r\n	<li>Verified, polite and professional team who handles every item like value</li>\r\n	<li>Transparent rate card and no last-minute confusion</li>\r\n	<li>Flexibility of weekend/night slot</li>\r\n	<li>Home, office, PG, bike/car shifting &ndash; tailor-made solution for all</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 We are not &ldquo;just another movers&rdquo; in Sector 46, but a partner who makes shifting simple.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 6 Core Services of ShiftingPort in Sector 46 Gurgaon &ndash; Every Shifting has its own professional approach</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 46 Gurgaon shifting needs are varied &mdash; some are moving urgently due to a job change,&nbsp;some want to move closer to their kids&rsquo; school, some are switching from a furnished to an unfurnished flat.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has designed its services keeping these real-world needs in mind &mdash;&nbsp;a custom solution for every move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting (for all types of homes from 1BHK to 5BHK)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Local home shifting in or around Sector 46 (Sector 47, 52, 39)</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture disassembly + premium packing for fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>Complete unpacking and reinstallation support for families</li>\r\n	<li>Hassle-free setup for senior citizens and working couples</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Flats, villas, and rental homes &ndash; comfort-based move system for all.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation (from Small Startups to Consulting Firms)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Safe packing of work desks, chairs, electronics and documents</li>\r\n	<li>Server and IT setup dismantling + cable management</li>\r\n	<li>Special plan for commercial properties in Baani Square, Sector 47 and Golf Course Road</li>\r\n	<li>Evening or weekend slot shifting facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Work disruption zero &ndash; move smartly, silently and systematically.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛵 3. Bike &amp; Car Transport (Local + Intercity Delivery)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Scooty, sports bike or luxury car &ndash; separate transit plan for all</li>\r\n	<li>Foam wrapping, metal ramp loading and wheel locks</li>\r\n	<li>Enclosed carriers and GPS tracking system</li>\r\n	<li>Vehicle insurance and PUC-safe process</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Perfect vehicle handling from Sector 46 to Delhi, Noida or pan India shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🗃️ 4. Storage &amp; Warehousing (Short-Term and Long-Term Both)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Flat is being renovated or new home is not ready &ndash; luggage storage facility</li>\r\n	<li>24&times;7 monitored warehouse &ndash; fire-safe, clean and dust-free</li>\r\n	<li>Box-wise, per-item and per-room storage plan</li>\r\n	<li>Scheduled delivery option on your call</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 The biggest convenience point for renters and tenants of Sector 46.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪑 5. Furniture Dismantling &amp; Installation (Modular or Traditional)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Dismantle &amp; reinstall of IKEA, Urban Ladder, Pepperfry furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Sofa, bed, almirah, bookshelves &ndash; skilled technician for all</li>\r\n	<li>Work without scratches and nuts-missing</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture placement as per client instruction</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No carpenter needed &ndash; our crew does your complete setup.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎒 6. PG/Student Shifting (Low Budget + Quick Move Package)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Dedicated small move for 4&ndash;6 items, bed, chair, personal luggage</li>\r\n	<li>Hourly charges, mini truck + 1&ndash;2 helper service</li>\r\n	<li>Relocation from Sector 46 PG to sector 47 or near Huda Metro</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day move with basic packing facility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Perfect shifting plan for working bachelors and interns &ndash; fast &amp; affordable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧰 Add-on Features: Make every move complete</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Add-on Service</th>\r\n			<th>What&rsquo;s Included?</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📺 LED Uninstall / Mount</td>\r\n			<td>Drill-safe uninstallation, wall fitting, and re-installation</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>❄️ AC Uninstall / Reinstall</td>\r\n			<td>Certified technician ensures safe copper pipe setup</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>♻️ Material Collection</td>\r\n			<td>Pickup and disposal of used cartons after shifting</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Advance Box Delivery</td>\r\n			<td>Packing boxes delivered to your home one day in advance</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting in Sector 46 Gurgaon is no longer just a service, it is a smart process &mdash; which ShiftingPort does for you hassle-free, hassle-free and damage-free.</p>', '<h2>💰 Packers and Movers Charges in Sector 46 Gurgaon &ndash; Know the transparency of every expense</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever someone plans shifting to Sector 46, the first question is &ndash;&nbsp;&ldquo;What will be the rate?&rdquo; and the second question &ndash;&nbsp;&ldquo;Will there be any hidden charges later?&rdquo;&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers understands this very well &ndash;&nbsp;That is why we provide proper survey and written quotation before every move in which&nbsp;every expense &ndash; manpower, packing, truck, taxes &ndash; is explained in detail.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 On what things do the charges depend?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The cost of shifting in Sector 46 Gurgaon depends on many factors:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>📌 Parameter</th>\r\n			<th>💡 Impact on Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Volume of Goods (1BHK, 2BHK...)</td>\r\n			<td>More goods mean higher material usage and manpower required.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📍 Distance (Local or Outstation?)</td>\r\n			<td>Greater distance increases fuel and toll charges.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🏢 Floor &amp; Lift Facility</td>\r\n			<td>No lift means more labor and increased effort required.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🛋️ Furniture Dismantling / Rejoining</td>\r\n			<td>Modular furniture requires skilled workers for disassembly and reassembly.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🎁 Packing Quality</td>\r\n			<td>Premium packing materials (bubble wrap, foam) slightly increase costs.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📅 Move Timing</td>\r\n			<td>Higher demand during weekends or month-end can increase rates.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 In Sector 46 societies, most of the shifting happens from 2&ndash;3rd floor, due to which both manpower and planning become important.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Estimated Price Chart &ndash; Sector 46 Local Shifting (2025 Rates)</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service</th>\r\n			<th>Starting Price (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Typical Range (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK Home Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,200</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,200 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK Home Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,800</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,800 &ndash; ₹9,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK / Villa Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500 &ndash; ₹14,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>PG / Student Move (5-6 items)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,500 &ndash; ₹3,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Office Move (5&ndash;10 workstations)</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000 &ndash; ₹12,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport (local)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹2,200</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport (within NCR)</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500 &ndash; ₹7,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Storage Charges</td>\r\n			<td>₹500/month/item</td>\r\n			<td>₹500 &ndash; ₹1,000 per box/item</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📝 Note: Final rates are confirmed only after survey &mdash; but there are no hidden charges that may surprise you on the day of move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📑 What is included in ShiftingPort Quotation?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ High-grade packing material (bubble, tape, cartons)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Labor charges &ndash; packing, loading, unloading</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling + installation</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Local permits and gate pass (if needed)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck + fuel + driver</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST (if applicable)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>❌ Hidden Charges? Absolutely not!</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Written quotation before move</li>\r\n	<li>Post-delivery final payment</li>\r\n	<li>No random price hike on move-day</li>\r\n	<li>No verbal-only deals &ndash; written confirmation on everything</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Our biggest brand value in Sector 46 Gurgaon is trust and clear pricing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ This is the reason why ShiftingPort clients say even after the move &ndash;&nbsp;<strong>&ldquo;We did what we said &ndash; and we did what we did on time.&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 Smart Shifting Process in Sector 46 &ndash; Trust in every step, Planning in every step</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>There are many challenges during shifting in Sector 46 Gurgaon &ndash;&nbsp;like busy entry gates, furniture-heavy flats, time-restricted society rules and narrow internal roads.&nbsp;ShiftingPort keeps all these in mind and plans every move in 7 steps,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>so that the client does not face any problem and does not waste time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 1. Pre-Move Inquiry and Free Site Survey</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The client contacts us through call, WhatsApp or web enquiry</li>\r\n	<li>Our team calls back in 10&ndash;30 minutes and takes basic details</li>\r\n	<li>A video call or physical visit is scheduled to understand the volume of the goods</li>\r\n	<li>During the survey, the goods, floor, lift, parking, and timing are checked</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Giving rates without survey is speculation &ndash; survey brings transparency.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 2. Quotation and Move Confirmation</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Detail quotation is sent to the client (WhatsApp / Email)</li>\r\n	<li>Packing material, manpower, dismantling, truck size all are clearly written</li>\r\n	<li>After approval, move date, time and team are fixed</li>\r\n	<li>Gate pass, society NOC, and permission assistance is given</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Written confirmation leaves no confusion &ndash; what is said is delivered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. Packing &ndash; Professional and Customized</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>For fragile items (TV, glassware): foam + bubble wrap + cartoon</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture: Dismantled and stretch wrap and corner guards</li>\r\n	<li>Clothes: Hanger-based packing in wardrobe box</li>\r\n	<li>Kitchen: layer-wise wrapping, jars are inside-filled and secured</li>\r\n	<li>Electronics: unplugged, secure wrapping and labelling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Luxury families of Sector 46 are assured that their belongings will be safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪜 4. Loading &ndash; As per Floor Plan and Truck Layout</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Heavy items first, then medium, then light &ndash; smart loading sequence</li>\r\n	<li>Padding and railing protection in staircase</li>\r\n	<li>If there is no lift, double manpower</li>\r\n	<li>Customized stacking in truck &ndash; so that unloading is easy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Loading is fast and safe, and furniture is unloaded properly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 5. Transport &ndash; Fast, Secure, Time-Bound</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Closed body truck for dust/rain protection</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day delivery in Sector 46 to 47, 51, 56 or any part of NCR</li>\r\n	<li>GPS tracking available (on request)</li>\r\n	<li>Toll-ready vehicle for outstation move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: Client has full confidence in delivery timing &ndash; no delay, no excuse.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 6. Unloading and Re-Setup</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Items are placed room-wise as per client&#39;s instruction</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is re-assembled (bed, table, wardrobe)</li>\r\n	<li>TV, AC, geyser uninstall/reinstall technician available (optional)</li>\r\n	<li>Boxes unpacking and disposal also possible on request</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Client gets the house in ready-to-use condition - no need to lift anything yourself.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔁 7. After-Support - We are with you even after the move</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Next-day pickup of extra boxes, tapes</li>\r\n	<li>Feedback and final inspection call</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture shifting or placement assistance (within 48 hours)</li>\r\n	<li>Discount / referral bonus for repeat clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: ShiftingPort&nbsp;Packers and Movers is with you throughout the entire process, not just on the day of the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 46 Gurgaon is no longer a hassle, but a professionally managed experience - completed by the expert team of ShiftingPort packers and movers without any fear or delay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>⭐ Why Choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 46? 7 Reasons That Set Us Apart</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 46 Gurgaon is not just about moving stuff &mdash;&nbsp;families, working couples and bachelors here want the shifting process to be easy, safe and done in a professional manner. ShiftingPort Packers and Movers brings these qualities to every move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 1. Local Sector Expertise &ndash; Know every street, every society</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have worked in every residential pocket of Sector 46 like Sushant Lok-II, Saraswati Enclave, and societies around DPS.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We know the lift timings, gate entry restrictions, and parking rules in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: No restrictions on the day of move &mdash; everything is planned in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 2. Trained and Verified Crew &ndash; Trustworthy people, courteous behaviour</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff is background checked.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every worker comes in uniform, with gloves and tools.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>No abuse, carelessness or disrespect &ndash; we take care of the client&rsquo;s privacy and dignity along with the goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You feel comfortable even in front of family and children.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 3. Customized Packing &ndash; Perfect protection for every item</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Foam wrapping for TV and fridge</li>\r\n	<li>Honeycomb and bubble for crockery</li>\r\n	<li>Stretch wrap and corner safety for sofa</li>\r\n	<li>Hanger packing of clothes in wardrobe box</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Every item in the luxury flats of Sector 46 is shifted safely, without any scratch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 4. Clear Charges, Zero Confusion &ndash; Pre-decided expenses, no hidden charges</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our quotation is written on WhatsApp or email.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every point &ndash; packing, labour, truck, dismantling &ndash; is broken clearly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Final payment is taken only after delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: There is no demand for &ldquo;extra amount&rdquo; during or after shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 5. Fast Execution &ndash; Reach on time and finish work on time</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We reach 15 minutes before the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Loading sequence is smart, which makes it easy to unpack the luggage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Same-day shift is possible &ndash; especially in local move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Your whole day is not wasted &ndash; you can focus on your work.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 6. Emergency and Flexible Shifting Slots</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Shifting facility even on weekends or public holidays</li>\r\n	<li>Short notice move (team ready in 2-4 hours)</li>\r\n	<li>Night shift (if society permits)</li>\r\n	<li>Extra support to senior citizen or single women clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Move is possible in the time that is right for the client.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 7. After Move Support &ndash; We don&rsquo;t just drop off items, we also drop off connections</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Next-day pickup of unused boxes</li>\r\n	<li>Getting TV or furniture adjusted</li>\r\n	<li>Discount and referral bonus for repeat clients</li>\r\n	<li>Help is available even after feedback</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: ShiftingPort packers and movers remains your trusted partner even after the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ This is why more than 70% of our clients in Sector 46 Gurgaon are either referrals or repeat clients.</p>', '<h2>❓ 10 Common FAQs of Clients in Sector 46 Gurgaon &ndash; Straightforward Answers, No Beats</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Does ShiftingPort Packers and Movers service all areas of Sector 46?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We regularly work in Sushant Lok-II, Saraswati Enclave, societies around DPS School, and back-lane floors &mdash; everywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Is a survey of the goods necessary before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, and it&rsquo;s free. We estimate the goods through video call or physical visit, so that you get an exact quote and smooth shifting plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Is a small shifting possible for PG or bachelors too?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We have Mini-Move Service which sends less goods, mini truck and 1&ndash;2 helpers &mdash; perfect for students, working professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Does ShiftingPort work on weekends and holidays too?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. There is a high demand for weekend moves in Sector 46, so we work with a full crew even on Sundays and holidays &ndash; we just need to take permission from the society first.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Do you do dismantling and reinstallation as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. Beds, wardrobes, geysers, TV, AC &ndash; all kinds of furniture and appliances are dismantled and re-installed by trained technicians.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Do you increase the shifting charges after the move?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Never. Our quotation is written and final payment is made accordingly. There are no hidden charges &ndash; the rate quoted is the same.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Is insurance available in case of breakage or damage to the goods?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We provide optional goods insurance plan &ndash; which covers fire, water damage or accidental breakage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>8️⃣ Is shifting possible within 24 hours if the move is urgent?</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We are also available on short notice &ndash; can send a crew within 2&ndash;4 hours for emergency shifting, if truck slot is vacant.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Is there storage facility for luggage?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</s