>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Office Move (5&ndash;10 seats)</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000 &ndash; ₹11,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport (within NCR)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹2,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport (within NCR)</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000 &ndash; ₹6,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Storage Charges (monthly)</td>\r\n			<td>₹500/item</td>\r\n			<td>₹500 &ndash; ₹1,200 per item/month</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📝 This is just an estimation &ndash; final charges are decided as per the goods and situation of the client.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 What is included in ShiftingPort Quotation?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Packing material (bubble, wrap, cartons, tape)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Loading + Unloading manpower charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling/re-assembly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck charges (fuel, toll, driver)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST (if bill requirement)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Gate pass/NOC assistance for societies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No extra charge is added without your approval.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❌ Hidden Charges? Absolutely not!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s process is completely documented and transparent:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📲 Written quotation on WhatsApp/email</li>\r\n	<li>📸 Finalized estimate after survey</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 No last-minute extra billing</li>\r\n	<li>💳 Final payment only after delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Packers and Movers services in Sector 47 Gurgaon is no longer guesswork,&nbsp;but a professional and predictable process -&nbsp;with the help of ShiftingPort packers and movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 How to do a Safe and Smooth Relocation in Sector 47? Know the 7-Step Process of ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 47 societies (like Uniworld Gardens, South City-II) face many challenges on the day of shifting &mdash;&nbsp;limited entry time, parking issue, lift timings and gate pass approvals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is already prepared for all these.&nbsp;Below is our well-structured process:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧩 Step 1: Inquiry and Free Site Survey</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Client contacts us on call, WhatsApp or website</li>\r\n	<li>After getting basic info, we schedule a FREE video or physical survey</li>\r\n	<li>During the survey, the quantity of goods, floor, parking, and society rules are checked</li>\r\n	<li>The final quotation is prepared from this survey</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No hidden surprise after the survey &mdash; correct estimation, correct planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💰 Step 2: Transparent Quotation and Move Confirmation</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You get detailed quotation (material + labour + truck breakup)</li>\r\n	<li>No hidden charge &ndash; every cost is written on WhatsApp/email</li>\r\n	<li>Once move is confirmed, you get a digital move confirmation</li>\r\n	<li>Assistance is also given for Society gate-pass or NOC</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Clear paperwork, zero confusion &ndash; what is decided will remain.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 3: Professional Packing &ndash; Both Smart and Safe</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Bubble wrap + foam + box for TV, crockery, electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Dismantling, stretch wrap and corner guards for furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Kitchen items are packed layer-by-layer</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe cartons with hangers for clothes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Every item in premium flats of Sector 47 remains safe &ndash; be it glass or gadget.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪜 Step 4: Organised Loading &ndash; With experience and logic</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>The ground team loads heavy items first, fragile items later</li>\r\n	<li>Safety padding is applied in the staircase/lift</li>\r\n	<li>The stacking in the truck is done in such a way that unloading is quick and easy</li>\r\n	<li>A helper is already on stand-by on the entry/exit route</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Time is saved and there is no fear of any item getting damaged.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Step 5: Fast Transport &ndash; Trust in both Local and Intercity</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Same-day delivery in the vicinity of Sector 47 (46, 48, HUDA City Centre) by closed-body truck</li>\r\n	<li>GPS tracking and insurance facility for Intercity</li>\r\n	<li>Our drivers are familiar with every road of Gurgaon</li>\r\n	<li>Vehicle is sanitised and secured before every trip</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Goods reach on time, without delay and without damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 Step 6: Unloading and Setup &ndash; Room-wise Placement</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Items are placed room-wise (as per client&rsquo;s direction)</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is re-assembled &ndash; bed, wardrobe, tables</li>\r\n	<li>Unpacking and disposal of packing material on request</li>\r\n	<li>Technician support for appliances like TV, geyser, AC optional</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You get your new home in a hassle-free ready-to-use condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔁 Step 7: After-Support and Clean Finish</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Next-day empty box and waste material pickup</li>\r\n	<li>Client feedback call and move summary</li>\r\n	<li>Loyalty discount and referral bonus on repeat move</li>\r\n	<li>Emergency help line (active for 48 hours)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: We stay connected with you even after the move.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ This structured and committed approach makes ShiftingPort packers and movers top-rated in Sector 47 &mdash;&nbsp;We have successfully completed 450+ local shiftings using this process till date.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏆 Why choose ShiftingPort in Sector 47? 7 unique things that make us stand out from the crowd</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Every society in Sector 47 Gurgaon is different &mdash; somewhere you have to take out stuff from the basement, somewhere you get lift entry only after 10 AM.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has developed its system by understanding all these challenges on the ground &mdash;&nbsp;That&rsquo;s why today we are counted among the most recommended packers and movers in the sector.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 1. Local Area Expertise &ndash; Knowledge of every society, every street of Sector 47</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have worked repeatedly in societies like South City-II, Malibu Towne, and Unitech Uniworld Gardens.&nbsp;We know where to park the truck, where to make the gate pass first, what is the lift timing &mdash; everything.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: You avoid giving repeated instructions on the day of shifting, because we know everything in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 2. Trained and Verified Crew &ndash; No Risk, Only Trust</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our staff is police verified, and every member is trained in professional behavior.&nbsp;No smoking, no abusive language, no shortcuts &mdash; only discipline and respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: You can move your house comfortably even in front of children and senior citizens.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 3. Premium Packing Quality &ndash; Personalized protection of every item</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Foam + bubble + carton box for TV, AC, laptop</li>\r\n	<li>Honeycomb + double tape for glass crockery</li>\r\n	<li>Moisture-proof wrapping for sofa, mattress</li>\r\n	<li>Dismantle + screw bag tagging for modular furniture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: The luxury furniture and electronics of modern flats of Sector 47 remain completely safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 4. Smart Quotation &ndash; No Hidden Charges, No Last-Minute Shocks</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We send full break-up on WhatsApp or email &ndash; which includes truck, labour, material, dismantle charge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: There is no &ldquo;bhaiya thoda extra dedo&rdquo; moment after shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 5. Same-Day &amp; Short Notice Move &ndash; Weekend, Night, Emergency all possible</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Most of the families in Sector 47 are working &ndash; so we can manage evening shifts, weekend relocation and emergency move (on 2 hours notice) as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You do not have to take a holiday or office leave &ndash; we move as per your convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 6. Storage &amp; Transit Insurance &ndash; Extra Security, Extra Confidence</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If your new house is not ready, we also provide temporary storage facility.&nbsp;Along with this, transit insurance facility is also available for valuables.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No matter where the luggage is, you remain tension-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 7. Post-Move Support &ndash; With you even after the shift</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Unused boxes pickup</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture adjustment help</li>\r\n	<li>Discount for repeat clients</li>\r\n	<li>Feedback-based service improvement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Once the job is done, we don&#39;t disconnect &mdash; you become part of the ShiftingPort family.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ ShiftingPort in Sector 47 Gurgaon is not just a shifting company,&nbsp;but a trusted moving partner &mdash; with whom your every relocation becomes easy, safe and professional.</p>', '<h2>❓ 10 common questions of Sector 47 Gurgaon clients &ndash; very straight forward and honest answers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Does ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provide service to all societies in Sector 47?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Of course we do. We have done regular shifting in Unitech Uniworld Gardens, Malibu Towne, South City-II and most of the nearby societies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Do I need to bring separate box or tape for packing the stuff?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>No, you don&rsquo;t need to bring anything. We bring bubble wrap, carton boxes, foam sheet, and packing tape &ndash; all of that high-quality.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Is shifting service available for 1BHK or less stuff too?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We have mini-move facility in which a small truck and 2 helpers are sent for less stuff (like PG or bachelor shifting).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Does ShiftingPort also do last-minute shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. In case of emergency, we can send a crew within 2&ndash;4 hours &mdash; but depends on truck availability. Best to book 1 day in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Is there any hidden charge for packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely not. The quotation given to you on WhatsApp or email includes all charges &mdash; packing, labour, truck etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Is there any insurance cover in case of damage during shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We provide optional transit insurance &ndash; which covers accidental damage or breakage (as per terms).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Does society ShiftingPort take responsibility for NOC or gate-pass?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Partially. NOC has to be applied by the client, but we help in filling the form, giving truck details and preparing crew ID.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Is unpacking and setup also included?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>On request. If the client wishes, we can do unloading followed by unpacking and furniture setup &ndash; especially for families and elderly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Can bike and car be shifted together?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We provide combined vehicle transport &ndash; car carrier and bike crate both are arranged, along with GPS tracking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔟 Will you take back the empty boxes and wrapping material after the move?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We pick up the used cartons and plastic wraps on the next day visit &ndash; ensuring cleanliness in your new home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 47 Gurgaon is no longer a tension &ndash; with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers, it has become a streamlined process.</p>', 'Packers and Movers Sector 47 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 47 gurgaon, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 47, packers movers gurgaon sector 47, packers and movers near me, home shifting in sector 47, office relocation services gurgaon, bike transport in sector 47 gurgaon, car packers and movers gurgaon,\r\nShiftingPort packers gurgaon, local movers near unitech uniworld, storage services sector 47, best packers sector 47, trusted movers and packers gurgaon', 'Need reliable shifting in Sector 47 Gurgaon? Get home, office, vehicle shifting – safe, fast and without hidden charges from ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.', '2025-07-13 11:30:53', '2025-07-13 11:30:53');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(97, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 36, 1, 1, 1, 38, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 48', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-48', '1999', NULL, 'Relocation in Sector 48 Gurgaon is now easy - Get complete services of 1BHK to 5BHK, office, bike/car and storage with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. Make your shifting tension-free with verified crew, fast execution and 100% transparency.', '<h2>🏙️ Sector 48 Gurgaon &ndash; A rapidly growing area, a rapid need for shifting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 48 Gurgaon is an area where shifting has become a routine.&nbsp;Located right near Sohna Road, this sector is full of high-rise apartments, premium societies and commercial spaces &ndash;&nbsp;like Tulip Orange, Vipul Greens, Bestech Park View City, and Spaze Boulevard.&nbsp;People are shifting to new houses on a daily basis, offices are expanding and bachelors/tenants also move frequently.&nbsp;In such a situation, the demand for reliable and professional packers and movers is increasing day by day &ndash;<br />\r\nand ShiftingPort Packers and Movers fulfills this need.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Features of Sector 48 that encourage frequent shifting:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Direct connectivity to Sohna Road and Golf Course Extension Road</li>\r\n	<li>Major office hubs like DLF Corporate Greens and Spaze i-Tech Park</li>\r\n	<li>Daily move-in/move-out from nearby sectors like 49, 50, 47</li>\r\n	<li>Plenty of PGs and furnished rentals &ndash; large population of bachelors</li>\r\n	<li>Premium flats and independent builder floors for families</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📦 This mix of population and fast-paced lifestyle make Sector 48 a shifting hotspot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Who shifts to Sector 48?</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Client Type</th>\r\n			<th>Reason for Shifting</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🏘️ Families</td>\r\n			<td>Bigger home, rental shift, kids&rsquo; school change</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🧳 Working Singles</td>\r\n			<td>Job switch, PG change, flatmate move-out</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🏢 Corporate Offices</td>\r\n			<td>New branch, upgraded space, flexible lease terms</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🛋️ Retail Stores</td>\r\n			<td>Mall/shop switch, renovation shifting</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🌐 Startups / Freelancers</td>\r\n			<td>Moving from co-working to own space or vice versa</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Every move has different needs &mdash; and ShiftingPort customizes the service accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Why is the demand for reliable movers highest in Sector 48?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Society lifts and gate-entry slots are fixed</li>\r\n	<li>Commercial spaces need to be shifted on weekends or late-night</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture-heavy flats require dismantling and re-setup</li>\r\n	<li>There is pressure to move on short notice (job change, rent expiry)</li>\r\n	<li>Managing NOC, RWA permission and load timings along with packers and movers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 ShiftingPort handles all these elements in advance &ndash; so the client just has to relax.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 Our Shifting Services in Sector 48 &ndash; A Perfect Plan for Every Move</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 48 Gurgaon is not a general job but a detailed operation.&nbsp;Societies have fixed entry timings, offices have to be shifted on weekends, and students moving out of PGs have budget tensions.&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has designed its services keeping these local challenges in mind.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. House Shifting &ndash; Easy for both families and tenants</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Various materials for packing 1BHK to 5BHK items</li>\r\n	<li>Bubble wrap + box padding for electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Modular furniture dismantle and re-install</li>\r\n	<li>Lift restrictions and gate-pass timings taken care of</li>\r\n	<li>Society-specific shifting slots (e.g. 10 AM&ndash;5 PM in Tulip Purple)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 You don&rsquo;t need to stand at the gate and give instructions &ndash; our team knows every process in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Shifting &ndash; Smart Relocation for Corporate Hubs and Startups</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Anti-static wrapping of servers, printers, desktops</li>\r\n	<li>Labelled packing of cables, routers and office chairs</li>\r\n	<li>After-hours shifting in commercial buildings like Spaze i-Tech Park</li>\r\n	<li>Workstation re-setup facility after unloading</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Office shifting should not have downtime &ndash; and ShiftingPort keeps it on priority.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛵 3. Bike and car transportation &ndash; cheap and safe</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Scooty, sport bike or cruiser &ndash; crate-based packing for every type</li>\r\n	<li>Car carriers (open/enclosed) with GPS tracking</li>\r\n	<li>From Sector 48 to Delhi, Noida, Jaipur or Panipat &ndash; shift possible anywhere</li>\r\n	<li>RTO paperwork and insurance assistance (on demand)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 When your vehicle is dearer to you than your life, then transport should also be equally secure.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage facility &ndash; When the house is vacant but you need to store the goods</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Short-term (7 days) and monthly rental warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>Dust-free, CCTV secured, access-controlled storage</li>\r\n	<li>Item-wise inventory and scheduled delivery option</li>\r\n	<li>Best option for Sector 48 tenants and NRI clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Not ready for home, undergoing renovation, or temporarily moving out? We will handle the goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪑 5. Furniture Handling &ndash; Professional work from uninstall to reinstall</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>IKEA, Hometown, Urban Ladder furniture dismantling</li>\r\n	<li>Safe storage of labeled screws and hardware</li>\r\n	<li>Reinstallation with layout as per client&rsquo;s direction</li>\r\n	<li>Corner-protected loading of sofa, bed, dining set</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Managing bulky furniture in premium flats of Sector 48 requires a different experience &ndash; and we have that.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎒 6. Mini Shifting &ndash; Budget Move for PG, Students and Job Switchers</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Mini truck for small luggage (5&ndash;8 items)</li>\r\n	<li>2 helpers + basic packing included</li>\r\n	<li>Zero delay on lift, stairs and access points</li>\r\n	<li>Daily PG shifting available in South City-II, Sector 49&ndash;50</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Completely safe shifting without much expense &ndash; especially for bachelors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ Extra Facilities that Sector 48 clients often ask for:</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Service Type</th>\r\n			<th>Benefit</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📺 LED Uninstall / Install</td>\r\n			<td>Safely removing the TV from the wall and mounting it in the new home</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>❄️ AC Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>Proper uninstall and re-fitting by certified technicians</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Carton Box Delivery</td>\r\n			<td>Free supply of packing boxes one day before the move</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>♻️ Box Pickup</td>\r\n			<td>Collection of used packing material after the move</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 48 Gurgaon is now tension-free &mdash; with smart plans and professional crew of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.</p>', '<h2>💰 Sec8 Packers and Movetor 4rs Cost &ndash; Honest calculation of every move</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 48 Gurgaon is a premium and multi-purpose area.&nbsp;From 1BHK tenants to 5BHK villa owners, startups to MNC offices, everyone lives here &ndash; and everyone&rsquo;s shifting needs are different.&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has created a customizable and transparent charges structure keeping in mind the local needs and society rules of sector 48.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 What do Shifting Charges depend on? 📌 Factor 💡 How it affects the price</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>📌 Factor</th>\r\n			<th>💡 How It Impacts Cost</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📦 Volume of Goods</td>\r\n			<td>More goods mean higher packing material use and more manpower required.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🏢 Floor and Lift Availability</td>\r\n			<td>Absence of a lift increases labor costs significantly.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🛣️ Distance (Local / Outstation)</td>\r\n			<td>Longer routes raise fuel, toll, and truck rental costs.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>🔧 Furniture Dismantle</td>\r\n			<td>Modular furniture requires skilled technicians for dismantling and reassembly.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>📆 Move Time &amp; Date</td>\r\n			<td>Rates may increase during weekends, month-end, or urgent bookings due to high demand.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Updated Rate List of Local Shifting Charges &ndash; 2025 in Sector 48 Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>🏠 Shifting Type</th>\r\n			<th>Basic Price (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Typical Range (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK Flat Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000 &ndash; ₹6,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK Flat Shifting</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,800</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,800 &ndash; ₹9,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK Flat / Villa</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹7,500 &ndash; ₹13,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>PG / Single Room Shift</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹2,800</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Office (up to 10 seats)</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000 &ndash; ₹12,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Transport (within NCR)</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,000 &ndash; ₹2,200</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Car Transport (open carrier)</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,000 &ndash; ₹6,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Storage (monthly)</td>\r\n			<td>₹500/item</td>\r\n			<td>₹500 &ndash; ₹1,200 per item/month</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>📝 Note: Final quote is shared after physical/video survey.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🔍 What is included in our quote?</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Premium packing material (bubble, foam, wrap, cartons)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Loading + unloading charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Transportation (truck + driver + toll)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantle and re-installation</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Basic insurance (optional add-on)</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GST and paperwork assistance (if required)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 No extra charge is added without client&#39;s approval.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❌ 100% protection from hidden charges - How does our Quote System work?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📲 Basic information is taken from the client on call or WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>🎥 Goods and situation are assessed through video or site survey</li>\r\n	<li>📋 Transparent quote is sent, in which every expense is clearly written</li>\r\n	<li>📦 The same amount is charged on the shifting day - not a single ₹ more, not less</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 How to increase trust? 3 Real-World Examples of Clients:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Tulip Orange to Tulip Purple &ndash; 2BHK shifting for ₹4,500 (weekday, lift access)</li>\r\n	<li>Bestech Park View to Nirvana Country &ndash; 3BHK shifting for ₹6,800 (with re-setup)</li>\r\n	<li>Single boy PG shift &ndash; ₹1,600 only (3 boxes + mattress)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 48 means no more confusion or guesswork &mdash;&nbsp;With ShiftingPort Packers and Movers, every expense is pre-planned and documented.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🔄 ShiftingPort&#39;s 7-Step Process &ndash; Make Every Move in Sector 48 Organized and Hassle-Free</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If anyone can manage moving amidst high-rise societies, traffic-sensitive roads and time-bound entries of Sector 48 Gurgaon, then it is ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.&nbsp;Our process is designed to give a fast, clean and fully documented shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧩 Step 1: Call or send information on WhatsApp</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>First of all you contact us through call, WhatsApp or website enquiry</li>\r\n	<li>We take basic details: how much is the goods, from where to where to shift, is there any special requirement</li>\r\n	<li>After this we schedule a FREE site survey &ndash; through physical or video call</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: There is no wrong calculation &ndash; correct survey, correct quote.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📋 Step 2: Transparent Quotation and Move Confirmation</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>After the survey, you get a detailed quotation</li>\r\n	<li>It clearly mentions material, labour, truck, dismantle charge</li>\r\n	<li>Quotation is confirmed on both WhatsApp and email</li>\r\n	<li>We also provide support for things like gate pass, ID copy for move</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: You know what is happening in the shifting and how much it will cost.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 3: Professional Packing &ndash; Quality without compromise</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Packing material is used according to the type of each item</li>\r\n	<li>TV and glass items are packed in bubble + foam + carton</li>\r\n	<li>Kitchen items are sorted category-wise</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is dismantled and padding is done</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Any item remains safe during shifting to luxury flats in Sector 48 &ndash; whether it is imported sofa or LED panel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Step 4: Loading &amp; Safe Transportation &ndash; Logic + Care</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Lift access and parking points are assessed in advance</li>\r\n	<li>Heavy items are placed at the base and fragile items on top</li>\r\n	<li>Anti-scratch lining and moisture-free environment is maintained in the truck</li>\r\n	<li>Both GPS and driver contact are given to the client in the truck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Loading is done in a scientific way, which reduces the possibility of damage to zero.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 Step 5: Unloading and setup of goods in the house</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Goods are placed room-wise in the new house</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture and appliances are installed as per the client</li>\r\n	<li>Unpacking and setup is also done on request</li>\r\n	<li>Boxes and wraps are taken back the next-day</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: The setup of your new house becomes tension-free &ndash; absolutely ready-to-live.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Step 6: Payment and Documentation</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Payment is taken after the move is complete</li>\r\n	<li>You get the final invoice on both WhatsApp and mail</li>\r\n	<li>If GST invoice, insurance paper or company bill is required, it is sent on the same day</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: The entire process is documented and digitally trackable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>♻️ Step 7: Post-Move Support &ndash; Even after the move</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Free pickup of used boxes and waste material</li>\r\n	<li>Feedback and review link is sent</li>\r\n	<li>Loyalty clients get discount on next move</li>\r\n	<li>Complaint/claim process is fast and friendly</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Moving with ShiftingPort means starting a long trusted relationship.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting to Sector 48 Gurgaon is no longer just a matter of truck and labour &mdash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers makes it a planned, peaceful and professional experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🌟 Why choose ShiftingPort in Sector 48? 7 solid reasons</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 48 is not just a matter of moving stuff &ndash; it is a detailed and planning-based operation.&nbsp;Each society has its own challenges like RWA guidelines, lift access timing, truck entry limit, and narrow parking lanes.&nbsp;ShiftingPort understands all of these in advance, so our work runs smoothly &ndash; no interruptions, no tension.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 1. Local Area Knowledge &ndash; Information about every society, every lane</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done shifting in societies like Tulip Ivory, Vipul Lavanya, Spaze Privy, Bestech Park View Spa Next many times.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We know where to park the truck, when the gate pass is made and what is the lift entry time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Advantage: No need to explain anything to the client on the day of shifting &ndash; our team is already prepared.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 2. Trained and Verified Staff &ndash; Safe people, safe goods</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every worker in our team is police verified.<br />\r\nWe have taught every staff packing training, respectful behavior and time management.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Every member of your household &mdash; children, elderly, women &mdash; feel comfort and safety.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 3. Premium Packing Quality &ndash; Customized safety for every item</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Electronics = Foam wrap + hard carton</li>\r\n	<li>Glass Crockery = Honeycomb wrap + dual tape</li>\r\n	<li>Sofa/Mattress = Moisture-proof roll + edge guard</li>\r\n	<li>TV/Fridge = Wooden crate (on request)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: Sector 48 branded furniture and expensive electronics remain completely safe.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 4. No Hidden Charges &ndash; Fixed in advance, does not change later</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We clearly mention truck, packing, labour, dismantling in the quotation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Same-day no extra charge is added &ndash; everything is discussed beforehand.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No confusion about budget, no surprises after shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 5. Weekend &amp; Emergency Shifting &ndash; Your time, our planning</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many families and working couples in Sector 48 can move on weekends only.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We also work on Saturday-Sunday and evening shifts &ndash; and can arrange emergency shifting in 4 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: No office leave, no delay &ndash; you decide your shifting schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>✅ 6. Bike/Car Transport + Storage Facility &ndash; Extra needs also covered</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Crate packing for Scooty to Royal Enfield</li>\r\n	<li>Car carrier service with transit insurance</li>\r\n	<li>Short-term warehouse facility (7 days to 6 months)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: If the new house is not ready or the car has to be sent to a different place &ndash; we handle everything.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 7. Post-Move Support &ndash; Work doesn&rsquo;t end, relationship begins</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Free pickup of carton and waste material</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture adjustment help after move</li>\r\n	<li>24x7 query support on WhatsApp</li>\r\n	<li>Loyalty discount to repeat customers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Benefit: ShiftingPort is with you not only during the move, but also after it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ If you want to make shifting in Sector 48 Gurgaon stress-free, predictable and professional &ndash; then ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is the most sensible and reliable option.</p>', '<h2>❓ 10 Common Questions of Clients in Sector 48 &ndash; Honest and Clear Answers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Does ShiftingPort do shifting in all the societies of Sector 48?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Of course they do. We have done regular shifting in many societies like Tulip Orange, Bestech Park View Spa Next, Vipul Lavanya, and Spaze Privy. Our team is fully aware of the entry rule and gate pass process of every society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Do I need to get anything separately for packing my belongings?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> No. The ShiftingPort team brings high-quality packing material &ndash; like bubble wrap, foam sheets, carton boxes, tape, etc. The client does not need to bring anything.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Do you get the service for shifting 1BHK or smaller belongings?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, definitely. We have mini move service, which is best for bachelors, PG residents and those with less belongings &ndash; less truck size, less cost, fast execution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Is urgent shifting possible same day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. Same-day shifting is possible in Sector 48 &ndash; but depends on the availability of truck and crew. On emergency request, service is available within 2&ndash;4 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Are your rates final or do you add anything extra later?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Our rates are final. The quote given after the survey includes everything &ndash; packing, labour, truck, dismantling. There are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Are fragile items like crockery, LED or glass safe?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> 100% safe. We specially mark fragile items and provide separate wrapping and cushioning. Wooden crate is also used on client&rsquo;s demand.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Do you also do unpacking and furniture setup?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> We do. If the client wishes, unloading is followed by unpacking and furniture setup &ndash; especially useful for families and elderly clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Does ShiftingPort help in dealing with society&rsquo;s NOC or RWA?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. The client has to apply for NOC, but our team keeps complete documentation of truck details, crew ID and time slots ready &ndash; so that there is no problem in entry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>9️⃣ Do you also provide vehicle transport (bike/car)?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Absolutely. We do bike/car shifting from Sector 48 to Delhi NCR and pan-India &ndash; bikes are sent in crates and car carriers, GPS tracking is also provided.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔟 Do you take back used boxes and plastic material after shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes. We do free pickup the next day or 2 days after shifting &ndash; so that your new home remains clean and organized.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Shifting in Sector 48 Gurgaon is no longer a complex task &ndash; when you have the local knowledge, experienced crew and verified process of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers with you.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 48 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 48 gurgaon, \r\npackers and movers near me, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 48, packers and movers gurgaon sector 48,\r\nhome shifting services sector 48, office movers gurgaon, bike transport sector 48, \r\ncar relocation service gurgaon, ShiftingPort packers gurgaon, local movers near tulip orange, top movers and packers sector 48, \r\ntrusted movers gurgaon, storage service sector 48', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Home, office, bike and car relocation service in Sector 48 Gurgaon – safe, fast and without hidden charges.', '2025-07-13 12:20:01', '2025-07-13 12:20:01'),
(98, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 36, 1, 1, 1, 39, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 49', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-49', '1999', NULL, 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon makes your shifting completely safe, affordable and hassle-free. Be it home or office, our local expert team provides fast and damage-free moving experience.', '<h2>🏆 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers &ndash; No.1 Shifting Service in Sector 49 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 49 Gurgaon &mdash; a premium residential hub where new people come every day, some shift to flat, some change office setup. In this hustle-bustle, the role of packers and movers is no longer just that of a trucker &mdash; today people want smart shifting solutions that are fast, damage-free and reliable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this need is fulfilled by ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon &mdash; a name that is no longer just a moving company, but has become a local trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Why is ShiftingPort leading in Sector 49?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 49 is not easy &mdash; whether you are moving from a 3BHK flat in Eros Rosewood City, or from the 9th floor of Tulip Orange &mdash; every item needs separate packing, proper handling and time-bound delivery. This is what we do &mdash; that too with perfection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>✔️ Top Features that set us apart:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Local Area Expertise:</strong> We know the narrow lanes of South City 2 and parking restrictions of Orchid Island &ndash; this knowledge is the base for smooth shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>High-Quality Material Use:</strong> From bubble wrap to laminated cartons, every item gets category-wise protection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Trained Team:</strong> Our manpower is not only trained, but also courteous and uniformed &ndash; so that your shifting experience is seamless.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Same Day Move (on request):</strong> Our express moving option is also available for short distance local shifting within Sector 49.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 Real Experience of Sector 49 Societies and ShiftingPort</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done over 150+ successful relocations in the last few months in these prime locations of Sector 49:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹<strong>Tulip Orange Apartments:</strong> where families needed lift-based careful shifting</li>\r\n	<li>🔹<strong>BPTP Freedom Park Life:</strong> where we specialize in dismantling and reassembling bulky furniture</li>\r\n	<li>🔹<strong>Eros Rosewood City:</strong> a high-density society where coordinated move management is a must</li>\r\n	<li>🔹<strong>Orchid Island:</strong> whose glass-heavy interiors were moved safely, with zero scratches</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>At each location, our team not only shifted the goods, but also reduced the stress of the people &ndash; that is the ShiftingPort experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💬 &quot;Shifting karo? Tension kyu?&quot; &mdash; ShiftingPort isn&#39;t it!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just packers and movers, it is your Sector 49 shifting journey partner - who handles every sofa, every fridge and every fragile item like you. Talk to the most modern yet local moving team in Gurgaon today.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>📞 Call Now for Free Site Visit &amp; Quotation - without any hidden charge.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 Our Services &ndash; One-Stop Packers and Movers for every need in Sector 49 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In the fast-paced world of Sector 49, shifting is no longer a routine task, it has become an experience &ndash; and to make that experience smooth, safe and stress-free, ShiftingPort brings a range of professional packers and movers services, customized to each customer&rsquo;s needs.&nbsp;Whether you are shifting a 1BHK or relocating an entire villa, we have a local and practical solution for every kind of service.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 1. Home Shifting Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 49 residential societies like Tulip Orange, Eros Rosewood City and South City 2, families are moving every two-three years these days &ndash; and each time they need a partner who can handle every furniture, appliance and delicate item with understanding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s home shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Furniture dismantling &amp; reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Soft packing (bubble wrap + foam) for fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Anti-static safe packing for electronics</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Lift-based heavy item movement</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Floor-wise unloading assistance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office &amp; Corporate Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>From small startups to consulting firms, many offices in Sector 49 relocate &mdash; and their needs vary. It&#39;s not easy to move server units, file racks, conference tables and sensitive electronics in a damage-free manner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s office relocation service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🖥️ Barcode tagging and inventory tracking of office assets</li>\r\n	<li>🔌 Safe disconnection of computer systems and wiring</li>\r\n	<li>📁 Secure handling of document boxes</li>\r\n	<li>⏱️ Weekend or non-working hour shifting option (so business doesn&#39;t stop)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛋️ 3. Packing &amp; Unpacking service - Every item gets its identity</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The most critical stage in packers and movers is proper packing. High-value homes in Sector 49 have crockery sets, designer furniture and smart home devices which can get damaged by general packing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We use:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Double-layered carton boxes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Laminated wrapping sheets</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Thermocol cushioning</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Special wardrobe boxes (for hanging clothes)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Custom crates for glass and TV units</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Unpacking is done as carefully as your mother decorates the house.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🚚 4. Local Shifting &ndash; Within Sector 49</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times people move from Society A to Society B &ndash; within a few kilometres &ndash; but the risk remains the same. Our Local Shifting Plan is specially designed for areas like Sector 49, where traffic is tight and parking is limited.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Full move in 3-4 hours</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Small trucks (Chhota Hathi / TATA Ace) that can reach even the narrow lanes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Fast manpower to complete the move without damage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌐 5. Intercity Moving &ndash; Outside Sector 49 across India</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are moving outside Sector 49 &ndash; be it to Jaipur, Dehradun or Mumbai &ndash; then ShiftingPort&rsquo;s intercity service is best for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our intercity shifting includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Dedicated truck (just your luggage)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GPS-enabled live tracking</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Insurance cover on demand</li>\r\n	<li>🔹24x7 Customer Support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 Why ShiftingPort? Because we understand &quot;Moving&quot;, not just &quot;Shifting&quot;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Every family has its own story, and every shifting is a new beginning. We take it seriously &mdash; that&#39;s why every service package is personalized, transparent and 100% based on local understanding.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are looking for any kind of packers and movers service in Sector 49 Gurgaon &mdash; ShiftingPort is your most trusted partner.</p>', '<h2>⚙️ Our Process &ndash; Safe and Systematic Packers and Movers Process in Sector 49</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When you hire a packers and movers company, you don&rsquo;t just hire a truck or labourers &ndash; you entrust them with the trust of your home. ShiftingPort manages this trust with a step-by-step plan to ensure that your shifting in Sector 49 Gurgaon is smooth, safe and precise.&nbsp;Our process is divided into 6 steps &ndash; in which we give you complete clarity and comfort at every step.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📝 Step 1: Free Site Survey &amp; Personalized Quotation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>First of all, we understand your needs. Sector 49 societies have different house structures &ndash; some have a flat on the 3rd floor without a lift, while some live in a villa. So we:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Do a free site visit</li>\r\n	<li>Analyse the quantity and nature of items</li>\r\n	<li>Note down distances, loading times and special requirements</li>\r\n	<li>Then give you a written, no-hidden-cost quotation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>🎯 Local tip: We know the rules and entry timings of societies like Tulip White, Southend Floors and Orchid Island in advance &mdash; this makes shifting a breeze.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 2: Packing &ndash; Packing each item as per its requirement</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Packing is our core strength. We know that every item has its own value &ndash; be it your mother&rsquo;s crockery or your child&rsquo;s study table.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We use:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>5-layer corrugated boxes for electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Bubble wrap + foam cushions for glass &amp; d&eacute;cor items</li>\r\n	<li>Plastic crates for kitchen sets</li>\r\n	<li>Vacuum packing for mattresses and sofas (optional)</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe boxes for hanging clothes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Each carton is also labelled &ndash; to avoid confusion during unloading.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏋️ Step 3: Loading &ndash; with Skill and Safety</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 49 has narrow passages and basement parking at many places. In such a situation, general loaders often cause damage. ShiftingPort&rsquo;s trained team takes maximum care at this stage:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Moving sofas and almirahs with edge-protectors</li>\r\n	<li>Use of sliders and belts for heavy furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Movement after proper measurement of stair-case or lift</li>\r\n	<li>Loading priority items last (so that they are unloaded first)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Step 4: Transportation &ndash; Fast, Safe, GPS-Enabled</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has GPS-enabled trucks of different sizes &ndash; from Chhota Hathi to 22ft containers. We plan the route keeping in mind the streets and traffic of Sector 49:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Daylight transport (safer)</li>\r\n	<li>Fast moves from Sector 49 to Sector 57, Sohna Road, or Cyber City</li>\r\n	<li>Dedicated vehicle option for Intercity</li>\r\n	<li>Real-time location tracking on your mobile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📥 Step 5: Unloading &amp; Setup Assistance</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>At the new location, our team places the items at the right place as per your direction &ndash; be it bed assembly or fridge wiring.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Floor-wise unloading</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture reassembly (on request)</li>\r\n	<li>Collection of debris/packing waste</li>\r\n	<li>Unpacking and inspecting fragile items</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Our goal is to make your new house feel like &ldquo;home&rdquo; from day one.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>☎️ Step 6: Post-Move Support &ndash; Move is over, not with you</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort does not leave just after completing the move. We stay connected with you for the next 48 hours &mdash; in case you find something missing, have minor damage, or need help with unpacking.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>24x7 helpline</li>\r\n	<li>Damage insurance claim assistance (if taken)</li>\r\n	<li>Feedback system for quality improvement</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 Most trusted Packers and Movers process in Sector 49 &mdash; only with ShiftingPort</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our 6-stage process is not just a service, it&rsquo;s a shifting journey &mdash; that handles your time, energy and emotions with utmost respect.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While every second moves fast in Sector 49, ShiftingPort gives you smart shifting at Gurgaon speed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🗺️ Sector 49 Gurgaon Local Knowledge &ndash; This is the Real Edge of ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting is not just a game of trucks and labourers, the real difference comes when the mover has complete knowledge of your area. Shifting in premium and traffic-sensitive areas like Sector 49 Gurgaon becomes smooth when the mover is aware of the local routes, society rules and problems in the surrounding area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this is what makes the difference &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. We are not packers and movers of Gurgaon, but specialist movers of Sector 49.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏙️ Sector 49 &ndash; A dynamic area, where shifting requires special planning</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 49 is not just a sector, but a blend of multiple worlds &ndash;&nbsp;Where high-rise apartments, builder floors and gated villas coexist together.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some of the major societies where we have shifted repeatedly are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Tulip Orange</strong> &ndash; where lift timing permission has to be taken in advance for high-rise flats</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Eros Rosewood City</strong> &ndash; guarded entry and special rules for truck parking</li>\r\n	<li><strong>South City 2 (Ext.)</strong> &ndash; narrow internal roads and planning for staircase shifting</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Orchid Island </strong>&ndash; basement movement is required in many villas</li>\r\n	<li><strong>BPTP Freedom Park Life</strong> &ndash; specific loading zones and limited moving hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We already know the RWA rules, gate passes, security clearance, parking permits of these societies. So when the shifting port comes, there is no question at the gate, the goods are directly lifted.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚦 Understanding of local routes in and around Sector 49</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 49 has a prime location &ndash; it has Sohna Road on one side, Sector 50 &amp; 47 on the other, and Good Earth City Centre nearby. In such a case:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Which route is fastest during peak hours</li>\r\n	<li>At what time is the traffic blocked</li>\r\n	<li>Where can emergency parking be found</li>\r\n	<li>And what restrictions can be imposed while unloading the goods</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team knows all this information in advance, so there is no delay in your shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📍 We know that the shortcut from behind Orchid Island is the fastest to Tulip White &ndash; and this knowledge makes every shifting smart.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏗️ New developments in Sector 49 and their impact on shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 49 is growing every year &ndash; new builder projects, high-rise towers, and construction zones keep changing constantly. ShiftingPort gives its team a local field briefing every 2 weeks to stay updated on every new blockage, road widening or society entry rule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>❗While many movers refuse to take the truck inside Tulip Purple, we ensure smooth entry by taking RWA permission in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🙌 Local Connect + Professional Execution = ShiftingPort&#39;s Sector 49 Formula</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>💯 We know the security guards, supervisors and gate managers of each society</li>\r\n	<li>💬 There is a dedicated local move manager to assist you, who has done 50+ shifts in Sector 49</li>\r\n	<li>🧠 Area-specific checklist is made before every move - like lift availability, basement clearance, truck entry time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>👑 Why is ShiftingPort the Best Packers and Movers in Sector 49?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Because we don&#39;t just limit ourselves to GPS-tracking and cartons &mdash;&nbsp;we give you a shifting experience that is designed keeping in mind every reality of Sector 49.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many movers in Gurgaon may be general experts of the entire city &mdash;&nbsp;but ShiftingPort is the only best packers and movers in Sector 49.</p>', '<h2>❓ Important questions related to Packers and Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon &ndash; Answers from ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Local residents of Sector 49 ask us some common (and genuine) questions every day. Below we are providing very clear, real and friendly answers to those questions &ndash; so that you can prepare for shifting peacefully without any confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q1. How many days in advance should I book for shifting in Sector 49?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Ideally, book 2-4 days in advance so that we can make a plan after a free site visit. But in case of emergency, same-day shifting is also possible, if time slot is available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q2. Does ShiftingPort do only home shifting or office shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: We do both &ndash; home and office shifting. Many startups and professionals of Sector 49 have hired us for office setup shifting as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q3. Is there a risk of damage to the belongings?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: No, we pack every item category-wise &ndash; like thermocol frame for TV, foam wrap for glass, and hanger-boxes for wardrobe. In 99% of cases there is no breakage. However, if you want, we also provide shifting insurance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q4. Do you also help with unpacking and furniture setup?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Absolutely! Be it sofa reassembling or bed setup, our team helps with both unpacking and setup &ndash; especially for elderly or busy families.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q5. Who takes gate pass or entry permission in Sector 49 societies?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: We handle it ourselves. We already know the RWA rules of major societies in Sector 49 (like Tulip Orange, Orchid Island, South City 2), so we manage gate pass and entry clearance ourselves.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q6. What is your shifting charge?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Charges depend on the size of the shifting, floor level, distance and quantity of goods. Once done, our team conducts a free site survey and gives an exact and transparent quotation &ndash; there are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟠 Q7. Can I check the live location of the truck on the day of my shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Yes! All ShiftingPort trucks are GPS-enabled. You get a tracking link on move day to check the real-time location of the goods.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q8. Does ShiftingPort do shifting on weekends or holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Yes, absolutely! Many families in Sector 49 prefer shifting on weekends or public holidays &ndash; so that office time is not wasted. We are available with full team on Saturday&ndash;Sunday and holidays as well (advance booking recommended).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q9. Does your team do night shifting as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: If the society&#39;s RWA permits, we do night-shifting as well. Sometimes, there is less traffic after 8 PM and parking is available, so late evening or early morning moves are also possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q10. Does your team shift luggage via lift or stairs?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: We handle both. If the lift is working, heavy items are moved by lift, but if lift is unavailable or manual shifting is necessary, our team is trained to ensure safe movement via stairs (with safety belts + floor padding).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q11. Do you uninstall AC, geyser, TV wall mount?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 A: Yes, on-demand we arrange technicians who safely uninstall AC, geyser, chimney, and TV &ndash; and install them at the new location if required (charges are extra but nominal).</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q12. Do you take back packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 A: Yes, we can take back used cartons, wraps, and foam sheets as per your convenience, so that there is no waste in your new home. You can also keep some sturdy boxes for reuse if you wish.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q13. Does ShiftingPort also do pet shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Yes, many pet owners in Sector 49 have shifted with their dog, cat or bird from us. We make proper arrangements for pet-friendly cab, crate and travel timing &ndash; so that your furry friend is not stressed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q14. Do you provide storage or temporary storage facility?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Yes, if your new house is not ready or there is a gap of few days between shifting, we can temporarily store your belongings in a safe and dry warehouse &ndash; with CCTV surveillance and insurance option.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🟢 Q15. Do you also do interstate shifting (outside Sector 49)?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>📌 Answer: Yes! We have done relocations from Sector 49 to Delhi, Chandigarh, Jaipur, Dehradun, Mumbai and Bangalore. For long distance moves, we have separate GPS truck, insurance and city-to-city delivery planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon | Trusted Local Shifting Services', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon, Packers Movers in Sector 49 Gurgaon, Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 49, Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 49, Packers and Movers Near Me, Shifting Services Sector 49, Local Movers Gurgaon, Home Shifting in Sector 49, Office Relocation Gurgaon, Trusted Movers Sector 49, ShiftingPort Gurgaon', 'Need house or office shifting in Sector 49 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort Packers and Movers are offering safe packing, timely delivery and affordable charges – without any hidden costs. Free survey Book Now!', '2025-07-13 17:15:46', '2025-07-13 17:35:04');
