(99, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 37, 1, 1, 1, 40, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 50', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-50', '1999', NULL, 'Looking for easy, fast and reliable shifting in Sector 50 Gurgaon? Get professional team, safe packing and on-time delivery from ShiftingPort Packers and Movers – Call Now.', '<h2>📍 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers &ndash; The Most Trusted Name in Sector 50 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 50 Gurgaon is a premium residential and commercial area where new families are shifting and new offices are being set up every day. Shifting in such an environment is not easy unless you have a trusted partner. That is why people here trust just one name again and again &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We are not just a packers and movers company but a local expert for Sector 50 who makes every move easy, safe and stress-free. Our experience, local understanding and professional approach sets us apart from other companies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why choose ShiftingPort in Sector 50?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Local Knowledge:</strong> We have complete information about gate pass rules, parking policies and loading-unloading timings of all societies like Nirvana Country, South City 2 and Unitech Fresco.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Trained Team:</strong> Our team is not just labour but professionals in uniform who work with politeness and punctuality.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Safe Packing:</strong> Packing of each item as per its nature &ndash; using bubble wrap, foam sheets and laminated boxes.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Transparent Pricing:</strong> No hidden charges, charge as per what you say. Free quotation.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Fast Moving Service:</strong> Same-day move option is also available for local shifting.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 50 means tight schedules, society rules to follow and limited parking. ShiftingPort takes all these factors into consideration and plans the move in advance to ensure a smooth shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📅 Major societies in Sector 50 where we do regular moves:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Nirvana Country Phase 1 &amp; 2</li>\r\n	<li>The Close North/South</li>\r\n	<li>Unitech Harmony</li>\r\n	<li>Fresco Apartments</li>\r\n	<li>Emaar Emerald Estate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We know the RWA rules, gate clearance and lift bookings of all these societies in advance. So when ShiftingPort&#39;s vehicle arrives, everything from security to society supervisor is pre-arranged.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚀 Your Shifting Experts in Sector 50</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No matter where you are in Sector 50, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers are always with you. Our mission is - &quot;Make shifting simple, safe and stress-free.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now shifting is not just a task but an experience. And we are always ready to make that experience memorable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 Our Services &ndash; One-Stop Packers and Movers for every need in Sector 50</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is not just a baggage lifting company. We understand your every big or small shifting need and design the service accordingly. Every person in Sector 50 Gurgaon has a different lifestyle, and our service is flexible and practical accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 1. Home Shifting Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We shift families daily in Sector 50 societies like Nirvana Country, The Close and Fresco Apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our home shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Safe wrapping of all furniture after dismantling</li>\r\n	<li>Soft layered packing of crockery, d&eacute;cor and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Movement planning according to lift or staircase</li>\r\n	<li>Carton packing with labels for easy unpacking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We always try to ensure that you do not find even a single item at the wrong place after shifting. We label everything from the kids&#39; study table to every container in the kitchen so that the new house looks as organised as the old one.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If your office is around Sector 50 and you want to relocate, we do office shifting with the same professionalism:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Safe dismantling of computers, printers, chairs, tables</li>\r\n	<li>Sealed cartoon boxes for data files and confidential documents</li>\r\n	<li>Option of weekend or late night shift so that work hours are not affected</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Apart from this, our team also helps in reinstalling the IT setup. We pack the server racks separately and keep the network wires organised by tagging them.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛋️ 3. Packing and Unpacking Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times people say, &quot;We will take the stuff ourselves, we just need good packing.&quot; We also handle:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>category-wise packing material (glass, wood, electronics)</li>\r\n	<li>wardrobe boxes, TV boxes, bubble wrap + foam for delicate items</li>\r\n	<li>Help in unpacking and setup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>After unpacking, if you need to keep furniture or almirah in a particular room, our team also helps in manual shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 4. Local and intercity moving</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you want to move to South City 2 within Sector 50 or move to Jaipur or Dehradun with the whole family &ndash; we do both types of shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Complete move in 3-4 hours for local moving</li>\r\n	<li>GPS-enabled dedicated trucks for outstation</li>\r\n	<li>Driver&#39;s live location, call updates and timely delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We give you complete documentation, toll info and ETA for interstate moves in advance, so that you are mentally prepared.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚨 5. Extra services that only ShiftingPort offers:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Technician arrangement for uninstall/install of AC, geyser, chimney</li>\r\n	<li>Storage facility for temporary storage of goods</li>\r\n	<li>Disposal of old goods</li>\r\n	<li>Cleaning after move (optional)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, if you do not want to shift your goods before the griha pravesh puja of your new home, we can keep them safe in the warehouse for a day. There is also an option for cleaning and sanitization, especially in homes with children or elderly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every family and every office in Sector 50 Gurgaon has different needs. ShiftingPort plans your shifting accordingly &ndash; so that not a single step is taken without planning.</p>', '<h2>🧾 Our Process &ndash; How every shifting step of ShiftingPort works</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers&rsquo; job is not just lifting the goods, but it runs under a whole system &ndash; so that every move is completed smoothly, safely and according to schedule. And shifting without planning in a busy area like Sector 50 Gurgaon can be risky. That&rsquo;s why we follow a well-defined process for every client, which is developed from decades of experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔍 1. Free Survey and Consultation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>First of all, we do a free site survey of your home or office. Our experts understand your needs, quantity of goods, floor number, lift availability and distance to the destination. Accordingly, we tell you:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>How many boxes will be required?</li>\r\n	<li>How many staff will be needed?</li>\r\n	<li>How much time will it take?</li>\r\n	<li>And most importantly &ndash; what will be your shifting cost?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💬 2. Transparent Quotation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>After the survey, we give you a written quotation which clearly states everything &ndash; no hidden charges. This quotation can also be sent on WhatsApp or email so that you have proof.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our aim is to keep the customer clear from start to end &ndash; no confusion, no hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 3. Smart Packing &ndash; Zero Damage Promise</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Packing is ShiftingPort&rsquo;s biggest strength. We pack each item according to its category:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Foam padding + bubble wrap for Glass and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Stretch films + corner guards for Furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Custom boxes with fillers for Kitchen items</li>\r\n	<li>Wardrobe cartons for Clothes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Every box has proper labeling &ndash; like &ldquo;Bedroom &ndash; Books&rdquo; or &ldquo;Kitchen &ndash; Utensils&rdquo; so that no time is wasted in decorating the new home.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧑&zwj;🔧 4. Safe Loading &amp; Movement</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our trained team brings down each item safely through lift or stairs. The items are loaded in the truck in a proper way following the society timings and rules so that no item moves during the journey.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times societies in Sector 50 require basement parking, lift restrictions or entry-pass - which we arrange in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 5. GPS Enabled Transport</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>All our transport trucks are GPS enabled. You get live location on shifting day so you can stay relaxed. Driver and team are on light call.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For outstation moves, we give you ETA (Estimated Time of Arrival) and toll info in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 6. Unloading &amp; Setup</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>After unloading at destination:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We put labeled boxes in the right rooms</li>\r\n	<li>Assemble beds, tables and wardrobes</li>\r\n	<li>Help place appliances</li>\r\n	<li>And take back old material (cartons/wraps) if needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 7. Post move support</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If any item is missing after shifting, or needs repositioning &ndash; we also provide next-day service. We believe that customer service should not only extend to packing, but also to unpacking and satisfaction.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🗺️ Sector 50 Gurgaon Local Understanding &ndash; Why ShiftingPort is at the forefront?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 50 Gurgaon is not just a pincode &ndash; it is a vibrant community where thousands of families live in upscale societies, office complexes run, and there is daily movement. Shifting in this entire area becomes easy only when your mover is not only professional but also a local expert. And this is what makes the difference ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Specialty of Sector 50 &ndash; which we understand in detail:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Big societies here like Nirvana Country, The Close South, Fresco Apartments, Harmony Homes etc. have processes like gate entry pass, lift booking, security clearance.</li>\r\n	<li>Many societies have limited loading-unloading time &ndash; like entry is prohibited before 10 am or lifts are closed after 6 pm.</li>\r\n	<li>The roads of Sector 50 are often jam packed with traffic due to school buses, delivery vans and local markets. Our team plans the moving timing and route keeping all this in mind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 Why is it necessary to have the support of a local expert?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many big companies from outside provide services in Gurgaon, but they do not know the local ground realities. The result is that:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Entry is denied if you do not know the rules of the society</li>\r\n	<li>If you do not get lift time, you have to carry your luggage to the 4th floor by hand</li>\r\n	<li>The truck gets stuck in the wrong lane and the customer is upset</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort saves you from all this. We work in Sector 50 every day &mdash; our staff knows the behavior of every society, from the RWA to the watchman.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our planning naturally includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Getting entry passes made in advance from the society</li>\r\n	<li>Matching lift timings</li>\r\n	<li>Aligning trucks in the basement in advance</li>\r\n	<li>Having the guards confirm staff entry</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ Practical things that set us apart:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Moving checklist</strong> tailored to Sector 50</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Dedicated supervisor on-site</strong> to ensure clear communication</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Society-specific tools</strong> &ndash; like smaller trolleys for narrow stairs</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Lift-friendly packing dimensions</strong> to ensure no items get stuck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧡 Why are we the first choice of Sector 50 residents?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Because we don&rsquo;t just treat you as a &ldquo;client&rdquo;, we treat you like a neighbour. Whether you are shifting to a 2BHK in Fresco or a 4BHK in Harmony &ndash; we handle every move with equal priority.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has done more than 1000+ successful shifts in Sector 50 &ndash; and every one of our customers refers us even today.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏆 Why ShiftingPort is every family&rsquo;s first choice &ndash; Trust, Experience and Local Connectivity</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In a fast-paced city like Gurgaon, where something new is happening every day, a good packers and movers company is not just about sending the vehicle &ndash; it is about building trust, valuing the goods and providing a seamless experience. And that is why families in Sector 50 Gurgaon choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers again and again.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧡 1. Our Focus &ndash; Family, Not Just Stuff</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>When a family shifts, it is not just a location change for them &ndash; it is a move of memories, emotions and feelings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We understand that:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Children&rsquo;s toys are as important as electronics</li>\r\n	<li>The value of an old almirah is not just of wood, but of memories</li>\r\n	<li>Every kitchen box should be at the same place in the new house where it is used to be</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The ShiftingPort team therefore considers every shifting as a sentimental journey &ndash; and treats it accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧰 2. Same consistency, same perfection in every moving</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 50, we have done every kind of shifting, from small 1BHK to big duplex flats. But one thing that has been common in every move is the consistency of our service:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Team arriving on time every time</li>\r\n	<li>Professional body language and conversation</li>\r\n	<li>Zero-compromise attitude with the goods</li>\r\n	<li>Neat packing, systematic loading in the truck and setup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This professionalism makes us a standard-setter.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📣 3. Word of Mouth &ndash; Our biggest branding tool</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have never put up big hoardings. Neither do we run ads on TV. Still, people of every society in Sector 50 know our name. Why?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because we perform every move in such a way that the customer himself says:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>&ldquo;Call ShiftingPort, there is no one better than them.&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>More than 70% of our clients come from referrals &ndash; a friend, neighbour or colleague recommended us.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🌟 4. 24x7 Support &ndash; With you even after the move</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>People often think that the job of movers is limited to delivery. But ShiftingPort is not limited to that.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>If any of your boxes is mistakenly moved to another room, our team will replace it for free the next day</li>\r\n	<li>If you need help in reinstalling any appliance after shifting, we will send a technician</li>\r\n	<li>If cleaning is required after the move, our deep-cleaning service is available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>This extra care makes us the first choice of every family in Gurgaon.</p>', '<h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions in Sector 50 Gurgaon &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Answers</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Do you provide services only in Sector 50?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> ✅ No, we provide services in Sector 50 as well as all over Gurgaon and NCR. Be it Nirvana Country or South City 2, Sector 49 or 57 &ndash; our team covers every area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Do you do same-day shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we provide same-day service for local moving. The only condition is that the luggage should not be too much and the distance should be limited. 1BHK or 2BHK shifting can be done easily in a day.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Do you bring all the packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Of course, we bring the complete packing kit &ndash; like bubble wrap, carton boxes, tape, foam sheets, fragile labels and wardrobe boxes etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Do you also handle society gate passes and lift bookings?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we are aware of the RWA rules of most societies in Sector 50. Our team makes all arrangements for gate passes, lift slots and entry-exit times ahead of time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. What if something gets damaged?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ We work carefully, but if there is any damage, we help with insurance claims or provide alternative solutions. Our priority is to ensure that you do not suffer any loss.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Do you also assist with unpacking and setup?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we place all the boxes in the respective rooms after shifting, refit beds and cupboards and also re-position furniture if needed.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Do you have a facility for disposing of old items?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we also provide responsible disposal of old and unused items. There is a nominal charge for this and it is discussed in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. Do you work on weekends and holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we work on all days - weekends and public holidays too, so the demand is high on those days, so booking in advance is a must.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓9. How are your prices decided?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Our pricing is completely transparent. Charges are decided based on the quantity of goods, distance, floor number, lift facility and manpower. There are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓10. What support will you get if there is any problem after the move?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ You will definitely get it. If something needs to be replaced, re-fitted or a box is misplaced, our team is available for support - on call or message.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓11. Do you help in removing and installing AC, geyser, or chimney?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we arrange technicians who uninstall and reinstall AC, geyser, chimney or RO. This service is optional and the cost is cleared in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓12. Do you have GPS tracking in your service?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, all our trucks are GPS-enabled so that you can see the live location of the goods. This keeps you informed about every stage &ndash; from pickup to delivery.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓13. Do you also shift pets or plants?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we move small pets and house plants with special arrangements. We take full care of their care and ventilation. For this, special boxes and customized vehicle support are also available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓14. Is your company registered and has GST number?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Absolutely, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is a fully registered, GST-compliant company. You get proper bills, invoices and all the documents required for any official or commercial move.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓15. Do you provide storage facilities?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, if you need to store some items for a short time &mdash; like your new house is not ready or there is some other delay &mdash; we have safe and clean storage spaces available for both short-term and long-term.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 50 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort – Safe & Fast Shifting', 'packers and movers in sector 50 gurgaon, packers movers sector 50, shifting services sector 50 gurgaon, home relocation sector 50, ShiftingPort packers gurgaon, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 50, packers and movers gurgaon sector 50, packers and movers near me,', 'Looking for reliable Packers and Movers for Sector 50 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort offers safe packing, timely delivery and transparent rates – Call Now.', '2025-07-13 18:13:51', '2025-07-13 18:13:51'),
(100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 38, 1, 1, 1, 41, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 51', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-51', '1999', NULL, 'The search for reliable and professional Packers and Movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon is over! ShiftingPort brings you completely safe, budget and timely home, office, car-bike and storage moving services - that too with local experience and professional staff. Book a free consultation today!', '<h2>🏠 Shifting your home or office in Sector 51 Gurgaon, ShiftingPort is your real helping team</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting your home in Sector 51 Gurgaon sounds easy, but in reality it is a very difficult task. One thinks &ndash; call a few people, arrange a truck and shift. But in reality, the stress on the day of moving is the most &ndash; was the packing of the stuff done properly or not? Was anything broken during loading? Did the truck arrive on time or not?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why people in Sector 51 now choose a reliable and local packers and movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon instead of shifting themselves &ndash; and this is where ShiftingPort comes into the picture.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Why does shifting in Sector 51 yourself become a headache?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Most societies have fixed moving timings (9am to 1pm)</li>\r\n	<li>For moving in lifts, you need to take permission from the guards beforehand</li>\r\n	<li>Trucks are not allowed inside &ndash; goods have to be carried by hand</li>\r\n	<li>Heavy items like double door refrigerator, washing machine, and wooden bed are difficult to lift alone</li>\r\n	<li>Lack of time &ndash; people with jobs cannot take leave</li>\r\n	<li>Now you think, can you manage all this hassle alone? Probably not.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ ShiftingPort &ndash; Local Moving Master in Sector 51</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers are well aware of every lane, society and rules of Sector 51 Gurgaon. We have shifted the belongings of hundreds of families in dozens of societies like Orchid Island, Mayfield Garden, South City II without a single scratch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What we do:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Free first visit and on-site luggage inspection</li>\r\n	<li>Kitchen, bedroom, drawing, electronics &ndash; custom packing of every item</li>\r\n	<li>Right size truck and on-time dispatch</li>\r\n	<li>Local staff who knows the guards, gates and society rules</li>\r\n	<li>A coordinator who handles the entire moving process &ndash; you don&rsquo;t have to worry</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔁 Increasing demand for Packers and Movers in Sector 51</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Nowadays, dozens of houses and offices are shifting in Sector 51 every week. There are three major reasons for this:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>People are moving here from other parts of the city</li>\r\n	<li>People move house due to job change and children&rsquo;s schooling</li>\r\n	<li>Offices are shifting to new places</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting every time means &ndash; responsibility, time, and effort. If you don&rsquo;t get the right Packers and Movers, then the whole moving day gets spoiled.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is the first choice of people in Sector 51 Gurgaon &ndash; because we come on time, pack the goods as if it were our own, and don&rsquo;t let the customer worry about anything.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔑 ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon &ndash; Why the most trusted?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Trained staff and experienced team</li>\r\n	<li>Knowledge of local society rules</li>\r\n	<li>Affordable rates, fixed charges &ndash; no hidden costs</li>\r\n	<li>Full responsibility from full packing to unpacking</li>\r\n	<li>Separate care for everything &ndash; bike, car, furniture, kitchen</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>It is better to take help of an expert in Sector 51 than to do moving yourself. ShiftingPort Packers and Movers is not just a name, it is a trust &ndash; which walks with you at every step. Now shifting is not a hassle, it is just a call away.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 Proper packing makes moving safe &ndash; ShiftingPort&rsquo;s professional packing service in Sector 51</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to shifting home or office, the first and most important step is &ndash; proper packing. If the packing is not done properly, no matter how good the vehicle is, damage to the goods is certain. In residential areas like Sector 51 Gurgaon, where the society has strict moving rules and the vehicle does not enter before time &ndash; it becomes necessary to make packing even smarter.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Understanding this need, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provides the safest, most organized and professional packing service in Sector 51 Gurgaon. We believe that every item &ndash; be it a cupboard, a fridge, a TV or a small photo frame &ndash; has its own emotional and financial value. Hence, the way of packing each item is different.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧰 What do we use in packing?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is not just a company that packs things in cartons and tapes them. We use high-quality packing materials like:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Heavy-duty carton boxes of 5 and 7 ply</strong> &ndash; for clothes, books, electronics</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Bubble wrap and foam sheets</strong> &ndash; for fragile items like TVs, microwaves, laptops</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Kitchen crates and partition boxes</strong> &ndash; to keep plates, cups, glasses safe</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Stretch wrap film and corner guards</strong> &ndash; to protect the corners of sofas, tables, beds</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Waterproof taping and labelling</strong> &ndash; so that items stay safe and identifiable even in the rain</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>👷&zwj;♂️ How does the packing team at ShiftingPort work?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team in Sector 51 first visits your home for free &ndash; to check how many rooms there are, which items need special packing and the number of teams required. Then, on the day of packing, we bring:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Full packing kit</li>\r\n	<li>Trained local staff</li>\r\n	<li>Labelling stickers and markers</li>\r\n	<li>Trolley and lift handling tools</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>TVs are packed in wooden cases, refrigerators are covered with body wrap and thermocol, and washing machines have their drums locked &ndash; to ensure that nothing moves during moving.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kitchen items are the most sensitive &ndash; ShiftingPort&rsquo;s kitchen packing team is specially trained just for kitchens. Plates, utensils, spices, bottles &ndash; everything is individually covered and packed in divider boxes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 Local challenges of packing in Sector 51 Gurgaon</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Movings in Sector 51 societies happen on a limited time &ndash; so we have to pack fast and accurately. Sometimes lifts are not allotted or parking is far away &ndash; so our team prepares in advance to ensure there are no hassles on the day of moving.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We write the details of each box &ndash; like &ldquo;Bedroom &ndash; Books&rdquo;, or &ldquo;Kitchen &ndash; Crockery&rdquo;, so that when you open your new home, you can find everything without any confusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔐 Why ShiftingPort is the most trusted packing company in Sector 51?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>1000+ packing experience</li>\r\n	<li>Special material &ndash; No torn boxes</li>\r\n	<li>Local staff &ndash; Knowing society rules and moving entry time</li>\r\n	<li>Quick packing &ndash; 2BHK complete packing in 3-4 hours</li>\r\n	<li>All items with label and tracking</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>How the packing is done is more important than choosing Packers and Movers. ShiftingPort is the best choice in Sector 51 Gurgaon &ndash; because we don&rsquo;t just pack, we handle a part of your life &ndash; with complete responsibility and care.</p>', '<h2>🚛 ShiftingPort takes complete responsibility of safe loading, transport and car-bike shifting in Sector 51</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Packers and Movers are not just packing &ndash; the real work begins when the goods are properly lifted and loaded into the vehicle, transported safely and unloaded at the new place without any damage. Doing all this in a busy area like Sector 51 Gurgaon with strict moving rules is not easy &ndash; but ShiftingPort makes every challenge easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is 100% professional and full of local experience not only in packing but also in loading and transporting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🪜 1. Loading and unloading &ndash; requires more understanding than strength</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Most societies in Sector 51 like Orchid Island or South City 2 have fixed lift time and truck entry time. In such a situation, we have to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Lift the goods quickly and without any noise</li>\r\n	<li>Moving has to be done without damaging the society&#39;s lift, gate, and path</li>\r\n	<li>Heavy items like fridge, cupboard, washing machine, bed have to be lifted at the right angle and tools</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Brings trolley, belt, corner protector and floor guard</li>\r\n	<li>Puts bedding and balancing system in the vehicle before loading</li>\r\n	<li>During loading, furniture is kept below and light items are kept above</li>\r\n	<li>During unloading, every box is kept in the right room - not just left outside</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 2. Transportation - Vehicle according to your need</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>One size of vehicle is not right for every shifting. In many societies inside Sector 51, only small vehicles (Tata Ace, Pickup) go, while in some places you can directly take a 14 or 19 feet container.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Features of our vehicles:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>GPS tracking system</li>\r\n	<li>Clean body and covered trolley</li>\r\n	<li>Experienced local driver who knows every lane of Sector 51</li>\r\n	<li>Guaranteed timely arrival and departure</li>\r\n	<li>Waterproof covers for protection from rain or dust</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 3. Car and bike relocation &ndash; safe delivery even to distant cities</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many people in Sector 51 shift to other cities like Delhi, Mumbai, Jaipur, Chandigarh or Bangalore. In such a situation, not only household goods but also car and bike have to be sent along.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&#39;s car and bike shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Completely covering the bike with bubble wrap and jute bags</li>\r\n	<li>Safety by using handle lock, tyre lock and petrol drain</li>\r\n	<li>Packing in a wooden frame and fixing it in the truck</li>\r\n	<li>Shipping the car in a closed container with hydraulic ramps</li>\r\n	<li>Door-to-door pickup and delivery facility</li>\r\n	<li>Transit insurance on every vehicle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 4. Storage/warehouse facility - when the new house is not ready</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many a times it happens that the goods have to be shifted from Sector 51, but the new house will be available next week. In such a situation, where should the goods be kept?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort offers you safe and clean storage facility in Gurgaon &ndash; where your belongings are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>monitored by CCTV cameras</li>\r\n	<li>organized on pallets and racks</li>\r\n	<li>stored in moisture-free and pest-controlled area</li>\r\n	<li>labeled with QR code for tracking</li>\r\n	<li>short term (2 days) to long term (6 months) storage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Why Sector 51 residents choose ShiftingPort for loading, transport and vehicle shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every vehicle is pre-disinfected</li>\r\n	<li>Drivers and helpers are trained &ndash; no random people</li>\r\n	<li>4.9★ rating</li>\r\n	<li>tracking and timely delivery of every item</li>\r\n	<li>insurance on both bike and car</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Moving in Sector 51 Gurgaon is not just a game of packing &ndash; it is a complete system of right truck, timing, team and tracking. And ShiftingPort Packers and Movers operates this system for you without any hassle &ndash; so that you can shift comfortably and your goods arrive safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🛠️ ShiftingPort Process in Sector 51 Gurgaon &ndash; Complete transparency and professional approach at every step</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The biggest identity of Packers and Movers is not just their rates or trucks, but their way of working. In a complex area like Sector 51 Gurgaon, every society, gate and customer&#39;s requirement is different - and ShiftingPort understands this and executes every moving under a systematic process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our aim is not just to deliver the goods, but to provide an experience that customers will remember and recommend to others.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔄 Our Step-by-Step Moving Process:</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1️⃣ Free Site Visit &amp; Consultation</strong><br />\r\nEvery flat, society and villa in Sector 51 has a different structure. We come to your home and do a complete evaluation of the goods - how much is there, what packing is needed, which time slot is allowed for moving.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ No charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Truck size and staff planning is done here</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2️⃣ Customized Quotation (No Hidden Charges)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We give every customer a written and fixed quotation &ndash; which includes everything like packing, loading, transport and taxes.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ No hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Paytm, UPI, GST bill facility</li>\r\n	<li>✅ EMI payment option too</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3️⃣ Pre-Move Day Planning</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team calls you a day before shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>To confirm moving time</li>\r\n	<li>To check society gate pass and permission</li>\r\n	<li>To lock truck parking point</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ This ensures no delay on moving day</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4️⃣ Packing, Loading &amp; Transport &ndash; everything on time</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many societies in Sector 51 allow moving only from 9 am to 1 pm &ndash; we send our team according to that time.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Fragile items are packed separately</li>\r\n	<li>Each box is labeled</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture is dismantled and bubble wrapped</li>\r\n	<li>Items are balanced in the truck</li>\r\n	<li>Waterproof cover and taping to protect from rain or dust</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5️⃣ Unloading &amp; Unpacking</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>At the new location, the items are unloaded and kept in the same room, so that there is no problem in unpacking.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Sofas, dining, beds are reassembled and set</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Option of furniture fitting if needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6️⃣ Post-Move Support</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>After shifting, we call you to ask:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Is anything missing?</li>\r\n	<li>Is anything broken?</li>\r\n	<li>Do you need help in unpacking?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ If there is a mistake in a box, our team responds within 24 hours<br />\r\n✅ Tracking and insurance claim support is also available</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Why do people of Sector 51 consider our process reliable?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Every moving is done under a system &ndash; no &lsquo;as it goes&rsquo; style</li>\r\n	<li>Complete information about local guards, residents and society rules</li>\r\n	<li>Paper invoice, GST bill and digital sign</li>\r\n	<li>Company&rsquo;s own truck, staff and management &ndash; no third party</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are deciding on Packers and Movers only by looking at the rates, then you may have to regret later. But if you want a team in Sector 51 Gurgaon that is professional at every step, takes care of every small detail and delivers on time &ndash; then this structured process of ShiftingPort will never disappoint you.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 ShiftingPort Customized Moving Plans for Every Budget and Need in Sector 51</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The biggest question when choosing Packers and Movers is &ndash; &ldquo;What are the rates?&rdquo;, and this concern is absolutely justified. Because most companies quote low rates first, and then suddenly increase the bill by introducing hidden charges on the day of moving. People living in Sector 51 Gurgaon are well aware of this &ndash; and that is why they now choose ShiftingPort Packers and Movers, where everything is clear and within budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📊 How are rates decided at ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We decide the rates based on your actual moving needs &ndash; no less, no more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The rate is calculated as follows:</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Moving Factor</th>\r\n			<th>How It Affects the Rate</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Home Size (1RK, 2BHK, 3BHK)</td>\r\n			<td>The bigger the home, the more items to shift.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Floor Number &amp; Lift Facility</td>\r\n			<td>Rates are lower if there&rsquo;s a lift; without it, manpower costs increase.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Distance &ndash; How Far from Sector 51</td>\r\n			<td>Whether the move is local, within NCR, or intercity affects the cost.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Packing Quality</td>\r\n			<td>Normal vs. premium packing impacts the total charges.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Extra Services</td>\r\n			<td>Car/bike transport, unpacking, or storage add to the cost.</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>We first do a free home visit, look at everything and give you a written quotation &ndash; so there are no surprise charges later.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Our popular moving packages for Sector 51</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1️⃣ Mini Move Plan (1RK, Students, Working Singles)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Small Truck (Tata Ace)</li>\r\n	<li>2 Packers + 1 Driver</li>\r\n	<li>Basic Packing</li>\r\n	<li>Complete Move in 3 Hours&nbsp;💰 Starting from ₹2,999</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2️⃣ Standard Move Plan (1BHK/2BHK Families)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Medium Truck</li>\r\n	<li>3-4 Packers</li>\r\n	<li>High Quality Packing Material</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture Dismantling &amp; Fixing&nbsp;💰 ₹5,500 &ndash; ₹9,500</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3️⃣ Premium Move Plan (3BHK+, Villa, Intercity)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>14/19 Feet Container Truck</li>\r\n	<li>5+ Staff</li>\r\n	<li>Wooden Crates, Bubble Wrap, Labelling</li>\r\n	<li>GPS Tracking, Customer Support&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>💰 Starting from ₹11,000 Start</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4️⃣ Office Shifting Plan</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Team as per modular setup</li>\r\n	<li>Computer, files, chair, furniture Special packing</li>\r\n	<li>Overnight shifting facility</li>\r\n	<li>💰 From ₹7,500</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>5️⃣ Car/Bike Relocation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Wooden frame packing for bikes</li>\r\n	<li>Enclosed truck for cars</li>\r\n	<li>Door-to-door pickup</li>\r\n	<li>💰 Bike from ₹2,000 | Car from ₹5,500</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>6️⃣ Storage Plan (Monthly/Short-Term)</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>CCTV and Moisture-Free Warehouse</li>\r\n	<li>QR-tag and inventory management</li>\r\n	<li>3 days to 6 months</li>\r\n	<li>💰 From ₹299 per box/month</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🤝 Every customer&#39;s need is different - ShiftingPort offers 100% custom plans</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 51, some live alone, some live with family. Some are shifting just 1 bed, some need to pack their entire 3BHK, including car and bike. We understand each case differently and make a customized moving plan accordingly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You tell us:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>How much stuff is there?</li>\r\n	<li>Where to move from?</li>\r\n	<li>When to move?</li>\r\n	<li>Which items do you need special care for?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>With just these 4 things, we will make the best package for you in budget &ndash; with no hidden charges, no hassles.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔎 Why do people choose ShiftingPort for budget moving in Sector 51?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Pre-shifting free visit and accurate quotation</li>\r\n	<li>Flat, Society, Truck Entry all in focus</li>\r\n	<li>No agents, no middlemen &ndash; company directly</li>\r\n	<li>100% transparency and invoice</li>\r\n	<li>EMI and digital payment facility also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are thinking &ldquo;How to find good and reliable Packers and Movers cheaply in Sector 51 Gurgaon?&rdquo; then the answer is &ndash; ShiftingPort. There is a solution for every budget, and a precise plan for every moving. Talk once, then see how easy moving becomes.</p>', '<p>❓ Frequently asked questions about Packers and Movers in Sector 51 &ndash; and their accurate answers</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever someone plans shifting to Sector 51 Gurgaon, many questions arise in his mind &ndash; &ldquo;What will be the rate?&rdquo;, &ldquo;What if something breaks?&rdquo;, &ldquo;Will the luggage be safe in the vehicle or not?&rdquo;, &ldquo;How much time will the work take?&rdquo;<br />\r\nAt ShiftingPort, we not only provide services but also answer all your questions honestly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🙋&zwj;♂️ Q1. How much does it cost to shift a house in Sector 51?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;The rate depends on many things &ndash; like the size of the house, distance, packing quality and size of the truck.<br />\r\nAverage cost for local moving in Sector 51:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>1BHK &ndash; ₹3,000 to ₹6,000</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2BHK &ndash; ₹6,000 to ₹9,500</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3BHK &ndash; ₹10,000 to ₹14,000<br />\r\nBook our free site visit for an exact quote.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛵 Q2. Do you shift bikes and cars too? Will it be safe?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;Yes, we deliver both cars and bikes door-to-door. The bike is packed in bubble wrap and wooden crate, and the car is sent in an enclosed hydraulic truck.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Every vehicle comes with insurance and tracking facility.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏱️ Q3. How much time does it take to shift the entire contents of a 2BHK?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If there is proper lift and parking facility in Sector 51, then the goods of 2BHK will take:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Packing &ndash; 3 hours</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Loading + Transport &ndash; 2&ndash;3 hours</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unloading &ndash; 1&ndash;2 hours</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Total: Your entire house is safely shifted in about 6&ndash;8 hours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Q4. Do you also do unpacking and furniture fitting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. We don&rsquo;t just deliver the goods and leave &ndash; we also fix the bed, sofa, wardrobe if needed. Basic things like kitchen and clothes unpacking are also done. All you have to do is sit and have tea, we will take care of the rest.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Q5. Do you provide bills and GST invoices?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, ShiftingPort is a Registered Packers and Movers company and we provide GST invoices, digital payment receipts and contracts to all customers. Whether your work is small or big, there will always be paper clarity.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Q6. Do you also do office shifting and storage?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, we have moved many chartered accountant offices, coaching centers, and startups in Sector 51. We pack and transport office furniture, desks, computers, and files with utmost care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If your new office is not ready yet, you can also keep the items in our storage warehouse.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Q7. Does your company do the moving itself or does it outsource it to some other agency?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;ShiftingPort Packers and Movers works with its own team, trucks and staff. We do not hire any agent or third party. This gives you the convenience of dealing directly with the company and we have full control over the quality of the work.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Q8. Do you move independent houses and villas along with flats?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong>&nbsp;Yes, we have done shifting of many villas and bungalows in Sector 51. Such houses usually have a lot of stuff &ndash; like garden items, gym equipment, puja ghar etc. &ndash; which is carefully packed and moved. We also provide a bigger truck and extra staff for villas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📍 Q9. What if the vehicle cannot enter our society?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Such a situation arises many times in Sector 51 &ndash; when the gate is small or entry of the truck is not allowed. In such a case, our team shifts the goods by trolley, by hand or by small vehicle. We have worked in this way in places like South City 2 and Orchid Island.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Q10. Can I pack some items myself and you will do the rest?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. If you want to pack your clothes or books yourself, we can give you cartons. The rest of the furniture, kitchen and fragile items are packed by our team in a professional manner. This saves time and also reduces the budget.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon, \r\nPackers Movers in Sector 51 Gurgaon, Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 51, Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 51, Packers Movers Gurgaon Sector 51, packers and movers near me, Sector 51 Gurgaon packers movers, Home shifting in Sector 51, Office relocation Sector 51, Bike relocation Gurgaon, \r\nAffordable packers in Sector 51, Shifting services Sector 51 Gurgaon, Storage facility in Gurgaon', 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 51 Gurgaon – Home, Office, Car-Bike Shifting and Storage Services, Fast and Safe Moving Facility with Confidence.', '2025-07-14 08:05:04', '2025-07-14 11:56:22');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `status`, `featured`, `service_featured`, `state_featured`, `city_featured`, `sublocation_featured`, `name`, `order_id`, `service_id`, `state_id`, `city_id`, `sublocation_id`, `heading`, `sub_heading`, `url`, `price`, `discount`, `small_description`, `aboutInfo`, `overview`, `policy`, `metaTitle`, `metaKeywords`, `metaDescription`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(101, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 39, 1, 1, 1, 42, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 52', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-52', '1999', NULL, 'If you are looking for reliable Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon then ShiftingPort is the right choice. Home, office, car, bike and storage services - everything safe, fast and on budget.', '<h2>📦 Need and Growing Demand for Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon &ndash; Why ShiftingPort is the First Choice?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 52 Gurgaon is an area where hundreds of people move house every day for a new beginning &ndash; be it a job promotion, children&rsquo;s schooling, or the dream of moving to a better apartment. Shifting is always a trend here due to the presence of premium societies like Ardee City, Sushant Estate, Sapphire Floors, Florence Residency. But one thing always comes up &ndash; finding reliable Packers and Movers is not easy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers has become the first choice of people in Sector 52 Gurgaon for the last several years. The reason? Because we don&rsquo;t just move stuff &ndash; we shift people&rsquo;s emotions, memories and responsibilities, and that too without stress, without breakage and on time.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ The specialty of Sector 52 &ndash; From Premium Flats to Budget Residences, Movers are needed for everything</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>People living in Sector 52 come from different backgrounds &ndash; some are young professionals working in DLF Cyber City, while some are families who have been living in Ardee City or Sushant Lok-II for years. Here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Some flats are on the fourth floor where there is no lift</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Some societies are gated and have a fixed moving time</li>\r\n	<li>👉 In some places, vehicle entry is not allowed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a situation, the need for local Packers and Movers increases even more, who not only do the shifting, but also understand and follow the rules of the society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ What difference does ShiftingPort make?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Packers and Movers in Sector 52 mean &ndash; a crowd of vehicles, getting permission from the guard, struggling to park the truck and completing the work within the time limit. ShiftingPort solves all these things with pre-planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Special Services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Free Pre-Move Survey &ndash; Planning according to your society and belongings</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Professional packing team &ndash; who packs everything accordingly</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Truck size and staff as per location</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Society permission and gate pass arranged in advance</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Same Day Shifting Promise &ndash; No Delay, No Tension</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Who needs Packers and Movers in Sector 52 the most?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Newly married couples shifting to Florence Residency</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Working professionals transferring from Ardee City to Noida</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Families buying a bigger house in Sushant Estate</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Students or Single tenants shifting to Sapphire Floors</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Or anyone who needs to shift home, office, car or bike &ndash; in a very safe manner</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🎯 Why people in Sector 52 now choose ShiftingPort instead of any other local agency?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Because we have local experience and team</li>\r\n	<li>👉 We have worked in every major society in Sector 52</li>\r\n	<li>👉 We offer 100% transparency &ndash; no agents, no commissions</li>\r\n	<li>👉 And most importantly &ndash; we take your trust, not your stuff</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The need for Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon is no longer a luxury, but a necessity. ShiftingPort understands this need and turns it into a smooth, reliable and budget-friendly process &mdash; making your shifting not just quick, but perfect too.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>📦 ShiftingPort Professional Packing Service in Sector 52 Gurgaon &ndash; Safety of everything is now our responsibility</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The most important part of Packers and Movers is &ndash; packing.<br />\r\nIf the packing is not done properly, whether the truck is new or the team is expert &ndash; the goods can get damaged. In premium residential areas like Sector 52 Gurgaon, where people keep expensive furniture, LED, decor and imported kitchen items, half the problem starts from here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The specialty of ShiftingPort is that we pack every item according to its category and value &ndash; not a common method, but a custom packing strategy.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🍽️ 1. Kitchen Packing &ndash; The Biggest Challenge of Fragility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Kitchen shifting is the trickiest &mdash; because it contains:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Glassware</li>\r\n	<li>Crockery sets</li>\r\n	<li>Mixer, oven, microwave</li>\r\n	<li>Opened containers of oil and spices</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>For kitchen items, our team uses:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>5-layer bubble wrap</li>\r\n	<li>Crate boxes</li>\r\n	<li>Paper filling and tape seal</li>\r\n	<li>Separate Fragile labeling</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>In apartments like DLF Woodland Heights or Florence Residency in Sector 52, we have shifted 50+ kitchens without a single breakage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📺 2. Electronics &ndash; Expensive items, need more care</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>LED, home theatre, washing machine, fridge, AC &mdash; these are all items where even a scratch can prove to be very costly.<br />\r\nWe pack in:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Thermocol shielding</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Soft bubble wrap</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Carton or plybox packing</li>\r\n	<li>👉 &ldquo;This Side Up&rdquo; and &ldquo;Handle with Care&rdquo; labels on boxes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The refrigerator is switched off 4 hours before loading to avoid damaging the cooling system &mdash; these little things make ShiftingPort different.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👕 3. Clothes and personal items &ndash; complete hygiene</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We pack your clothes, shoes, bags and personal items in:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Garment bags</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Laminated boxes</li>\r\n	<li>👉 With moisture protection</li>\r\n	<li>👉 And divide them room-to-room through labeling</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Kids&rsquo; toys, school bags, office documents &ndash; all are covered separately to avoid any mix-ups.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛏️ 4. Furniture packing &ndash; bigger items, more responsibility</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many Sector 52 homes have heavy and fragile furniture like modular beds, dining tables, glass tops, study tables. We:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Dismantle first (where necessary)</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Pack completely with bubble wrap and corner covers</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Fix to truck with moving belt and padding</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Label every screw and fitting and keep it in a separate pouch</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🖼️ 5. Showpieces and Decor &ndash; your memories are safe too</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 God idols</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Decorative glass, lamps</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Paintings and gallery frames</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For all these we use Wooden Box or Thermocol Box &ndash; so that even a slight shock does not cause damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ Materials we use in packing:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 5-ply boxes</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Bubble wrap</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Silica gel packs (for moisture)</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Crates and wooden covers</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Fragile and Room Labels</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Transparent tape and strapping belt</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Why do we have a separate packing team for Sector 52?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>👉 Local Training &ndash; Team has experience of Sector 52 flats, stairs and parking</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Fast Execution &ndash; Complete packing work in a single day</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Safe Handling &ndash; No extra helpers or unknown labour</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Packing option in front of CCTV cameras</li>\r\n	<li>👉 Special &ldquo;No Noise&rdquo; packing for morning time (if society rules)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting house in Sector 52 Gurgaon is not just about sending a truck &ndash; it is about packing everything properly, safely and respectfully. The packing team of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers works with this philosophy &ndash; to ensure that everything reaches the right place, safe and secure.</p>', '<h2>🚚 Home Shifting, Office Relocation, Car/Bike Moving &amp; Storage in Sector 52 Gurgaon &ndash; One Stop Solution from ShiftingPort</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 52 Gurgaon is no longer just a residential area but an active migration hub &ndash; with hundreds of people shifting homes, offices or vehicles every month. The demand for moving is constantly increasing in societies like Ardee City, Sushant Estate, Florence Residency and Sapphire Floors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a situation, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Sector 52 Gurgaon brings to you 4 Complete Moving Solutions under one roof &ndash; a professional and reliable way to every moving need.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 1. Home Shifting &ndash; From Flat to Villa, Safe Moving for Every Home</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 52 has flats and villas ranging from 1BHK to 5BHK &ndash; and every home has a different need. We design every home shifting according to:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Free Site Visit &ndash; Exact quote and plan after seeing the house</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Customized packing &ndash; Separate material for kitchen, clothes, electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Staff size decided as per lift/stairs settings</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Unpacking and furniture fitting included</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Expertise in shifting societies like Ardee City, Florence Residency, Sapphire Floors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>With us, everything you own &ndash; memories, idols, frames, decor &ndash; arrives safely.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 2. Office Shifting &ndash; Shift office without work stopping, in a completely professional manner</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 52 is home to many startups, freelancers and professionals. Office shifting is time-sensitive here &ndash; and we treat it that way.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Dismantle and reinstall workstations and furniture</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Safe packing of desktop, printer, UPS, server etc.</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Packing files and documents in lockable boxes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Weekend or night shift moving option &ndash; so that work does not stop</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Experience in Office Relocation to DLF Phase 2, Sohna Road, Udyog Vihar</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We plan moving as per your team&#39;s schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 3. Loading, Transport and Car-Bike Moving &ndash; with 100% Safety and Tracking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>📦 Loading/Unloading Process:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Loading of each box as per category by trained staff</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Glass item is not at the bottom, but at the top</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture is fixed with belts</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Side padding and waterproof flooring in every truck</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚛 Transportation:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Separate trucks for local and all India moving</li>\r\n	<li>🔹From Tata Ace to 19-ft container</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Every truck is equipped with GPS tracking</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Truck number and Live Tracking link to the client</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🏍️ Bike Relocation:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Foam + Wooden Crate Packing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹From Scooty to Bullet, everyone moves safely</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Insurance up to ₹10,000 (optional)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚗 Car Relocation:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Trucks with Enclosed Hydraulic Ramp</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Door-to-door delivery</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Premium cover and insurance for luxury car Convenience</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ 4. Storage Facility &ndash; When the new home/office is not ready</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Many times Sector 52 clients need to shift immediately but:</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Possession of new home is not yet received</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Office renovation is going on</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Some items need to be kept aside for some time</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a case, ShiftingPort offers Safe &amp; Affordable storage:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Warehouses with CCTV surveillance</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Pest control and moisture-free environment</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Short-term (from 2 days) and Long-term (6 months+) storage plans</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Starting ₹299/Box/Month</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Bike, furniture, cartons, electronics all can be stored</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 Why do people in Sector 52 choose only ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹One-Stop-Solution: Home, Office, Bike, Car, Storage &ndash; Everything in One Place</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Entire Team Trained &ndash; No Outsourcing</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Transparent Rate, No Hidden Charges</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Realtime Tracking + Insurance Facility</li>\r\n	<li>🔹4.9★ Rated Service &ndash; Verified work in premium societies of Sector 52</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether you need to shift house, transfer office, send bike or store goods for a few days in Sector 52 Gurgaon &ndash; ShiftingPort Packers and Movers fulfills your responsibility with confidence in every situation.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Budget-friendly Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon &ndash; Accurate rates and transparent packages for every customer</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Whenever someone searches for Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon, the first question is &ndash; &ldquo;Bhai, how much will the rate be?&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this question is often asked by half of the customers directly on WhatsApp from Google.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort, we firmly believe &ndash; we earn by disclosing rates, not by hiding them.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That is why we provide completely transparent, no hidden charges, customized moving packages, so that every customer knows in advance how much his expenses will be.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Standard Home Shifting Rates (Local Move for Sector 52):</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Home Size</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Price (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Included Services</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1RK / Bachelor Room</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,999 &ndash; ₹4,499</td>\r\n			<td>Packing, Loading, Truck, Unloading</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK</td>\r\n			<td>