	</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>SUV / Luxury</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,500 &ndash; ₹7,500</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,000 &ndash; ₹14,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Hydraulic ramp + enclosed truck + insurance plan available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Storage Charges &ndash; When you need to store items for a few days</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Storage Type</th>\r\n			<th>Rate (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Details</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Box Storage</td>\r\n			<td>₹299/box/month</td>\r\n			<td>Moisture-free box room</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Storage</td>\r\n			<td>₹499/month</td>\r\n			<td>CCTV covered area</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture Storage</td>\r\n			<td>₹799/month</td>\r\n			<td>Large space, air controlled</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Whole House Goods</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,499+</td>\r\n			<td>Custom storage plan</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Pickup &amp; delivery included for Sector 52 clients.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💡 Why ShiftingPort packages are perfect for Sector 52?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹No Agent, No Commission &ndash; Deal directly with the company</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Transparent Payment: UPI, Card, Cash all modes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GST Bill and Digital Payment Receipt</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Pre-move survey and Quotation absolutely free</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Packers and Movers service in Sector 52 Gurgaon is no more expensive &ndash; Shifting is easy and budget-friendly with the right planning and the right provider. ShiftingPort makes every package for you Fair, Flexible and Fast.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏘️ Sector 52 Gurgaon Major Societies &amp; On Ground Experience of ShiftingPort Packers</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>One thing that matters a lot when choosing Packers and Movers is &ndash; does the company understand the rules and routes of my society?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 52 Gurgaon is an area where there are different types of societies within the same sector &ndash; some gated, some independent, some old and some brand new high-rise towers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers have experience of every lane, every guard and every gate of Sector 52 &ndash; as we have worked in almost every major society here.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Ardee City &ndash; Verified Shifting in Every Block</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Ardee City is the oldest and largest society in Sector 52, which has many types of houses from A to J Block &ndash; builder floors, independent houses and duplex flats. To work here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>You need to take permission from the guard first</li>\r\n	<li>Some gates are for exit only</li>\r\n	<li>Limited parking for loading vehicles</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team has moved 40+ houses in Ardee City, ranging from 1BHK to 5BHK.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏙️ Sushant Estate &ndash; High-Security Society</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sushant Estate is a high-rise society with very tight security. Here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Trucks only enter from basement entry</li>\r\n	<li>Moving time is fixed between 10AM to 6PM</li>\r\n	<li>Passenger lift is not allowed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort understands all this in advance &mdash; we take pre-approval and finish the job in the loading lift time slot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 The Sapphire Floors &ndash; Fast Moving for Mid-Rise Flats</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have fast-moving families who need to move on weekends. We have done many special cases here like:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Multiple same-day shifting</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture dismantling and assembly</li>\r\n	<li>Office + home combined shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏡 Florence Residency &ndash; Experience Full-Villa Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Florence Residency has villa type homes with:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>More furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Personal car-bike</li>\r\n	<li>Outside garden items</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done safe shifting from modular kitchen to complete library.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Why is ShiftingPort&#39;s local experience invaluable for Sector 52?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Information about gate rules, moving time, lift limit, guard protocol of every society</li>\r\n	<li>Our team has entry pass and contact history of every society</li>\r\n	<li>Pre-loaded mapping &ndash; which truck will go where, is planned in advance</li>\r\n	<li>Help clients in getting permission from society</li>\r\n	<li>Same-day shifting in emergency cases (hospital shift, quick transfer)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nIt is difficult to find Packers and Movers who know every block, every building, and every rule of Sector 52 Gurgaon - but ShiftingPort is a trusted name that is recognized by everyone from the local guard to the society manager.</p>', '<h2>🙋 Sector 52 Gurgaon Packers and Movers &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) and Calls to Action</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q1: Can ShiftingPort do Home Shifting in Sector 52 in One Day?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, absolutely! Whether your home is up to 1BHK, 2BHK or 3BHK, we do packing, loading, transport and unloading in the same day &mdash; without any delay. We have completed the entire moving in 4 hours at Florence Residency and Sapphire Floors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q2: How much does Packers and Movers cost in Sector 52?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ The rate depends on the size of your home or office, distance and service level. Usually local shifting of 1BHK starts from ₹3,999 and 3BHK goes up to ₹9,000&ndash;₹14,000. Bike/Car moving and storage rates are added separately.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q3: Do you provide safe packing of Electronics and Crockery?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, we use 5-layer bubble wrap, thermocol, crates and fragile labels for fragile items like glass, TV, microwave, laptop and crockery. Many clients in Sector 52 have rated our packing style 5★.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q4: Do you do office shifting on weekends?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, we have shifted many offices in Sector 52 and nearby areas on Sunday or night hours &ndash; so that work does not stop. Server, networking system, workstation dismantling &ndash; everything is handled by expert team.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q5: Is tracking and insurance available for bike/car moving?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, we also offer you GPS tracking link and optional insurance up to ₹5 lakh. Enclosed hydraulic trucks are used for cars and wooden crate packing for bikes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q6: How to book ShiftingPort for Sector 52?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ It&#39;s very simple! Call or WhatsApp the number below, and we will book your free survey within 30 minutes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q7: Does ShiftingPort Packers and Movers help in getting permission from the Society?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, most of the societies in Sector 52 Gurgaon require permission and gate pass before moving. Our team helps you with letter format, timing coordination and guard dealing - be it Ardee City or Sushant Estate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q8: Do you guys also do unpacking and furniture setup?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! We don&#39;t just shift and leave - our packages can include unpacking, furniture assembling (like beds, dining tables), and kitchen basic setup if required. We have provided this special service to many elderly clients in Sector 52.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q9: If it rains, will the luggage be safe?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes, all our packing is rainproof &mdash; and the truck uses waterproof flooring, tarp sheets and side wall padding. Additionally, every fragile item is wrapped in bubble wrap and moisture control packing. Your luggage is completely safe even in the rain.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q10: Do you also move to other cities like Noida, Jaipur or Chandigarh?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Absolutely! ShiftingPort Packers and Movers does All India Move from Sector 52 Gurgaon. We have dedicated container trucks, tracking, and express delivery facility for different cities. Be it 150KM or 1500KM &ndash; our service is equally reliable at every distance.</p>', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon | ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon, Packers a Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon, Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 52, Packers Movers in Gurgaon Sector 52, Home Shifting Services Sector 52, Office Relocation Gurgaon, Car and Bike Transport Gurgaon, Packers and Movers Near Me, best packers and movers gurgaon sector 52', 'Home, office, car or bike – get the services of trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 52 Gurgaon with ShiftingPort, fast and safe shifting within budget.', '2025-07-14 12:05:19', '2025-07-14 13:01:07'),
(102, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 40, 1, 1, 1, 43, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 53', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-53', '1999', NULL, 'For home, office, car-bike or storage shifting in societies like Ireo, Parsvnath and Belmonte in Sector 53 Gurgaon, trust ShiftingPort – Safe, Fast, Budget Friendly.', '<h2>🏘️ Need for Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon and the real challenges of shifting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 53 in Gurgaon is not just a pin code but a premium lifestyle zone &ndash; right next to Golf Course Road, where high-rise and luxury societies like Parsvnath Exotica, Ireo Grand Arch, Vipul Belmonte, and Bestech Park View are located. People here don&rsquo;t just shift their homes, they move an entire setup &ndash; including memories, furniture, electronics and entire emotions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The need for Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon is not just limited to a truck and labour &ndash; it requires a professional, trusted and locally experienced team that understands the rules, parking rules, lift schedules and moving timings of each society.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔎 Why is shifting not easy in Sector 53?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>1. High-Security Societies:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>In societies like Parsvnath Exotica, Ireo and Central Park III, no truck can enter without pre-approval. Packers and Movers have to get proper entry permission, lift time slot and security clearance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>2. Limited Parking &amp; Timing Windows:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Due to Golf Course Road traffic and society rules, moving is allowed only between 10AM&ndash;5PM. There can be no delay.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>3. High-Value Items:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 53 flats have crockery sets, LED panels, glass furniture, imported d&eacute;cor, and branded kitchen appliances &ndash; which cannot be moved by normal loaders.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>4. Professionalism of the staff:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The customers here are educated, busy and perfection-seeking. They need skilled staff &ndash; who can understand without even asking which sofa to dismantle and which fragile item to place on top.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛠️ How does ShiftingPort fulfill every need of Sector 53?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon understands every corner, every society, and every moving rule of this area. In the last 2 years we have:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Shifted 50+ houses safely</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Relocated 15+ offices over the weekend without business halt</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Moved 30+ cars and bikes scratch-free</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Kept 10+ clients&#39; belongings securely in temporary storage</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team conducts a free pre-move survey before every move so that the client knows the exact cost and process. Also:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture is disassembled according to the height of the lift</li>\r\n	<li>🔹If needed, Night Shifting or Sunday Shifting is also arranged</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dedicated Moving Supervisor is also provided for premium clients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>🚛 Packers and Movers Services in Sector 53 Gurgaon &ndash; Home, Office, Car, Bike &amp; Storage, All in One Place</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 53 Gurgaon is not just an area of luxury societies, it is an area with daily demand of hundreds of relocations every week. Every client here is smart, precise and time-conscious. He needs reliable Packers and Movers who can manage every type of moving as per his lifestyle &ndash; that too without any hassles and hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>At ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon, that is what we do &ndash; end-to-end moving solutions, whether you are shifting from a 1BHK to a 5BHK home, relocating a startup office or wanting to move your SUV to another city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting &ndash; Safe and smooth moving for every flat and villa</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done every type of moving in Sector 53 societies like Ardee City Extension, Parsvnath Exotica, Ireo Grand Arch &ndash; from 1RK studios to 4BHK fully-furnished apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our home shifting service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Free Site Visit and Estimation</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Premium packing material: Bubble wrap, thermocol, stretch sheets</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dismantle and re-fit of Almirah, Bed, Sofa</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Safe handling of crockery, TV, AC and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Unpacking and Furniture Setup on demand</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Guards and lift permission are also our responsibility</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Relocation &ndash; Office shifting without any downtime</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many consultants, architects, designers and tech firms operate in Golf Course Road and Sector 53. We offer them hassle-free office relocation:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Workstations, Tables, Conference Setup dismantle and re-install</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Safe packing of IT Equipment (Servers, Routers, Printers)</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Night / Weekend Relocation, so that work time is not interrupted</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Packing of confidential files and documents in lockable box</li>\r\n	<li>🔹GST invoice, signed handover protocol and instant delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We believe &ndash; &ldquo;Your Office, Your Data &ndash; Our Responsibility.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 3. Car and Bike Relocation &ndash; Sector 53 to All India Move</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Car and bike moving has become a common need in Sector 53 Gurgaon &ndash; especially when a family shifts to another city. ShiftingPort has:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Enclosed Car Carrier &ndash; for SUV, Sedan and Luxury Cars</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Hydraulic Ramp Loading &ndash; No Scratches or Shocks</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Wooden Crate Packing + Bubble Wrap &ndash; for Bikes</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Insurance option up to ₹10 Lakhs</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Verified Moves from Sector 53 to Noida, Lucknow, Mumbai, Jaipur, Bangalore</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>You just give the RC and keys &ndash; the rest is ours.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage Facility &ndash; When you need to store your belongings but don&rsquo;t have space</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many clients in Sector 53 need short term storage when:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹The new house is not ready</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Renovation is underway</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Company transfer date is not fixed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort offers safe and affordable warehousing services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Storage with CCTV and 24&times;7 security</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Moisture-proof and dust-controlled atmosphere</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Starting at ₹299/box/month</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sofa, table, electronics, mattress, files, scooter &ndash; everything can be stored</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Monthly / Weekly plans + Pickup &amp; Drop also available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 Why ShiftingPort is the most trusted Packers and Movers in Sector 53?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔧 Entire team locally trained &ndash; no outsourced labour</li>\r\n	<li>📦 500+ successful move experience in Sector 53</li>\r\n	<li>📍 GPS tracking + On-call supervisor</li>\r\n	<li>🧾 Written quotation &ndash; no hidden costs</li>\r\n	<li>🏢 Complete knowledge of security rules of every society</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>🚚 Home Shifting, Office Relocation, Car-Bike Moving and Storage in Sector 53 Gurgaon &ndash; One stop shop, with trust</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 53 Gurgaon is not just a location but a smart shifting zone. Every week hundreds of families and offices are relocating in many premium societies of Ireo Grand Arch, Parsvnath Exotica, Vipul Belmonte and Golf Course Road. In such a situation, just lifting the goods and loading them on the truck is not enough &ndash; you need Packers and Movers who understand each service in detail and execute it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon brings you four services from one place &ndash; all without tension, with trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 1. Home Shifting &ndash; Customized moving for every flat and villa in Sector 53</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Moving in the multi-storey societies of Sector 53 is not everyone&rsquo;s cup of tea. Time slots are limited, there are rules on lift usage and security is very tight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort does this work with complete planning:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Pre-Move Survey and Cost Estimation</li>\r\n	<li>Special packing for Glass Crockery, TV, AC, Furniture</li>\r\n	<li>Goods prepared and shifted as per lift slot</li>\r\n	<li>Unpacking, setup and return of old cartons</li>\r\n	<li>Verified successful shifts from Florence Residency to Ireo</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 2. Office Shifting &ndash; Smart and Silent Moving on Golf Course Road</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many consulting firms, coaching setups and corporate back offices operate in Sector 53. Moving here means &ndash; shifting the goods without disturbing the system.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&rsquo;s Office Relocation includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dismantle and refit of Workstations, Conference tables, Printers, Routers</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Static-proof packing for IT Items</li>\r\n	<li>Option of Night Move or Sunday Move</li>\r\n	<li>Lockable boxes for confidential files</li>\r\n	<li>GST bill and corporate quote support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have done verified moving in buildings like Golf Course Towers and One Horizon Centre.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 🛵 3. Car and Bike Relocation &ndash; Intercity Move, without a Scratch</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>When one is moving from Sector 53 to Delhi, Noida or Bangalore &ndash; shifting the car or bike becomes equally important.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our service includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🚗 Car Moving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Enclosed Container Truck</li>\r\n	<li>Hydraulic loading &ndash; No dents or scratches</li>\r\n	<li>Insurance option up to ₹10 lakhs</li>\r\n	<li>Fast delivery &ndash; Pan India in 3 to 7 days</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>🛵 Bike Moving:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Bubble + Foam + Wooden crate packing</li>\r\n	<li>All India door-to-door service</li>\r\n	<li>Set packing for every model from Scooty to Bullet</li>\r\n	<li>Insurance and live tracking link</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have moved many clients&#39; Creta, Honda City, Royal Enfield and Jupiter no scratch from Sector 53.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 4. Storage &ndash; When the house is not ready or there is too much stuff</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many times the house is not ready or the exact joining date is not cleared from the company &ndash; in such a situation there is a need to temporarily store some stuff.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our storage services in Sector 53 are popular for:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>CCTV secured warehouses</li>\r\n	<li>Moisture-proof and dust-free atmosphere</li>\r\n	<li>Box plans starting from ₹299</li>\r\n	<li>Can store up to sofa, washing machine, kitchen items</li>\r\n	<li>Pickup and Delivery included</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔒 Why people choose ShiftingPort in Sector 53?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Information on every society&rsquo;s moving rules</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Transparent rates, no hidden charges</li>\r\n	<li>✅ 4.9★ Rating</li>\r\n	<li>✅ GPS-enabled trucks and trained in-house staff</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Support even after moving &ndash; feedback and assistance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Our motto is: &ldquo;We shift trust, not stuff.&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>💰 Packers and Movers Rates in Sector 53 Gurgaon &ndash; Reliable Moving at Affordable Prices</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>People in Sector 53 Gurgaon want more than just convenience in shifting, but also transparency.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>That&rsquo;s why ShiftingPort provides a clear rate list for each package &ndash; so you know upfront how much it will cost, what all is included, and there are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Home Shifting Rates &ndash; Flexible packages as per Sector 53</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Home Type</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Cost (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Included Services</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1RK / 1BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,500 &ndash; ₹5,500</td>\r\n			<td>Packing, Loading, Truck, Unloading</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>2BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹5,500 &ndash; ₹8,500</td>\r\n			<td>Bubble Wrap, Dismantle/Re-fit, Basic Unpacking</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>3BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,000 &ndash; ₹13,500</td>\r\n			<td>Furniture Fitting, Fragile Packing, Labeling</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>4BHK / 5BHK</td>\r\n			<td>₹14,000 &ndash; ₹20,000</td>\r\n			<td>Extra Helpers, Full Unpacking &amp; Setup</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Verified shifting records at Ireo Grand Arch, Florence Residency and Parsvnath Exotica.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Office Relocation Rates &ndash; Time-sensitive and Efficient Moving</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Office Size</th>\r\n			<th>Estimated Cost (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Included Services</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Small (5 Seats)</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000 &ndash; ₹6,500</td>\r\n			<td>Table, Chairs, Computer Packing</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Medium (10&ndash;20 Seats)</td>\r\n			<td>₹8,000 &ndash; ₹15,000</td>\r\n			<td>Network Equipment, File Racks, AC Handling</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Large Office</td>\r\n			<td>₹16,000 &ndash; ₹30,000</td>\r\n			<td>Weekend Moving, Dismantling, IT Support</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ No extra charge for Night/Weekend shifting &ndash; advance slot booking required.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 🛵 Car/Bike Moving Rates &ndash; All India Transport</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Vehicle Type</th>\r\n			<th>Local (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Intercity (₹)</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike / Scooter</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,200 &ndash; ₹1,800</td>\r\n			<td>₹2,500 &ndash; ₹4,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bullet / Cruiser</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,800 &ndash; ₹2,800</td>\r\n			<td>₹3,800 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Sedan Car</td>\r\n			<td>₹4,000 &ndash; ₹6,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,500 &ndash; ₹9,500</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>SUV / Luxury Car</td>\r\n			<td>₹6,000 &ndash; ₹8,000</td>\r\n			<td>₹9,500 &ndash; ₹14,000</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Enclosed carrier, insurance, tracking link all included.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Storage Facility Rates &ndash; Safe and Affordable</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<thead>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<th>Storage Type</th>\r\n			<th>Monthly Charges (₹)</th>\r\n			<th>Facilities</th>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</thead>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Box Storage</td>\r\n			<td>₹299 / box</td>\r\n			<td>CCTV Room, Moisture-Free</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Furniture Room</td>\r\n			<td>₹999 / month</td>\r\n			<td>Large Unit, Pest Control</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>Bike Storage</td>\r\n			<td>₹499 / month</td>\r\n			<td>Lockable Covered Shed</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td>1BHK Goods</td>\r\n			<td>₹1,499 &ndash; ₹2,499</td>\r\n			<td>Complete Household with Pickup &amp; Drop</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>➡️ Short term (7 days) and Long term (3 months+) plans available.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>💬 Trust is built when rates are clear</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort never gives you a vague quote or extra charge in the name of GST.<br />\r\nWe give you:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Written quotation</li>\r\n	<li>Item-wise listing of goods</li>\r\n	<li>Transparent GST billing</li>\r\n	<li>No advance, no broker policy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>So that you just move, we take care of the rest.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>🏢 Sector 53 Gurgaon&rsquo;s top societies and local experience of ShiftingPort Packers</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 53 Gurgaon is an area where premium living is the perfect ambiance amidst lush green avenues, wide roads and the splendor of Golf Course Road. The specialty of this sector is its high-rise, guarded and rule-based societies where shifting is not just a logistical task but a systematic and local-feeling task.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon has worked in some of the biggest, most secure and busiest societies of the area over the years &ndash; and has always given the customer a seamless shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏙️ Ireo Grand Arch &ndash; Luxury Flats, Tight Security, High Expectation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The people living here are high profile professionals who are short on time and value their belongings very high. For moving here:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Moving time slot has to be booked from the society office</li>\r\n	<li>Lift is allowed only during service hours</li>\r\n	<li>Clients are very cautious about fragile items and imported furniture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team has done 20+ successful movings in Ireo Grand Arch &ndash; from unpacking to setup, everything was flawless.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Parsvnath Exotica &ndash; Spacious Flats, Dedicated Basement Routes</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>This society is known for its large flats and two separate basement access points.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While working here ShiftingPort:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Furniture dismantling and lift measurement has to be pre-planned</li>\r\n	<li>Items have to be divided into different loading slots</li>\r\n	<li>Car/Bike moving also has to be planned as many clients move intercity</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>We have also done 4BHK + SUV shifting here in a single day &ndash; no scratch, no delay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏘️ Vipul Belmonte &ndash; Premium Class, VIP Entry Rules</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Moving at Vipul Belmonte is not just a formal permission &ndash; you have to submit SOCIETY FORM, security clearance and lift deposit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&rsquo;s local SOP is so strong that our team:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Fills all the forms on your behalf</li>\r\n	<li>Aligns the approval slot with the SOCIETY</li>\r\n	<li>Helps in returning the forms and refunding the deposit after delivery</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The seamless record of 15+ movings proves our trust.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏢 Tivoli Terraces, Central Park 2 &ndash; Fast Weekend Movers</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In these mid-size premium societies, clients want weekend or evening moving. There is a demand for time-sensitive shifting here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Does same-day shifting from Saturday to Sunday</li>\r\n	<li>Brings 5-layer packing for crockery and electronics</li>\r\n	<li>Complete unpacking and setup in 6 hours</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Local Experience which is visible not only on Google but also on ground</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Our team knows the gate rules, lift timings, parking access of every society in advance</li>\r\n	<li>We arrange for entry letters, ID cards and society stamp before the client</li>\r\n	<li>In emergency shifts (hospital case, job urgency) we have truck ready in 3 hours</li>\r\n	<li>Keeping in mind the convenience of elders, women and children, we send polite staff</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>🙋 Sector 53 Gurgaon Packers and Movers &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) and Easy Contact</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q1: Can ShiftingPort do Same Day Home Shifting in Sector 53?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! We have completed 1BHK and 2BHK shifting in 4&ndash;6 hours in many societies of Sector 53 like Ireo Grand Arch, Parsvnath Exotica, and Belmonte. If the lift slot is booked on time, we can easily handle the Same-Day moving process.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q2: What is the cost of Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Our rates are completely transparent. Starting from ₹3,500 for 1BHK, and 3BHK or 4BHK shifting goes up to ₹12,000. This includes packing, loading, transport, and unloading. No hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q3: Do you shift bikes or cars to other cities?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Absolutely! We provide wooden crate + bubble packing for bikes and enclosed container truck for cars. Noida, Jaipur, Mumbai, Bangalore &ndash; safe moving is available everywhere.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q4: Can you move office in weekend or night shift?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! Many companies and startups in Sector 53 have chosen us for weekend/night office relocation so that business is not interrupted. We also have trained IT movers and dismantle specialists.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q5: Does ShiftingPort take care of society permission, guard entry and lift time?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! We know the moving policies of societies like Ireo, Parsvnath, Vipul in advance. Our coordinator arranges permission form, entry pass and lift slot in advance so that the client does not have any hassle.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q6: Is your staff verified and trained?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ 100% verified, uniformed and background checked staff. They are courteous, punctual and trained &ndash; to make the shifting experience smooth and tension-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q7: Are ShiftingPort Packers and Movers able to move lift items in the society damage-free?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! Our team uses special trolley, corner padding and floor protection for lift moving. We have done 100+ safe lift-shiftings in high-rise societies of Sector 53 &ndash; without any breakage.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q8: Is the inspection and estimate of items free before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Absolutely! We conduct a free pre-move survey for every client. This gives you the most accurate packing requirement, time, and cost &ndash; without any advance payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q9: Are your services limited to Sector 53 only or are they available in other areas of Gurgaon as well?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ We provide full-range Packers and Movers service not only in Sector 53 but also in DLF Phase, Sector 54, 56, Sushant Lok, South City, Palam Vihar. We are ready to shift anywhere in Gurgaon.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓Q10: What compensation is given if the delivery of goods is late?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>✅ Yes! Our time commitment is written on every moving. If there is an unreasonable delay due to us, we also process partial refund or compensation - because nothing is better than trust.</p>', 'Top Packers and Movers in Sector 53 Gurgaon - ShiftingPort', 'packers and movers in sector 53 gurgaon, home shifting services gurgaon, car and bike relocation sector 53, office relocation in sector 53, movers and packers golf course road, packers and movers in gurgaon sector 53, packers and movers gurgaon sector 53, packers and movers near me', 'Shifting of house, office, car-bike is now easy in Sector 53 Gurgaon. ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provide reliable, safe and budget friendly service.', '2025-07-14 14:45:58', '2025-07-14 15:08:03');
