al identity in Sector 59:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Verified crew with ID &amp; background check</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Complete knowledge of society&#39;s lift, basement and main gate</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Timed entry, security clearance and local RWA coordination</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Every service comes with GST invoice and insurance cover</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Now shifting in Sector 59 Gurgaon is not just fast, it is smart and safe too &ndash; only with ShiftingPort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>👉<strong> Call today and get free survey + on-the-spot quotation.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Shifting in Sector 59 is not easy &ndash; but with ShiftingPort everything is easy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 59 Gurgaon is a high-end, highly regulated and well-maintained residential sector. Shifting to societies like Conscient Elevate, Mahindra Luminare, Tata Raisina Residency etc. brings many technical challenges at the local level.&nbsp;But ShiftingPort has solved all of these with deep understanding and smart execution.&nbsp;That is why when people of Sector 59 search for &ldquo;Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59&rdquo;, they trust ShiftingPort only.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚫 Challenge 1: Entry is not possible without Gate-Pass &amp; RWA Approval</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In all the societies here, shifting is not allowed without prior gate-pass and RWA written permission. Lift usage time is also fixed &ndash; like from 10 am to 5 pm only.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>✅ ShiftingPort&rsquo;s Solution:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We already know the RWA rules and timing policies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We fill the gate-pass on your behalf, get the lift-booking done from the society office and manage the time slot for truck entry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Challenge 2: Fear of damage to high-end furniture and d&eacute;cor</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Italian furniture, designer lighting, glass panels and imported wooden flooring are common in luxury flats. Even a small scratch can cause a loss of lakhs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>✅ Solution for ShiftingPort:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We use custom foam sheets, furniture covers, corner guards and imported bubble wrap.<br />\r\nLarge furniture is dismantled and packed in special crates.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Plus, we also offer insurance option for damage cover.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Challenge 3: Bringing goods from the basement and limitations of the lift</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In many societies of Sector 59, bringing goods from the basement to the ground and then sending them upstairs through the lift is a systematic process. There is a weight and size limit inside the lift.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>✅ ShiftingPort Solution:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have narrow trolleys, stair harness, soft wheel rollers and low-noise tools.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Lift floors are covered with padding to prevent any damage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team is trained in manual carry technique along with lift.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚫 Challenge 4: Vehicle Entry is Restricted on Weekend or Public Holiday</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In Sector 59 societies, the entry of heavy vehicles or shifting trucks is restricted on weekends. This can spoil the entire shifting schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>✅ ShiftingPort Solution:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>We do weekday pre-scheduling in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If it is necessary to move on a weekend, then we adopt a light vehicle-based split-shift method.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We also manage special permission for late evening or early morning shifts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ ShiftingPort Why is Smart Packers and Movers in Sector 59?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>From ground-level RWA dealing to personal floor access, we have a grip</li>\r\n	<li>Every building layout, truck entry route and lift dimensions already mapped</li>\r\n	<li>Local supervisor who is familiar with the ground realities of Sector 59</li>\r\n	<li>No confusion, no delay &ndash; just smooth shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Shifting in Sector 59 Gurgaon demands a plan-based execution &ndash; and ShiftingPort is the most trusted name for it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>👉 <strong>If you too want a tension-free shifting experience, we are just a call away.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>ShiftingPort Process &ndash; Every Step of Professional Shifting in Sector 59 Gurgaon</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59 is not just a service, it is a complete process &mdash; from planning to unpacking, every step is thoughtfully and safely executed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort is the first choice of premium clients in Sector 59 because we provide a well-structured, time-bound and local-society-friendly shifting experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Step 1: Free Survey and Real-Time Quotation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>First, our local field expert conducts a survey at your home or virtually &mdash; to understand the quantity of goods, floor number, lift access and truck entry points.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Society&#39;s RWA rules are confirmed in advance</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Customized quotation is given on the same day</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Transparent charges &ndash; no hidden cost</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📅 Step 2: Date Finalization and RWA Coordination</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Gate-pass, lift timing and entry permission are mandatory before shifting to Sector 59 societies like Conscient Elevate or Mahindra Luminare.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹We fill up gate-pass forms</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Book a Truck entry timing slot</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Fix a Lift usage window (usually 10am&ndash;5pm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Step 3: Packing Day &ndash; Material &amp; Team On-Site</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>On the day of shifting, our trained team arrives on time with complete packing material:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹3-layer wrapping for crockery, glass items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Sofa, bed, tables dismantled and packed in protective wrap</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Foam-sheet and corner guards for artwork, electronics and fragile items</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Items labelled &ndash; room-wise and category-wise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚛 Step 4: Loading &ndash; Secure Handling with Lift &amp; Stair Friendly Tools</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Luxury flats in Sector 59 have a limitation on lift usage &mdash; so we adopt a smart loading technique:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Protecting lift interiors with padding</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Moving with narrow trolleys and soft-wheel carts</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Dismantling furniture and compact loading</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Basement Moving goods from parking to truck &ndash; without any disturbance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Step 5: Transport &ndash; Safe, Fast and Real-Time Tracking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&rsquo;s vehicle fleet is specially customized for urban shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Closed body container trucks</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Hydraulic lift-enabled loading ramps</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Live GPS tracking</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Protection checks at mid-route halts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📤 Step 6: Unloading &amp; Setup at New Location</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>At destination, the team safely unloads goods into the flat:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Heavy items are safely lifted by lift or stairs</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Furniture re-installation and appliance setup</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Placing goods in labeled rooms</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Clearance of waste material and empty boxes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧾 Step 7: Final Checklist &amp; Feedback</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>After everything is safely completed:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹Final checklist is matched</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Client sign-off and satisfaction is verified</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Feedback form is given (or online link is sent)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>✅ Why Sector Every society in Sector 59 trusts ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>🔹There is no confusion in the process &ndash; every step is clear and documented</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Entry rules, basement access and lift instructions of every society in Sector 59 are already updated with us</li>\r\n	<li>🔹Our Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59 team coordinates directly with RWA, security and admin</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) &ndash; Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓1. Does ShiftingPort follow Sector 59 Gurgaon RWA Policies?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> ✅ Yes, we work with full understanding of each society&rsquo;s RWA guidelines.&nbsp;We handle gate-pass, lift-booking, truck entry timing and security coordination ourselves &mdash; so you don&rsquo;t have to worry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓2. Can ShiftingPort help me move to a luxury society like Mahindra Luminare or Tata Raisina Residency?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Absolutely. Our team has experience in high-end societies like Mahindra Luminare, Conscient Elevate, Paras Floret and 4S The Aurrum.&nbsp;We shift luxury furniture, artwork, and designer interior with special protection.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓3. Does your service include both packing material and unpacking?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes. We provide foam wrap, bubble sheet, stretch film, carton box, and even wooden crate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also included is unpacking and placing items in labeled rooms, furniture reassembly and clearing used boxes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓4. Does ShiftingPort do shifting on weekends or holidays?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, there are certain restrictions in Sector 59 societies but we can arrange weekend shifting with permission in advance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We make the process smooth by booking light vehicle-based shifts or early morning slots.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓5. Do I need to take permission from the society myself before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ No, if you are shifting with ShiftingPort, we manage everything from permission forms, RWA approvals and lift slot booking on your behalf.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All you need to do is confirm the shifting date.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓6. Are your services insured?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Yes, we provide optional insurance cover with every shifting &ndash; which provides full protection in case of accidental damage or loss.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can add insurance at the time of quotation itself.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓7. Do you also shift cars or bikes from Sector 59?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Absolutely. We deliver cars and bikes safely door-to-door in covered carriers with hydraulic ramp.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For luxury vehicles we use enclosed transport and tyre-lock system.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>❓8. How many days in advance should I book shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>✅ Ideally it is better to book 2 to 4 days in advance &ndash; so that gate-pass, lift timing and manpower can be arranged smoothly.<br />\r\nEmergency shifting is also available (subject to availability).</p>', 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59 – ShiftingPort (Verified)', 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 59, Packers Movers in Sector 59 Gurgaon, Shifting Services Sector 59 Gurgaon, Home Shifting Sector 59 Gurgaon, Office Relocation Sector 59 Gurgaon, Car Transport Sector 59 Gurgaon, Bike Shifting Services Sector 59, ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Gurgaon, Trusted Packers Sector 59 Gurgaon, Top Rated Movers Sector 59, Local Packers and Movers Gurgaon 59, Sector 59 Flat Shifting Experts, Luxury Home Shifting in Sector 59', 'ShiftingPort provides Top Rated Packers and Movers services in Sector 59 Gurgaon. Home, Office, Car-Bike shifting with RWA, Lift Booking and Zero Damage Guarantee.', '2025-07-17 17:21:22', '2025-07-17 17:21:22'),
(109, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 46, 1, 1, 1, 50, 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60', NULL, 'packers-and-movers-gurgaon-sector-60', '1999', NULL, 'The search for reliable Packers and Movers in Sector 60 Gurgaon is over! ShiftingPort brings fast, safe and smart shifting services - home or office, we take care of everything, without hassles and delays.', '<h2>Packers and Movers Gurgaon&nbsp;Sector 60 &ndash; Premium Lifestyle and the real need of Shifting</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 60 Gurgaon is one of the most planned and premium residential pockets of Gurgaon today. The societies here &ndash; Ireo Skyon, Birla Navya, Adani Samsara &ndash; don&rsquo;t just have flats, but reflect a class-class lifestyle. But when people shift to such a refined environment, they need equally premium Packers and Movers who manage every aspect professionally.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And this is where ShiftingPort comes into the picture &ndash; your trusted local shifting expert team, who understands the ground reality of Sector 60, the RWA rules of the societies, and the expectations of the residents.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏙️ Sector 60 &ndash; Where people don&rsquo;t compromise on Luxury</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 60&rsquo;s gated societies like Ireo Skyon have high-rise luxury flats that include automated homes, modern elevators and basement parking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Birla Navya is a township-style society perfect for large families and senior citizens, while Adani Samsara is a low-rise luxury residential enclave where independent living and privacy are taken care of.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All this means that just sending a truck and labour is not enough when shifting.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You need a Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 partner who can:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Get approval from RWA before lift use</li>\r\n	<li>Carry out furniture dismantling and reassembly without damage</li>\r\n	<li>Take care of silent hours and neighbour disturbance</li>\r\n	<li>Manage packing-unpacking timing as per society rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort follows all these protocols meticulously, making your experience seamless.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>👪 Who are Shifting to Sector 60?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>1. Corporate professionals from Delhi/NCR &ndash; looking for 3 or 4BHK flats in societies like Birla Navya or Skyon</li>\r\n	<li>2. Family buyers upgrading from Sector 45, 56 or Sohna Road &ndash; looking for better amenities and safer environment</li>\r\n	<li>3. Tenants moving from rental to ownership &ndash; especially in builder floors like Adani Samsara</li>\r\n	<li>4. Senior couples and NRI families &ndash; looking for a peaceful, clutter-free and managed relocation</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort has a customized approach for all these profiles. Our motto is &ndash; every household shifting is a different journey, complete it with respect and care.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 Why are Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 trending?</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ The number of people shifting to societies has increased rapidly</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Most of the high-value furniture and appliances are a safety concern</li>\r\n	<li>✅ There is complexity of gate-pass, lift permission and truck entry slots</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Users are now looking for an organised process, not just trucks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort delivers all this &ndash; Smart planning, Safe packing, and Punctual execution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Main reasons for shifting to Sector 60 Gurgaon &ndash; Why are people moving here?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The landscape of Sector 60 Gurgaon has changed rapidly in the last few years. The area is now not just a residential sector but a premium lifestyle destination. Societies like Ireo Skyon, Adani Samsara, and Birla Navya have made this sector attractive for the elite class. But the question is &ndash; why are people shifting here?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort&rsquo;s field team receives clients daily who contact us for relocation in Sector 60. Their needs vary, but the reasons for 80% of relocation cases are common:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠1. Old houses have become small, children have grown up</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many families who have been living in places like Sector 46, 39 or Palam Vihar for years now want to move to a calm, modern and clean area.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Flats like Birla Navya and Skyon offer extra space &ndash; and everything from lift to security is automatic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Such clients tell us &ndash; &ldquo;Sir, take care of your belongings&hellip; the TV is new, dining is imported &ndash; it shouldn&rsquo;t even get scratched.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We work accordingly &ndash; blanket wrapping, corner-guarding, and lift booking are all done from our side.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛜 2. Need for Hybrid Work &amp; Peaceful Living</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>In the post-pandemic lifestyle, Gurgaon professionals now want a place that balances work and personal life.<br />\r\nBirla Navya&#39;s township-style layout, parks, and less crowded ambience are perfect for working couples and remote workers. These are the things people demand while shifting:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Furniture disassembly &amp; reassembly</li>\r\n	<li>Office setup shifting (tables, monitors, UPS etc.)</li>\r\n	<li>Silent moving without society disturbance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort handles all these micro-expectations at the ground level &ndash; hence we get repeat clients too.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🛬 3. NRI &amp; Senior Citizen Relocation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many NRI families and elderly couples are also shifting in Sector 60 &ndash; especially in Birla Navya and Adani Samsara. These relocations require care and patience, not speed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team handles house shifting not like a checklist but as a family responsibility. From medicines, kitchen containers, pooja samagri to clothes &ndash; every item is labelled and handled softly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚚 4. Transition from Tenant to Owner</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>People who were earlier living on rent in Gurgaon are now buying their dream home in areas like Sector 60. For them, shifting is not just a matter of moving stuff, it is an emotional event &ndash; and in such a situation, ShiftingPort&rsquo;s personal approach gives them emotional comfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔁 Relocation Pattern:</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Delhi &rarr; Gurgaon Sector 60</li>\r\n	<li>Sector 56/57 &rarr; Sector 60</li>\r\n	<li>Sohna Road &rarr; Sector 60</li>\r\n	<li>NRI return &rarr; Sector 60</li>\r\n	<li>Tenant &rarr; Owner (local shifting within Gurgaon)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For all these profiles, we provide completely customizable shifting services.</p>', '<h2>ShiftingPort Services in Sector 60 Gurgaon &ndash; A Reliable Solution for Every Need</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Sector 60 Gurgaon is not a common area. The people, societies and shifting needs here &ndash; everything is a little different and premium.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ShiftingPort understands this, so we are not just a team of baggage movers &ndash; we customize our service to suit every client.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now let us tell you one by one what services we provide at Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 and how they are different from others.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🏠 Home Shifting</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Be it Ireo Skyon or Birla Navya &ndash; shifting houses in these societies is not easy. Fixing lift-booking, gate-pass and timings with RWA is the biggest problem.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What does ShiftingPort do?</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>We visit the site a day before</li>\r\n	<li>Block the lift and entry slots beforehand</li>\r\n	<li>Dismantle and wrap large items like sofa, bed, dining</li>\r\n	<li>Pack glasses, crockery and electronics with bubble wrap and thermocol</li>\r\n	<li>Proper label on every carton &ndash; so that there is no confusion during unpacking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our team does not do &ldquo;let&rsquo;s hurry up&rdquo; work &ndash; we do shifting calmly, neat &amp; clean.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🧑&zwj;💼 Office Relocation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many people in Sector 60 are moving from work-from-home setup to full office, and some people are shifting both home and office.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ground floor flats in Adani Samsara often have small offices or studio setups &ndash; shifting them is also a different challenge.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our services:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Safe packing of computers, chairs, tables, files</li>\r\n	<li>Unplugging and packing WiFi/router, UPS, printers etc.</li>\r\n	<li>Lock box shifting of sensitive documents</li>\r\n	<li>Furniture re-installation in new setup</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>🚗 Car and bike transportation</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide safe vehicle shifting for those going out-of-state from Sector 60. Be it a BMW or an Activa &ndash; our team delivers it door-to-door in company-approved carriers.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Carriers with hydraulic ramps</li>\r\n	<li>Door-pickup and delivery</li>\r\n	<li>Insurance option available</li>\r\n	<li>Loading&ndash;unloading on time, without delay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>📦 Packing &amp; Unpacking</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Many clients say &ndash; &ldquo;Bhai, we will not be able to pack!&rdquo; and this is true &ndash; packing delicate items is not everyone&rsquo;s cup of tea. Our trained team does these works in detail:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Kitchen packing takes the most time &ndash; we do layer packing of glass wrapping, bartan</li>\r\n	<li>Clothes are shifted by hanging them straight in wardrobe boxes</li>\r\n	<li>Separate wrapping material and thermocol sheets for TV, AC, fridge</li>\r\n	<li>Unpacking and re-setting furniture in the new house</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>⛳ Extra Services (which no one gives)</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Lift booking and gate pass approval</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete adherence to Society rules</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Floor-wise material movement</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Waste is separated and removed</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Complete work starts and finishes on timing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 &ndash; Complete Process of ShiftingPort, Hassle-Free</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The biggest fear of shifting is that &ldquo;something may break, it may be late, or the labour may mess it up.&rdquo;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The method of ShiftingPort is very clear and systematic &ndash; the client does not have to be told again and again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We understand the process of every society in Sector 60 Gurgaon beforehand &ndash; whether it is Ireo Skyon, Birla Navya or Adani Samsara.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The complete step-by-step process is given below, from which you will understand why ShiftingPort is trusted so much:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1️⃣ Call or WhatsApp for enquiry &ndash; Just tell the location</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>First of all you call us or send a message on WhatsApp. All you have to do is tell:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>📍 Where to pick up the goods from</li>\r\n	<li>📍 Where to reach</li>\r\n	<li>📍 How much goods is there (brother, is it 2 BHK or 4 BHK?)</li>\r\n	<li>📍 What are the special things &ndash; AC, temple, washing machine etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>2️⃣ Free Estimate through Site Visit or Video Call</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>If the client asks, we send a team for onsite survey &ndash; otherwise we get an idea through a short video call.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We finalize the final estimate, truck size, material requirement and time-slot in this.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>💬 There is no hidden charge, everything is mentioned in the open sheet.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3️⃣ Date &amp; Time Fix &ndash; Also preparation for Society Approval</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>RWA approval is very important in Sector 60 societies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We take gate pass form, ID copy etc. from the client and get the approval process done from RWA.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>🚚 Lift slot booking, security form, parking slot &mdash; everything is managed by our team.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4️⃣ Packing Day &ndash; Professional Team and High Quality Material</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>✅ Team will come at the scheduled time in the morning</li>\r\n	<li>✅ First of all fragile items, glass, electronics will be wrapped</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Heavy furniture will be dismantled and corner-wrapping will be done</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Kitchen items will be double layer packing</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Label on every box &ndash; &quot;Kitchen&quot;, &quot;Bedroom 1&quot;, &quot;Fragile&quot;, etc.</li>\r\n	<li>✅ Temple and personal items will be kept on top</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>In societies like Birla Navya, Ireo Skyon, we keep the lobby and lift damage-free by doing cushioning.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5️⃣ Loading &ndash; No noise, no hurry</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Sofa, almirah, fridge all are loaded professionally according to the lift</li>\r\n	<li>Foam padding inside the lift</li>\r\n	<li>Ground staff and flat staff &ndash; both teams work parallelly</li>\r\n	<li>No jostling or noise &ndash; completely civilized shifting</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>6️⃣ Transport &ndash; Move on time, drive safely</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We use medium to large container trucks, which are GPS enabled.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The driver is explained everything about society routes, entry timing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>⏰ No delay &ndash; If packed at 10 am, then the goods will reach the destination by 11:30 (in local shifting)</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>7️⃣ Unloading &amp; Unpacking &ndash; New house, Ready to Move</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Items are placed in the right room</li>\r\n	<li>Fragile boxes are opened under the supervision of the client</li>\r\n	<li>Beds, sofas, dining are reassembled</li>\r\n	<li>We take back the packing waste and cartons</li>\r\n	<li>The entire house is handed over to the client clean and set</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>8️⃣ Feedback &amp; Final Payment &ndash; No pressure</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Until the client is completely satisfied, we do not ask for any final payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Feedback is optional &ndash; if you want to give it, give it, otherwise there is no issue.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>📌 Special Note (Sector 60 Focused):</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>It is mandatory to book a lift at Ireo Skyon</strong> &mdash; we handle it in advance</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Adani Samsara has stairs shifting</strong> &mdash; our team is trained to lift luggage manually</li>\r\n	<li><strong>Birla Navya has tight security protocols</strong> &mdash; we handle everything from gate pass to entry</li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>❓ Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 &ndash; Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q1: Has ShiftingPort done shifting in Sector 60 societies like Ireo Skyon, Birla Navya and Adani Samsara?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> Yes, absolutely. ShiftingPort has done shifting in all these three societies many times. We are fully aware of the RWA policy, lift slot timings, and entry rules of each society. That is why our work remains smooth and damage-free.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q2: Does your team bring packing material?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We ourselves bring high-quality packing material &ndash; like bubble wrap, foam sheet, corrugated boxes, thermal sheets and stretch film. There is special packing for crockery, electronics and temple items.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q3: Does ShiftingPort also do dismantling and reassembly?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Absolutely. Sofa, bed, dining, wardrobe and modular furniture are dismantled and proper padding is done. The same team also reassembles the new house after visiting it.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q4: Is there a site survey before shifting?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, as per requirement. We either do a physical visit or see your stuff on WhatsApp video call. Based on that, truck, team size and estimate are prepared. There are no hidden charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q5: Do you guys do floor shifting in the same society?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, absolutely. Many clients shift from 1st to 7th floor or lower to higher floor in Ireo Skyon or Birla Navya. We handle this work with proper safety of lift, staircase and building walls.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q6: Is last-minute shifting also possible?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>If same day slot is available, then yes. Our ready-to-move teams are always active in Gurgaon. You can also call in the morning for emergency shifting and get it done by afternoon or evening.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q7: Do we do unpacking and waste material removal?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Yes. We do unpacking, furniture setup and collection of carton/packing waste. Our aim is to give the client a ready-to-live home.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q8: Is it necessary to get your belongings insured with ShiftingPort?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Not necessary, but beneficial. Most of Sector60 clients shift expensive furniture and electronics. We provide on-demand insurance in Packers and Movers GurgaonSector60 plan. The premium is nominal, but you get rid of the &ldquo;worry and damage&rdquo; tension.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q9: How early should I book to get a slot easily?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>Ideally 3-4 days in advance. In societies like IreoSkyon or BirlaNavya, lift-booking and gate-pass process takes time. If you want to move on a weekend, talk to Packers and Movers GurgaonSector60 team at least a week in advance. In case of emergency, we have done shifting even on 24‑hours notice &mdash; but will depend on slot availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔹 Q10: Do we need to drain petrol or change number plate in car‑bike transport?</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Answer:&nbsp;</strong>No. We use covered, hydraulic carriers where the vehicle is directly load‑locked. No need to drain petrol/diesel; just leave 2&ndash;3 litres of fuel so that the vehicle can start while unloading. There is no tampering of number plate or RC &mdash; the entire process is RTO‑compliant and you can track your vehicle through live‑tracking link.</p>', 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60 | Local Shifting Experts – ShiftingPort', 'Packers and Movers Gurgaon Sector 60, Movers and Packers Sector 60 Gurgaon, Sector 60 Shifting Services, Local Packers Gurgaon, ShiftingPort Packers Gurgaon, Packers and Movers in Gurgaon Sector 60, Packers and Movers near me', 'Want hassle-free packing & moving in Sector 60 Gurgaon? ShiftingPort brings fast, safe and professional home shifting service – call now!', '2025-07-17 18:18:46', '2025-07-17 18:18:46');
INSERT INTO `reviews` (`id`, `status`, `rating`, `page_id`, `name`, `email`, `company`, `designation`, `image`, `message`, `review_reply`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(32, 1, 5, 1, 'Sunita Joshi', 'sunita.joshi76@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The pricing was reasonable, and they provided a proper invoice and tracking. Great communication and quality of service. Highly recommended!', 'Thank you for your feedback! We\'re glad you had a smooth experience. Looking forward to serving you again!', '2025-06-14 18:01:19', '2025-06-18 16:49:21'),
(35, 1, 5, NULL, 'Rahul Mehta', 'rahul.mehta89@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers provided excellent service. The team was punctual, professional, and packed everything with care. The whole process was smooth and hassle-free. I\'m very satisfied with their service and would highly recommend them.', 'Thank you for your feedback! We\'re glad you had a smooth experience. Looking forward to serving you again!', '2025-06-18 08:43:05', '2025-06-18 16:49:16'),
(36, 1, 5, 12, 'Akash kumar', 'mr.akashakki@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I used ShiftPort to shift my home from Sector 46 in Gurugram, and the experience was great. The team was punctual, handled everything with care, and the process was smooth from start to finish. Booking through the website was easy, and there were no hidden charges. Highly recommended!', NULL, '2025-06-18 16:47:46', '2025-06-18 16:48:02'),
(39, 1, 5, 12, 'Rajeev Malhotra', 'rajeevmalhotra@gmail.com', 'RM Enterprises', 'Owner', NULL, 'I recently used Shiftingport Packers and Movers for my relocation from Gurgaon to Bangalore and I must say their service was excellent and the packing team was professional, arrived on time and handled all my belongings carefully. Everything was delivered safely and on time and highly recommended for anyone looking for reliable moving services!', NULL, '2025-06-20 20:23:03', '2025-06-24 22:53:09'),
(40, 1, 5, 27, 'Harpreet Singh', 'harpreet3098@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I recently used ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Chandigarh for my home relocation and I must say the experience was excellent. From the very first call to the final unpacking their team showed complete professionalism and care.', NULL, '2025-06-22 16:21:30', '2025-06-24 22:53:11'),
(42, 1, 5, 27, 'Jasvinder Kaur', 'jasvinderkaur4528@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I had a great experience with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers in Chandigarh. The team was punctual, packed everything with care and completed the move without any hassle. Highly recommended for safe and reliable shifting!', NULL, '2025-06-23 23:47:39', '2025-06-24 22:53:14'),
(43, 1, 5, 3, 'Ramesh Kumar', 'rameshkumarkoishik@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'We hired ShiftingPort for our office relocation and were thoroughly impressed. They packed all electronics, documents and furniture with proper labeling and ensured nothing was misplaced. The move was completed faster than expected. Great job by the entire team!', NULL, '2025-06-24 07:09:26', '2025-06-24 22:53:17'),
(44, 1, 5, 4, 'Sejal bansal', 'seju@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I had a great experience relocating my car with Shiftingport. The process was smooth, timely and my car arrived safely without any issues. Highly recommended for stress-free vehicle shifting!', NULL, '2025-06-24 15:36:08', '2025-06-24 22:53:20'),
(45, 0, 5, 12, 'Neha Arora', 'nehaarora@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I recently shifted from Gurgaon to Noida and used ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. Honestly, i am really happy with their service. The team arrived on time, packed everything carefully and handled my furniture with full care. No damages, no delays and no extra charges. Very professional staff and smooth experience. Highly recommended!', NULL, '2025-06-24 23:35:51', '2025-06-24 23:35:51'),
(46, 0, 4, 12, 'Anjali Deshmukh', 'anjali.deshmukh@outlook.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Good service overall. Packing was nice and the team was friendly. Only a small delay in arrival, but everything else was smooth.', NULL, '2025-06-24 23:37:26', '2025-06-24 23:37:26'),
(47, 0, 5, 2, 'Rohit Mishra', 'rohit4567890@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I had a very good experience with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers.', NULL, '2025-06-24 23:53:39', '2025-06-24 23:53:39'),
(48, 0, 5, 51, 'Sneha Kulkarni', 'sneha.kulkarni27@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I had a wonderful experience with ShiftingPort in Mumbai. The team arrived on time, packed everything professionally and ensured safe delivery without any damage and behavior was polite and pricing was fair. I will definitely recommend them to friends and family.', NULL, '2025-06-25 14:56:46', '2025-06-25 14:56:46'),
(49, 0, 5, 51, 'Arjun Desai', 'arjun.desai88@yahoo.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Shiftingport\'s service was excellent. The entire shifting was done on time and without any hassle. All the items were packed carefully and nothing was broken or lost. Their team worked in a professional manner which made the moving easy.', NULL, '2025-06-25 15:03:20', '2025-06-25 15:03:20'),
(50, 0, 5, 5, 'Rajesh Kumar', 'rajesh.kumar03@example.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ShiftingPort made my bike relocation easy and worry free. The team handled my bike with great care and delivered it safely on time. Highly recommended!', NULL, '2025-06-27 12:26:24', '2025-06-27 12:26:24'),
(51, 1, 5, 30, 'Payal', 'payalsharma70511@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Excellent service! Safe, timely, and hassle-free shifting. Highly professional team. Fully satisfied with ShiftingPort Packers and Movers!', NULL, '2025-06-28 08:10:14', '2025-06-29 09:02:25'),
(52, 0, 5, 1, 'Prerna', 'prernasingla@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Great experience with ShiftingPort!\r\nThe team was punctual, professional and handled everything with care. My move was smooth and stress-free. Highly recommended!', NULL, '2025-06-29 23:34:47', '2025-06-29 23:34:47'),
(53, 0, 5, 30, 'Dr. Bhatnagar', 'sumitbhatnagar338@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I recently hired ShiftingPort Packers and Movers to shift my household goods from Panipat to Delhi and their team came on time, packed the goods properly and delivered on time in a safe manner and the whole shifting was done smoothly without any hassle. I am very happy with their service and recommend Shifting Port Packers and Movers to others too.', NULL, '2025-07-03 10:12:39', '2025-07-03 10:12:39'),
(54, 0, 5, 30, 'Deepak Chaudhary', 'deepakchaudhary0089@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Panipat handled my move from Karnal to Delhi very well and team was skilled and ensured that no items were damaged. Their service is reliable and I will definitely choose them again in the future.', NULL, '2025-07-03 10:16:23', '2025-07-03 10:16:23'),
(55, 0, 5, 12, 'Anita Verma', 'anitavermaboutique@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I used the services of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers for shifting from Gurgaon to Chandigarh. Everything was packed properly and delivery was safe and on time and staff was polite and cooperative. I strongly recommend their services.', NULL, '2025-07-03 10:19:03', '2025-07-03 10:19:03'),
(56, 0, 5, 14, 'Vikram Singh', 'vikramsingh338@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I recently shifted my household goods from Delhi to Noida using ShiftingPort Packers and Movers Service and the entire process was smooth and well-organized. The packing was strong and the delivery was timely and it was a very good experience.', NULL, '2025-07-03 10:21:30', '2025-07-03 10:21:30'),
(57, 0, 5, NULL, 'SANDEEP SHARMA', 'sandysharma46@gmail.com', 'dntrbt', 'manager', NULL, 'good', NULL, '2025-07-03 19:48:35', '2025-07-03 19:48:35'),
(59, 0, 5, 62, 'Ranjeet Singh', 'ranjeetsinghdillo@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'I shifted from Palam Vihar to Sector 47 Gurgaon with the help of ShiftingPort Packers and Movers. The team came on time, packed everything nicely and moved all my things safely.', NULL, '2025-07-07 00:38:41', '2025-07-07 00:38:41'),
(60, 0, 5, 65, 'Rohit Arora', 'rohit_arora_1456@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"ShiftingPort did our shifting from DLF Phase 3 to Sector 42 in a very professional manner. Packing was excellent, staff was on time and all items were delivered safely. 3 BHK shifting was done in 6 hours without any hassle. Highly recommended!\"', NULL, '2025-07-11 09:45:58', '2025-07-11 09:45:58'),
